<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JER" style="id">Jeremiah</book>
  <para style="h">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Jeremiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin gam a Anathoth khua a siampute lak a mi Hilkiah tapa Jeremiah thute;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa, Ammon tapa Josiah hunlai, a vaihawm kum sawmlehthumna ah a kiang ah Toupa thu a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah kumpipa, Josiah tapa Jehoiakim vaihawmlai in leng a hongtung a; Judah kumpipa Josiah tapa Zedekiah kum sawm leh kum khatna tawp, Jerusalem sal a pi kha ngana tan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Gil sung a k’on bawl ma in k’on thei a, sul a kipan a na pawtkhiak ma in leng k’on koihtuam a, namte kiang a zawlnei din k’on sepkhin” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan ken, “E, Toupa Pathian, ngai dih, thu ka gen siam kei, ka naupang ngal a” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah hichi in a chi a: “Ka naupang, chi ken, k’on sawlna peuhmah kiang ah na hoh ding a, k’on thupiak peuhmah na gen ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amau ziak in lau kenla, nang hon honkhe ding in na kiang ah ka om hi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n a honsawk a, ka kam a khoih a, Toupa’n ka kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ngai in, na kam ah ka thute ka koihta, en dih, namte leh kumpipa gamte tung ah, botkhe ding, phel ding, hihse ding, paikhe ding, bawlhoih ding leh ding khesak ding in tuni in k’on koih na hi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huailou leng Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a, “Jeremiah, bang na mu?” a chi hi. Ken, “Vaisuaklu sing hiang ka mu” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n ka kiang ah, “Na mu kha mahmah ve: ka thu tangtun ding in ka kigalging gige ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan Toupa thu a nihveina din ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn a “Bang na mu a?” chi in. Ken bel, “Bel sou bolhbolh, a gong mallam nga ka mu” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n ka kiang ah hichi in a chi a: Gam a tengte tung ah mallam a kipan thil hoihlou a hongtung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai dih, mallam kumpipa gam nam tengteng ka sam ding; chih Toupa thupawt ahi; a hongpai ding ua, Jerusalem kongpi lutna ah, a kimvel kulh bang tengteng chin ah leh Judah khopi teng ah a mangtutphah uh a tung chiat ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hon paisan ua, pathian dangte kiang ah gimlim a hal ua: amau khutsuak mah a bia ua; hiai a thulimlouhna teng tungtang ua ka thugelte ka phuang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaiziak in puan teng inla, thou inla, k’on thupiak teng a kiang uah vagen in; a ma uah lunglel kenla, huchilou in zaw a ma uah k’on lunglel sak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngai in, tuni in nang, a gam pumpite, Judah kumpipate, a heutute, a siampute leh a gam mipite dou in khopi kulh a um leh sik khuam leh dalsik khuam in k’on bawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A honsual ding ua, himahleh a hon zou kei ding uh: hon honkhe ding in na kiang ah ka om hi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a, hichi in a chi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kuan in, Jerusalem zak in kikou in, Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Na tuailai a na migitdante, kikham lai a n’on itdante ka theigige hi; gamdai a khohlouh gam a na honzuih dan bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel bel Toupa adia hihsiangthou, a gah pung masa ahi, amah negaimi peuhmah a mawh ding a, a tung uah siatna a hongtung ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Jakob inkawte leh Israel inkaw tengteng aw, Toupa thu ngaikhia un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi hi: Na pipute un kei ah diktatlouhna bang ahia a muh uh, kei a kipan gamlapi ah a vakmang ua, bangmahlou a delh ua, a na kiotsak uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa , Aigupta gam a kipan hon pikhia a, gamdai, gamkeu, kawkhuk mun, sihna limliap leh gamkeu mun, kuamah paisuak ngeilouhna, kuamah omlouhna mun a honpi paisuakpa koi ah? a chi sam kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gam hoihtak ah, a gah leh hoihna ne ding in, k’on pilut a, himahleh na lut uleh ka gam na hihnin ua, ka goutan thil kihhuai in na bawl uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siampute’n, Toupa koi ah? a chi kei ua, Dan zangmite’n a honthei sam kei uh, vaihawmmite ka tung ah a hel ua, zawlneite’n Baal min in thu a gen ua, thil phatuamlou dingte a delh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in k’on lang ding a, na tate uh ta nawnte leng ka lang lailai ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kittim tuikulh ah vahoh unla, en un, Kedar ah mi sawl unla, chiktak in ngaihtuah un, hichibang thil a om ngeina hiam theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Namte’n a pathian uh a kheng uhia, pathian tak hiloupi leng? Ka mite’n bel a thupina uh, thil phatuamlou tak in a khek uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw vante, lamdang sa unla, hon mulkim sak henla, mau tuaituai un, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka mite’n thil nih a hihkhial uhi: kei, hinna tuikhuk a honpai san ua, tuiching theilou ding tuivungte a toukhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel sikha ahi hia? Sikha mawng a piang hia? Bangdia nuaisiah a om ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Humpinelkai tuailaite’ ham khum in, a tung ah aw a suah ua, a gam a hihgawp khinta uh, a khopite leng luahmi neilou in a kang siang khin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nophmi leh Tahpanhes mite’n, na luzang a giausak khinta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian in lampi a a honpi lai a, na taimangsan ziak in, huai na tung a na tunsak ahi kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nile tui dawn ding a Aigupta lampi na zuih, nang ding a bang a phatuam a? Luipi tui dawn ding a Assuria lampi na zuih, nang din bang phatuam a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na thulimlouhna in hon thuaksak ding a, na nungkinna in nang a honsal ding hi; hon launa neilou Toupa na Pathian na paisan a, thil gilou tak leh kha mahmah ahi na hih, na theikhia inla, mu telta in, chih Toupa , Sepaihte Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nidanglai apan na hakkol hihtan in, na khaute leng na hihtatta hi, Na nna ka sem nawn kei ding, na chi a, tang sangte, singbawk nuai ah, na hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chi dik zang in grep hoih mahmah k’on phut a, bangchidan a kikheng a, kei dia grep taklou hongsuakta na hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tangal in kisil in sahbon tampi kinuh in, na thulimlouhna ka mitmuh in a dawk hi, chih Toupa Pathian thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka kihihnin sam a, Baalte ka delh sam a, bang achia chi thei na hia, guam kuak a na omdante en inla, na thilhihsate thei in; sangawngsau la huk diang ngongngong na hi vele.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gam sabiltung gamdai a om, a huklai a dak uau uau a dik vutvut bang; a utna kuan ahia dalzou ding? A zawngmi kihihgim nuam dah leh, a hun in a mu na ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na khe ah khedap bunlou in om kenla, na dang leng hul kei heh; nang bel, lamet a beita, pautuam mite ka ngai a, amau ka delh ding, na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Guta a phawk ua a zum bang in, Israel inkawte a zumta uh, amau, a kumpipate uh, a heutute uh, a siampute uh, a zawlneite uleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Singbul kiang a, Ka pa na hi, chi a, suangbul kiang a, Kei honsuang na hi, chi mite: masuan lou in a dekkhuk sah uh a honsuan zaw ua, a mangbat hun un bel, Thou inla, hon hondam tanla, a chi ding uh, na pathian, huai na bawlte koi a om ahita ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amau thou zaw uhenla, na mangbat lai in a hon hondam kha theimoh ding uhia; aw Judah, na pathiante bel na khopite zah mah ahi ve ua oi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bangdia ka tung a vui nak? Na vek un ka tung ah thil na hihkhial ngal ua, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na tate uh ka khen a, a phatuam kei, a hoih loh tuankei uh; humpinelkai duhgawl bang mai in, noumau namsau in na zawlneite uh a ne khin uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aw khangthakte aw, Toupa thu thei un, Israel adin gamdai gam bang ka hi maw? Mial sah meuhmouh gam ka hi maw? Ka mite’n bangdia, ka pawt kichianta ua, ka hong kiknawn kei ding uh, chi uh ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nungak in a kizephoihnate a mangngilh thei in, mouthak in a kivatna a mangngilh thei ding maw? Ka mite’n ni simsenglouh sung in a hon na mangngilhta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Deihtakmi muh theihna ding in na omdan ngentel na chia! Numei gilou kiang ah leng na omdan na sinsakta ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na nikte ah leng mi genthei poikhoihloute hinna sisan a lang a: na inn a buluh lai khutmat ahi kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka mawh kei a, kei a kipan a hehna lakmang ahi, na chi nawn ngal a, ngai in, Ka gilou kei hi, na chih ziak in, na tungthu ka ngaihtuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na omdan kheng mengmeng a, bangdia vialvak vak na hia? Assuria na zumpih bangmah in, Aigupta leng na zumpih lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Na khutte lukhuk in a kiang ua pan na pawt khe nawn dia, Toupa’n lah na muannate a paikheta ngal a, amau ah na lamzang kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Min zi ma henla, a zi in paisan in pasal dang nei leh, aman a na nei nawn diam? A gam in nitloh hial lou ding hia? chih a om. Nang bel tangval tampi kiang ah na hukmang in, huchipi in ka kiang ah na hongkik nawn ding maw? chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tang giau viauvuau lam ah na mitte lengtou sak inla, en in, a hon luppih louhna mun koi ah? Gamdai a Arabia mi bang mai in amau ngak in lampi gei te ah na tu nilouh sek, na hukna leh na thulimlouhnate in gam na hihnin khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaiziak in vuah zuksak ahi kei a, vuah nanung leng a zu sam kei; mihuk talpuak in na pua, na zum hetkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka pa, ka tuailai a honpipa na hi, chi in, tua kipan in na sam kei ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na heh tawntung ding ahia? A thangpaihna a omden ding ahia? Ngai in, huchibang in na pau ngei a, himahleh a gilou thei bangpen in thil na hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai lou leng Josiah vaihawm lai in Toupa’n ka kiang ah hichi in a chi a: Nungkin hat Israel thilhih na mu hia? Tang sang chih a kuantoua, singbawk chih nuaite a a hukna thil a hihte?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan ken bel hiai thil tengteng a hihnung in ka kiang ah a hongkik nawn ding, ka chi a; himahleh a hongkik tuankei; huchi in, a sanggamnu, khemhat Judah in a mu samta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman nungkin hat Israel a angkawm ziak a ka mak a, makna lai ka piak a muh in leng a sanggamnu, khemhat Judah in a lau tuankei, huchih naksang in a vahoh a, hukna thil a va hihteita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan a huk mawkmawk zenhouh ziak in gam a hihnin khinta a; singbul, suangbul kiang ah ang a kawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchipi in leng a sanggamnu, khemhat Judah lungtangtaka ka kiang a hongkik lou in a zuaulel in a hongkik a, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan Toupa’n ka kiang ah hichi in a chi a: Nungkin hat Israel in a sanggamnu, khemhat Judah sang in diktat zaw in a kihih lang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kuan inla, hiai thu mallam ah vaphuang in; Nungkin hat Israel hongkik in, chih Toupa thupawt ahi; Heh melpu in k’on enkei ding a, zahngaithei tak ka hi ngal a, chih Toupa thupawt ahi, ka heh tawntung kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian tung a na helnate, singbawk nuai a pautuam mite kiang a na kiphal gaihnate, ka paukam suak na manlouhnate a na thulimlouhna ah thupha tawi in, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw nungkin hat tate aw, hongkik un, chih Toupa thupawt ahi. Nou hon honpa ka hi ngal a, na lak ua kipan khopi a mi khat, inkuan a mi nih ka honla ding a, Zion ah ka honpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka lungtuak lamtak belamchingte k’on pe ding a, amau theihna leh theihsiamnate in nou a honvak ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in na hongtam ua, gam a na hongpun chiang un, huai ni chiang in amau, Toupa thukhun bawm, a chi ngei nawn kei ding uh; a lungsim uah a lut kei ding a, theih leng a theigige sam kei ding uh; a khelah nawn kei ding ua, a bawl nawn kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huai nung in Jerusalem bel Toupa mangtutphah a chi ding ua, huai ah nam tengteng Toupa min in Jerusalem ah a hong paikhawm ding uh: a lungtang gilou khauhna uh bang in a paita kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Judah inkawte Israel inkawte toh a omkhawm ding ua, mallam gam a kipan in, na pipute uh kiang a gouluah ding a ka piak gam ah, a hong pawtkhe ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ken bel, Nam tampite lak a gouluah ding hoih pen, gam nuam tak honpia in, tate lak a honkoih ka utdan! Ka pa, chi a n’on sap a, n’on zuihna a kipan na pial mang kei ding chih ka na um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zi khemhat pasal angkawm san bang in, Aw Israel inkawte aw, honkhem neita ve ua, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tang giau velvul tung ah husa a om hi, Israel tate kap leh thil ngen husa, Toupa Pathian a mangngilh ua, a omdan uh a hihgawp ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A nungkin hat tate aw, hongkik unla, na nungkin seknate uh ka hihdam ding hi: en dih, na kiang ah ka hongpai uhi, nang Toupa ka Pathian uh na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tangte a hotdamna lamet a thawn ahi, tang tung a husa chiak vengvungte; Israel hotdamna zaw Toupa i Pathian kia ah ahi a om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Himahleh huai thil kihhuai mahmah in i tuailai a kipan i pipute’n tha a sukbeina uh a ne beita hi; a belamhonte uh, a ganhonte uh, a tanute uh, a tapate uh tan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zum in lum ni e, i zahlakna in honkhuh heh; Toupa i Pathian tung ah thil i hihkhial ua, ei leh i pipute’n i tuailai a kipan tunitan in Toupa i Pathian paukam i mang kei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Israel, na hongkik leh, ka kiang ngei ah n’ongkik ding ahi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi. Na kihhuainate ka mitmuh louh a na koihmang a, chihtaktak a, thugel diktak zang a diktattak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa a hin laiteng, chi a na kichiam leh, namte amah ah nuamsa a kichi ding ua, amah a suangta ding uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah mite leh Jerusalem kiang ah Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi hi: Na lei sit uh let unla, lingte lak ah chi theh kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nou Judah gam a mi leh Jerusalem a tengte aw, Toupa ading in na zek uh sum unla, na lungtang zek uh sum un, huchilou in zaw na thil gilou hihte uh ziak in, ka hehna mei bang in a pawtkhe ding a, kuamah phelh theihlouh in a kang kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judah gam ah hilh unla, Jerusalem ah phuang un, Gam pumpi ah pengkul mut unla, ngaihtak in kikou un. Hong kikhawm unla, kulhnei khopite ah i lut ding uh, chi un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion lam ah puanzak khai unla, bitna zong in tai unla, zekai kei un, mallam apan thil hoihlou k’on tungsak ding, nakpi a siatna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gammang nuai ningkitel a kipan in humpinelkai a pawt hi, namte hihse ding; a mun a kipan a pawtta, a hongpai lellel hi, na gam hihse ding leh na khopite tengmi neilou khop a sugawp ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaiziak in saiip puan teng unla, kap un, mau vongvong un; i lak ua kipan in Toupa hehna thupi lah a kikai khe ngal kei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in hichi a honghi ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi: kumpipa lungtang a lungke khin ding a, heutute lungtang leng; siampute’n gen ding a theikei ding ua, zawlneite’n lamdang a sa ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan ken, Ah, Toupa Pathian, hiai mite leh Jerusalem nakpitak a khem nei ve, Muanna na nei ding uh, na chi a, namsau in hinna a sun zawta hi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in hiai mite leh Jerusalem kiang ah, “Gamdai tang giau velvul a kipan huih sa, Ka tanu, ka mite zapsiang ding hilou; siangsak ding hi sam lou;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huih hat lua, ka thu in a hongtung ding ahi: tuin leng a tungthu uh ngaihtuahpa kei ka hi” chih ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngai dih, a hong paitou ding, meipi bang in, a kangtalai pingpei bangmaite; a sakolte muvanlai sang in a hatzaw uh, i tung gik na e! Buluh a om i hive ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem, thulimlouhna a kipan na lungtang silsiang inla, hotdam a na om theihna ding in; bang tan ahia na ngaihtuahna gilou na pai ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dan gam a kipan aw a hong pawtkhia a, Ephraim tang a kipan in thil hoihlou a phuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Namte hilh unla, Jerusalem ah phuang un, ngai dih, gam gamlapi a kipan sualmite a hongtung uh, Judah khopite tung ah a aw uh a suah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Louma vengmite bang mai in a kimvel in a um ua, ka tung a a hel ziak un chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na omdan leh na thilhihte’n, hiaite na tung ah a tun ahi, hiai na siatna ding ahi, a na mahmah a na lungtang sun eive.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ka lung a na, ka lung a na, ka lungtang mahmah a na, ka sung ah ka lungtang a buaita a, ka om maimai theikei, aw ka hinna, pengkul ging, kidouna husa ka zak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siatna tung ah siatna a tungta, gam pumpi loh in a omta, ka puaninte a hihse guih ua, ka puanzakte leng mitphiat kal lou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bang tan ahia kidouna puanzak ka muh ding a, pengkul ging ka zak ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka mite a hai mahmah ua lah a thei ngal kei ua, naupang haitak, theihna neilou bang mai ahi ua, thil gilou hih a siam ua, thil hoih hihdan a siam kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Leitung ka et leh, ngai dih, segawp leh vuak in a om a; vante’n vakna a neikei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tangte ka et leh, ngai in, a ling uh, mual tengteng leng a tang zualzual uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka et leh, ngai in, mihing a omkei ua, tungleng vasate a leng mangkhinta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka et leh, ngai in, louma hoihte gamdai a suakkhin a, khopite leng a chim khin, Toupa leh a heh mahmahna ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi hi: Gam pumpi a segawp ding, himahleh ka hihtawp tawntung kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huaiziak in lei in a sun ding a, tunglam vante leng a mial ding: thu ka genta a, ka tumta hi, ka kisik kei a, ka lunghei kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sakol tung a tuang leh thalpeu zangmite husa ah, khopi pumpi a taikek ua, gammang ah a lut ua, khaw chih a nusia ua, luahmi khat lel leng omlou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huan nang, loh a na om hun chiang in bangchi’n na hihdia? Puan sanau a kizem in, kivatna dangkaeng a kivan in, na mitte nuh mahle chin, na kihih lawm thawn ahi, na tangvalte’n a hon simmawh ding ua, na hinna lak a tum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Numei nauvei kikou husa ka za, tachil neinu thuaklai, Zion tanu nakging, a khutte zak a, Ka tung gik hina mai e! tualthatmite ma ah ka hinna a bah khinta” chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem kholakte ah vial tai unla, chiamteh unla, a mual tamte zong unla, mi khat bek diktattak a hih a, thutak zong mahmah na muhtheih uleh, Jerusalem ka ngaidam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa a hin a a hin sung, chimahle uh, zuau in a kichiam lel uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Toupa , thutak na muhnop ahi ka hia? Amau na sat a, himahleh a lungkham tuankei uh, amau na hihmang a, na thuzohna a pom nuam tuankei uh, suangpi sang a sak in a tal uh a taksak ua, a kilehhei nuam kei bikbek uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ken, hiaite mi phalou, a hai lai ua, Toupa dan, a Pathian uh thugel a theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Miliante kiang ah ka hohta ding a, ka houpih ding a, amau zaw Toupa dan leh Pathian thugelte a thei uh, a chi a. Himahleh hiai mite’n thukhat sat in, hakkol a hihtan ua, henna khau a hihtat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in gammang nuai a humpinelkai in amau a kei ding a, gamdai ngia in amau a ne bei ding a, gialbem in a khopite a tang a, huai a hongpawt peuhmah a bawtzan ding: a tatleknate uh a tam a, a nungkinnate uh a thupi mahmah ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangchi’n k’on ngaidam thei dia? Na tate’n a hon paisan ua, Pathian loupite sam in a kichiam ua, taitak a ka vak nung in ang a kawm ua, kizuak innte ah a kivel hehu uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zingsang lam sakol vak vah bang mai ahi ua, michih amah invengpa zi enlah in a ham uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hiai thilte ziak in ka gawt kei ding maw? chih Toupa thupawt ahi. Hichibang nam tung ah phu ka kilaksak kei ding ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A gawlte ah kah lut unla, hihsia un, himahleh hihse khin vek kei un, a hiangte lamang un, Toupa a lah ahi ngal kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel inkawte leh Judah inkawte’n ka tung ah lepchiahtak in a hih uh, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa bel zuauthei dia sep in, “Bangmah a hih thei sam kei ding, siatna i tung uah a tung kei ding, kial hiam namsau hiam i thuak kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zawlneite leng huihzam lel ahi ding ua, amau ah thu a omkei a; a tung uah hichibang a hih ahi ding, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Toupa , Sepaihte Pathian in a chi: Huchibang thu na gen ziak un, ngai in, na kam a ka thute mei ka suaksak ding a, hiai mipi singte a kangkhin ding.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai un, aw Israel inkawte aw, gamlapi a kipan, nam khat na kiang ah ka honpi ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi. Nam hattak, nam ni danglai a kipan a, a pau uh na theihlouh, a thugen uh na theihlouh namte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A thal bawm uh han kihong ahi a, avek un mi hattak ahi khin uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na buh laksa leh na nek ding a nekhinvek ding uh; na tanute na tapate nekding mahmah: na ganhonte, na belamhonte a ne ding ua, na grepguite, na theipi kungte a ne ding ua, na khopi kulhnei, na muanpi pente mahmah namsau in a hihse ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Himahleh huai nite ah leng k’on hih chimit kei ding” chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hichi a honghi ding a, Bangding a Toupa i Pathian un hiai thil tengteng i tung ua hih ahia? Na mite un a chih hun chiang un, N’on paisan ua, na gam ua pathian dangte nna na sep bang un, na gam lou uah, paudang mite nna na sem ding uh, a kiang uah na chi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Jakob inkawte lak ah hiai genkhia unla, Judah gam ah phuang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aw theihtheihna neilou, mihaite aw, mit nei a lah mu lou, bil nei a lah zaloute aw, hiai ngaikhia un”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“N’on kihta kei uh maw?” chih Toupa thupawt ahi, Ka ma ah na ling kei ding uh maw? Kei, tuipi huap chiang a dia piautak, tangtawn a a let louhna ding a daikaihna, tuipi kihot zou mahleh a let tuan theihlouha, ging honhon mahleh a khen theihlouh ding bawlpa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh hiai mite’n lungtang paupeng leh helhat a pu ua, a hel ua, a taimangta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A lungtang un leng, Toupa i Pathian, a huntak a vuah masa leh vuah nanung zusakpa, buh leh hunbi hon sehsakpa laudan i siam ding uh, a chi sam kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hiai thilte na thulimlouhnate un a hihmang a, na khelhnate un thil hoih nou a hontan sak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ka mite lak ah migilou a om ngal ua, vasa gemmi in a tan bang in a tang gige ua, thang a kam ua, mite a man uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bawm vasa a dim bang mai in, a innte uh khemna in a dim a, huaiziak in a honglian ua, a hong hauhsak lohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A hongthau ua, a hongzol ua, ahi, a gitlouhna thilhihte un hun chiang a neikei, pa neiloute lamzanna ding in amau lam ah a pang kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hiai thilte ziak in ka gawt kei dia hia? chih Toupa thupawt ahi: Hichibang nam tung ah ka hinna in phu a lakei ding ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huai gam ah thil lamdangtak leh mulkimhuaitak a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Zawlneite’n zuauthu a gen ua, siampute’n lah amau thuthu in vai a hawm ua, ka mite’n lah huchibang hih a ut uhi, a tawp ah bangchi’n na hih ding ua leh?”
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin tate aw, Jerusalem sung a kipan na bitna ding un tai mang unla; Tekoa ah pengkul mut unla Beth Hakkerem ah theihsakna suaksak un. Mallam a kipan in siatna a hong kuan hi, hihsiatna thupi mahmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zion tanu melhoih tak leh nou tak ka hihmang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Belampute, a belamhonte utoh a kiang a hongtung ding ua, a kim ah a puaninte uh a kaih khum ding ua, amau mun chiat ah a ke ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah dou ding in kisa un, thou unla, sun lai in i sual ding uh, ei ading in khawk hina e! ni a kihektaa, nitaklam limliap a na sauta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thou unla, zan in i sual mai ding uh! a inn hoihhoih uh hihsia ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: A singte phuk unla, Jerusalem sualna ding in mualvum bawl un, khopi gawt ding pen hiai ahi, asung ah nuaisiahna ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuileh in tui a pawtsak bang mai in a gitlouhna a pawtsak sek, asung ah hiamgamna leh kilohna a om chih zak ahi, ka ma ah natna leh kiliamsaknate a om nilouh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka lungsim in a hon tuamsan vengveng ma in aw, Jerusalem, pilvang in, huchilou in zaw luahmi neilou gam dia honbawl in, k’on hihgawp kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Israel omsunte grep bang in lou siang vek unla, grep loumi bang in a hiangte ban tuantuan un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ngaihkhiak theihna ding un kua ka houpih in, kua ka theisak dia? Ngai in, bil lam zeksumlouh ahi ua, a ngaikhe theikei uh; ngai in, Toupa thu amau ading in thil simmohhuai ahi a, kipahna mahmah a nei nawn kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa hehna in ka dim a, kidek ka chimta; kholak a naupang tung ah ka bungkhe dia; tangval omkhawmte tung ah leng, a zi toh kiton in pasal leng lak ahi ding a, upate leh teksiate leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A innte uh midang kiang a piak ahi ding a, a loumate uleh a zite utoh; huai gam a tengte tung ah ka khut lik ding ka hi ngal a, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A neupen a kipan a lianpen tan in leng michih huaihamna in a dim ua; zawlneite leh siampute nasan leng, michih a zuautat mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka mite liam, awlmohlou tak in, A hoih ve, a hoih ve, a chi ua, a hoih hetkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thil kihhuai a hih un leng a zum ua hia? Zumlou hial, a zum hetkei uh, a mai uleng a san sam kei: huaiziak in pukte lak ah a puktei ding ua: amaute ka gawt hun chiang in paihkhiak in a om ding uh, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Lamka thuam ah ding unla, en un, lampi hoih omna lampi luite tawn un, huai ah pai unla, na kha ua ding in khawlna na mu ding uh” amau bel, “Huai ah ka pai kei ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan, nou ading in galvilmite ka sep ding a, “Pengkul ging ngaikhia un” chi in: amau bel, “Ka ngaikhe kei ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huaiziak in, “Aw, namte aw, ngaikhia unla, aw, khawmte aw, a tung ua hongtung ding thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw, leitung, ngaikhia in, ngai in, hiai mite tung ah siatna ka hontun ding: a ngaihtuahna gahte uh; ka thute a ngaihkhiak louh ziak un: ka dante lah a paikhe hithet ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangding a Sheba a kipan begaw, gamlapi a kipan kawltute ka kiang hongtung nak ahia? Na haltum kithoihnate uh kipahpihtak ahi kei a, na kithoihnate un a hon kipaksak sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Hiai mite kiang ah puknate ka koih ding a, huai ah pate a tapate utoh a puk khawm ding ua, inveng leh a lawm leng a mangthang ding uh” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n hichi in a chi: “Ngai in, mallam gam a kipan mite a hongpai uh, lei mun tawp a kipan nam thupi mahmah a hong kuankhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thalpeu leh teipi a tawi ua, hiamgam mahmah, zahngaihna himhim neilou ahi uhi, a husa uh tuipi ging honhon bang ahia; sakol tungte ah a tuang ua, michih galkapmi bang a kivan in, aw, Zion tanu, nang a hongsual dek uhi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“A minthanna uh i za ua, i khutte a zawkhinta, numei nauvei lunggimna bangbang lunggimna’n a hon manta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gam ah paikhe kei un, lampi ah leng pai sam kei un, huai ah lah melma namsau a om ngal a, kilchih ah launa a om hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Aw, ka mi, ka tanu, saiip puan teng inla, vut lak ah tubial in; tapa tangkhat sun bang in sun inla, kap vongvong dih, hihse mi i tung uah a hongtung guih dek ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka mite lak a chiamtehmi ding leh ze-etmi ding in k’on bawl a, a omdan uh na theih a, na ze-et theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Avek un helhat, paupeng mahmah gensiat ching a vialvak, dal leh sik bang ahi uh, hoihloupi in a gamtang uhi.,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pum in a zap huhu a, mei ah a suan zulbei a, hihsiangthou tupna a thawn lel ahi, migiloute lah paihmang ahi ngal kei ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mite’n dangkasik ek hoihlou a chi ding ua, Toupa amaute a pampaih ziak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa apan a Jeremiah kiang a thu hongtung:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa inn kongpi ah ding inla, huai ah hiai thu phuang inla, huchi in chi in: Nou Judah mi tengteng, Toupa be ding a hiai kongpi a lutte’n Toupa thu ngaikhia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Na omdan uleh na thilhihte uh bawlhoih unla, hiai mun ah k’on tengsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiai “ Toupa inn, Toupa inn, Toupa inn ahi” chih zuauthute um kei un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na omdan uleh na thilhihte uh na bawlhoih petmah ua, mi leh invengte kikal a thu diktak a na vaihawm sak ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Namdang mite, pa neiloute, meithaite na nuaisiah louh ua, hiai mun a midiktat sisan na suahlouh ua, na hoihlouhna ding ua pathian dangte na delh sam kei ua leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hiai gam, tuma siah a na pipute uh kiang a ka piak ah tangtawn in k’on tengsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai un, zuauthu, phattuamna om hetlou na um zaw ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gukgu in, tualthat in, angkawm in, zuau a kichiam in Baal kiang a gimlim hal in, pathian dang, na theih ngeilouhte uh na delh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiai inn, ka min mahmah a loh ah ka ma ah hong ding in, hiai thil kihhuai tengtengte hih zel kawm in, hotkhiak ka hita, na chi ding ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hiai inn ka min mahmah a loh, na mitmuh un suamhatte kawkhuk banglel ahi hia? Ngai un, kei, kei mahmah in ka mu hi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tung a ka min ka tensakna, ka mun Shiloh ah hoh dih ua, ka mi Israel gitlouhna ziak a ka thilhih va en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuin hiai thil tengteng na hih ua, phalvak a thou a na kiang ua thu ka gengente na ngaihkhiak louh ua, nou k’on sap a, na dawn louh ziak un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Shiloh tung a ka hih bang in hiai ka min lohna inn, noumau leh na pipute uh kiang a ka mun piak, na muan uh tung ah ka hih dek ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na unau tengteng uh, Ephraim nam pumpi nangawn ka paihkhiak bang in ka mitmuh a kipan nou k’on paikhe ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huaiziak in, hiai mite ading in thum kenla, kikou khia in thum kenla, ka kiang ah leng ngetsak sam ken; k’on ngaikhe kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah khopite a leh Jerusalem kholakte a a thilhih uh na mu ka hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naupangte’n sing a tom ua, a pate un mei a toh ua, numeite’n van kumpinu kiang a lat ding tanghou a mek ua, pathian dangte ding in dawn ding thillat a tungkhia ua, a hon hehsakna lel ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei ahi maw hon hehsak uh? chih Toupa thupawt ahi: amau zumna ding in amau ahizaw kei uh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi: Ngai dih uh, hiai mun tung ah ka hehna leh thangpaihna ka sungkhe ding a; a kang dia, a mit kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa , Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi: Na kithoihnate uah haltum kithoihnate behlap unla, sa ne un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Halmang thillat hiam, kithoihnate hiam tungthu ah zaw na pipute uh kiang ah thu ka gen kei a, Aigupta gam a kipan ka pikhiak lai in leng thu ka pe sam kei:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka aw ngaikhia unla, na Pathian uh ka hi ding a, nou leng ka mite na hi ding uh; na hoih theihna ding un na omdan ding uh k’on hilh tengteng zui un, chi in thu ka pe zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Himahleh a ngaikhe kei ua, bil a doh sam kei uh: a lungtang gilou uh hihnang in amau thuthu in a omzaw uh, malam zawt sang in a nungtawn zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na pipute uh Aigupta gam a kipan a pawt ni ua kipan a tunitan in ka nasemmi, zawlnei tengtengte phalvak a thou in na kiang uah niteng in ka sawl zel a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Himahleh a hon ngaikhe tuankei ua, bil a doh sam kei uh: a lungsim uh a khauhsak ua, a pipute uh sang in a gilou zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hiai thu tengteng a kiang ua na gen ding ahi: himahleh a hon ngaikhe kei ding ua; amau na sam ding a, a hon dawng kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A kiang uah, Hiai nam Toupa a Pathian uh aw ngaikhe lou a, thununna tanglou nam eive ua, na chi ding a: thudik a mangthangta, a kam ua kipan paihmang ahita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na sam tan inla, pai mang inla, mun sang giaute ah kapkhia in; Toupa’n a hehna tangmi suante paikhia in a ngeingaih kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Judah tate’n lah ka mitmuh in thil gilou a hih ngal uh chih Toupa thupawt ahi: ka minlohna inn ninsak ding in a thil kihhuaite uh a koih khin uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A tanute uh, a tapate uh hal ding in Ben Hinnom guam ah Taphet mun sangte a bawl ua; huaite ka thupiak ahi kei a, ka lungsim ah leng a lut ngei sam kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huaiziak in, ngai dih uh, nite a hongtung dek, chih Toupa thupawt ahi: huai guam pen, Tophet, chih ahi nawn kei ding a, Ben Hinnom guam, chih leng ahi sam kei ding; Kithahna guam, chih ahita ding: Tophet ah a vui ding ua, vuina ding mun a omta kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mite luang tung a leng vasate leh gamsate an ahi ding; kuamah in a delhmang kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Judah khopite ah leh Jerusalem kholakte ah nuamsa husate leh kipahna gingte, mouneipa awte, mou awte leng ka daisak ding: a gam segawp ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in, chih Toupa thupawt ahi: Judah kumpipate guhte, a heutute guhte, siampute guhte, zawlneite guhte, Jerusalem a tengte guhte a han ua kipan a lakhe ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nite, khate, van a om tengteng, a it ua, na a sep ua, a delh ua, a zon ua, chibai a bukte uh ma ah a phoukhe ding uh: lakkhawm ahi nawnta kei ding ua, vui ahi sam kei ding uh; leitung a ekvut lel ding ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hiai inkuan gilou mahmah omlai sung tengteng, ka hawlzakna mun a omlaite’n hin sang in sih a telzaw ding uh, chih sepaihte Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai lou leng a kiang uah huchi in na gen ding hi: Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Mi a puk un a thou nawn kei ding ua hia? Mi a vakmang in a hongkik nawn kei dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bang achia hiai Jerusalem mite, tangtawn a nungtawn ding a a tolhpuk uh? Khemna a len kip ua, kiknawn a ut kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka bildoh in ka ngaikhia a, kuamah in thudik a gen kei uh, kuamah in, Bang ahia ka hih? chi in a thulimlouhna uh a kisik sam kei uh; michih amau lampi a nga chiat ua, kidouna mun a sakol dianglut bang mai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi, van a tuivapi in a hunbite a thei a, vakhute, lensiamte, tuivanelkaite, a hun geihgeih in a hongtung zel uh. Ka mite’n bel Toupa thuseh a theikei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangchi’n ahia, mi pil i hi ua, Toupa dan i kiang uah a om, na chih uh? Ngai un, Laigelhmi laigelhna zuauthei in, zuau in a suaksak zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mipilte a zum un a lungdong ding ua, mat in a om ding uh; ngai un, Toupa thu a paikhia ua, amau ah bang pilna a om a ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaiziak in a zite uh midangte kiang ah ka pe ding a, a loute uh leng a hon neimi dingte kiang ah; michih, a neupen a kipan a thupipen tan in en hat ahi uhi. Zawlnei a kipan a siampu tan in leng michih khemhat ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka tanu, ka mite liam awlmohlou tak in, A hoih a ka, a hoih a ka, chi in a thoih ua, lah a hoih hetkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thil kihhuai a hih uh a zum uhia? Ii, a zum hetkei ua, a mel uh leng a san kei. Huaiziak in pukte lak ah a puk tei ding ua, amaute gawt hun chiang in paikhiak in a om ding uh chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amau ka hihmang vek ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi: grepguite a gah kei ding a, theipi kungte a gah sam kei ding; a nah leng a vuai ding a, amaute tummang dingte ka sep khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangdia tu lailai i hi ua? Ki kaikhawm unla, khopi kulhneite ah lut unla, huai ah i mangthang diam ding uh; Toupa tung a i gitlouh tak ziak in; Toupa i Pathian un gutui dawn ding honpia in manthatna ah a hon koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Muanna i zong ua, hoihna bangmah a hongtung kei, hihdamna hun ding leng, ngai in, lungdonna lel!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A sakol nak ging uh Dan a kipan a zak ahi a, a sakol uh ham ging in gam pumpi a ling a, a hongtung ua, asung a om teng, a gai vek ua, khopi leh asung a tengte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai un, na lak uah gulpi ka sawl ding a, gul gu nei, khoizual vuallouhte: huaite’n nou a hontu ding ua, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw lungkhamna ah ki lungmuan thei leng aw! sunggil ah ka lungtang a bahkhinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai un, gam gamlapi a kipan, ka tanu, ka mite kap husa, Zion ah Toupa a om ka hia? Asung a a Kumpipa omlou ahi maw? milim bawltawmte leh namdang milimte in bang achia hon hehsak ahi ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Buh lak hun a kikhelta, nipi a beita, hotdam in i omkei lailai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka mite, ka tanu natna ah ka na a, ka sun a, lungdonna in a honlen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gilead a singnai damdawi omlou hia? huai ah hihdammi a om ka hia? bangdia ka mite, ka tanu damtheilou ahia?
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka lu tui hi in, ka mit khitui nak hi le aw, ka mi, ka tanu thahte ading in a sun a zan in ka kap ding,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gamdai ah khualbuk nei thei leng aw! ka mite paisan in, om mangsan leng aw; angkawmhat mi ahivek ngal ua, khemhat omkhawm lel ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lei uh thalpeu bang in zuau in a zang ua, gam ah a khanglian ua, thutak a khang lou in, gilou lam ah a khang ua, kei hon theilou in, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Noumau inveng lak ah pilvang chiat unla, na unaute himhim uh muang kei un; unaute lah khemhat ahi ngal ua; invengte leng gensiat hat ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amau inveng chiat a khem ding ua, thudik a gen kei ding uh; a lei uh zuaugen a kisinsak ua, thulimlouhna sem in a gim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khemhat lak ah na teng a, a khemna uh ziak in kei a honthei nuam kei uh, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngai un, amau ka tuisuak sak dia, ka ze-et ding: ka mi, ka tanu ziak in bang dang ahia ka hih tak ding aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A lei uh sihna thal ahi a, khemna thu a gen zel, mi’n kam in invengte kiang ah kituahna thu gen mahleh, a lungtang ah amah a tang giugiau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hiai thilhihte ziak in ka gawt kei dia hia? chih Toupa thupawt ahi: nam hichibang tung ah phu ka lakei dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tangte ading in ka kap dia, ka mau vungvung ding, gamdai loupa munte ka sun ding a, kuamah pai nawnlouhna ding a a kat khittak ziak in, gan husa mite’n a za nawnta kei ding ua, tung a leng vasate leh gamsate leng a taikek ua, a pai mangta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan Jerusalem bel thilsia omkhawm lel in ka bawl dek a, sehalte tenna mun ahi ding; Judah khopite tengmi omlou in ka hihgawp ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hiai theisiam ding in mi pil kua ahia? Phuang ding a Toupa thugen na sangmi pen kua ahia? Bangziak in ahia gam a siat khit a, kuamah pai louhna ding a gamdai bang a a kat khit?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n , Ka dan, a ma ua ka koih a paisan ua, ka pau kamsuak a mang kei ua, a zui kei ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a lungtang khauh uh zui a, a pipute un a sinsak uh Baalte a delh zawktak ziak un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa , Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi: Ngai un, amau, hiai mite mahmah gamsai in ka vak ding a, tui kha leng ka dawnsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nam, amau leh a pipute un leng a theih ngeilouhte lak ah ka dalhsak ding a; ka hih manthat vek mateng namsau ka delhsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngaihtuah unla, numei kap mite hongpai ding in sam un, numei khutsiamte hongpai ding in sam lai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hongkin uhenla, hong kahkhum peuhmah le uh, ka khitui a luan a, i mitte ua tui a pawt theihna din.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zion a kipan kah husa zak ahi ngal a, i naksiat khittak dan uh: gen ding i thei mahmah kei ua, i gam i paisan ziak uleh, i tennate a paihkhiaktak ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw nou numeite aw, Toupa thu ngaikhia unla, a kamsuak thu na bil uah lut henla, na tanute uh kah sinsak unla, michih in a invengnu kiang ah sunna la.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I tawlet uahte sihna kal lut in i kumpipa inn uahte a lutta hi, inn pawlam a kipan a naupang hihmang ding leh, kholak a kipan a tangval hihmang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa thupawt in hichi in a chi: Mi luangte gamlak ah ekvut bang in a puk ding ua, buhlami buhmaih bang in; kuamah in a lakhawm kei ding, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Mi pil in a pilna suang kei henla mihat in a hatna suang sam kei hen, mi hau in a sum leh pai suang kei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A suang peuhmah in hiai suang hen, Kei Toupa , chitna, vaihawmdikna, diktatna lei a zangpa ka hi chih a theih a, a theihsiamna tak; hiai thilte ka kipahlam ahi ngal a, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ngai un, nite a hongtung hi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi, zeksum hi ngal, sumlouh bang zaw ka gawt ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aigupta, Judah, Edom, Ammon leh Moab, gamdai a teng, baksam met giaute; nam tengteng zeksumlouhte ahi ngal ua, Israel inkaw tengteng leng lungtang a zeksumlouh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, Israel inkawte aw, na kiang ua Toupa thugen ngaikhia un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Namte omdan ching kei unla, van a chiamtehnate ziak in leng lunglau sam kei un; namte huaite ah a lunglau nak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mite dante bangmahlou ahi ngal a, Gamnuai ah sing a phuk ua, heipi a mi khutsiam khut in a sep ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dangkasik leh dangkaeng in a zem ua, a tat louhna ding in sikkilhna leh sek in a kilh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leipi a vasa lau ding milim bang ahi ua, a pau theikei uh. Amau a pai theihlouh ziak un, puak suan a kiphamoh sek uh; amaute lau kei un, thilsia a hih theikei ua, thil hoih leng a hih thei sam kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Toupa , nang bang kuamah a omkei ua, na thupi a, na min hatna in a thang lian hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw namte kumpipa, kuan ahia hon kihta lou ding? Huai lah na tuakzou him ngal a. Namte mi pil tengteng lakte ah, a gam himhim lak uah leng, nang bang mahmah a omkei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amau khawksak neilou mihai ahi ua, manna bei sing milimte sinsak ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tarsis a kipan dangkasik sek a honla ua, Uphaz a kipan dangkaeng, mi khutsiam bawl, dangkaeng sekmi khutsuak, puansilh dumpuang leh sandup, mi khutsiam khutsuak vek ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa bel Pathian tak ahi, Pathian hing tangtawn Kumpipa ahi, a heh in lei a ling a, namte’n a hehna a nangzou kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kiang ua hichibang a na chih ding uh ahi: Pathian, lei leh van bawl hiloupi lei a kipan a mangthang ding ua, van nuai a kipan a mang vek ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thilhihtheihna in lei a bawl a, a pilna in khovel a tungdinga, a lemtheihna in van a kaipalh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A aw a suah leh, van ah tui a ging honhon a, kawlmong a kipan meipi a kahtousak a, vuah zukna ding in khua a phesak a, a goubawm a kipan huih a nungsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Michih a mawl ua, theihna a neikei uh, dangkaeng sekmiin a limsek a zumpih a, a milim sun lah zuau lel ahi a, amau ah hinna leng a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangmahlou ahi ua, khemna nasep lel, a gawt hun chiang un a mang ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jakob tantuan bel hichibang ahi kei, thil tengteng bul ahi ngal a; Israel a gouluah nam ahia, a min sepaihte Toupa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw nang, um a om lellel in, na puanthuah lei a kipan la khawm in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi ahi: Ngai un, tuin gam a tengte ka singkhe ding, a phawktham un ka hihgenthei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka natna ziak in ka tung a gik hi, ka liamna a na a, himahleh, Hiai hial haksatna ahi, ka thuak mai ding ahi, ka chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka puanin a seta, ka khau tengteng a kitat vek a, ka kiang a kipan ka tate a pawt ua, a om nawn kei uh: Ka puanin zak ding a omta kei uh, ka puanzak tungding dingte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Belamchingmite a mawl ua, Toupa a thudot dan a theikei uh; huaiziak in a lamzang kei ua, a belamhonte uh a dalhzak khinta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai un, mallam apan husa a hongtung, buaina thupi mahmah, Judah khopite hihgawp in, sehal tenna ding a suaksak ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw Toupa , mihing omdan bel, amah thu lel ahi kei chih ka theita hi: mihing a kalsuan amah kipi hilou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aw Toupa , hon thunun inla, a hunlel in, heh lou in, huchilou in zaw n’on hihmang kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pautuam mi, nang thei ngeiloute tung leh, na min lou ngeiloute tung ah na hehna bungkhia in; Jakob a nekhin ua, ahi, a nekhin ua, a nemang ua, a tenna gam a hihsia uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeremiah kiang a Toupa thu hongtung:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hiai thukhunte ngaikhia unla, Judah mite leh Jerusalem a tengte kiang ah gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang a kiang uah, Toupa Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi: Hiai thukhun thute ngaikhe loumi hamse thuak in om hen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai bel na pipute uh, Aigupta gam, sik haltuina a kipan a ka pikhiak ni a, ka pau kamsuak mang unla, thu ka honpiak tengteng hih un, chi a ka thupiak tak ahi: huchi in ka mite na hi ding ua, kei na Pathian uh ka hi ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na pipute uh kiang a khuaizu leh nawitu a luang gam kichiam a piak ka chiamtak ka tangtun theihna ding in tuni a a om bang in, hichi in a chi a. Huan, ken, “Amen, Aw Toupa ” chi’n ka dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n ka kiang ah: Judah khopite ah leh Jerusalem kholakte ah hiai thu tengteng puang inla, Hiai thukhunte ngaikhia unla, zui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na pipute un Aigupta gam a kipan ka pikhiak ni a kipan a tutan in ka paukam suak mang un, chi in ka theisak sek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh a mang kei ua, bil a doh sam kei ua, michih, amau lungtang gilou bangzel in a omzaw uh. Huaiziak in hiai thukhun thu, hih ding a thu ka piak, a hih louh tengteng uh a tung uah k’on tungsakta ahi, a chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n ka kiang ah: Judah mite leh Jerusalem a tengte lak ah phialgukna a om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A pipute uh, ka thu ngaikhe nuamloute thulimlouhna lam ah a kilehhei nawn ua; pathian dangte na sem ding in a kuan ua: Israel inkawte leh Judah inkawte’n a pipute uh kiang a ka thukhun bawl pen a hihseta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngai dih ua, a tung uah thil hoihlou, a pelh het louh ding uh k’on tungsak ding; a honsam ding ua, himahleh ka dawng kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan, Judah khopite leh Jerusalem a tengte’n pathian, a kiang ua gimlim a hal seknate uh a sam ding ua, himahleh a buai hun chiang un huaite’n amau a humbit hetkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Judah, na pathiante na khopi zah ahi ngal ua: thil zumhuai tak, Baal kiang a gimlim halna ding maitam hial leng Jerusalem kongzing zah in na ding sakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in hiaite thumsak kenla, amau ading in ngetna hiam aw hiam suah sam ken; a buai hun chiang ua a honsap uh leh ka ngaikhe kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thil kihhuai hih kawm in, ka deih mahmah in ka inn ah tantuam bang ahia a neih? Thu kichiamte leh sa tan in na siatna ding uh a hon pelsak thei ding ahia? Na suang thei ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa’n na min ding in olive sing hing, gah hoih kilawmpi, a honchi a, lum hon hon in a tung ah mei a toh a, a hiangte leng a kitan khinta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa , nang hon phutpa’n, Israel inkawte leh Judah inkawte khelhna, Baal kiang a gimlim lan a, hon hehsak thil uh, amau adia a sepkhiak tung ua thil hoihlou ding thu na tung ah a phuang kheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa’n hon theisak a, ka theita: huchi in nang mahmah in a thilhihte uh n’on kawkmuhta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Kei bel belamnou nunnem tak, goh ding a pi bang ka hi, sing pen a gah toh, hihsia ni e, mihing gam a kipan amah zaw i hihmang vengveng ding uh, a min mawngmawng theih a hih louhna ding in, chi a ka tung a a thil sawm uh ka na thei hetkei.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh, aw sepaihte Toupa , diktak a vaihawmpa, sunggil lam leh lungtang entelpa, a tung ua na phulak hon musak in, ka tungthu lah na kiang ah k’on kemsak hi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huaiziak in sepaihte Toupa’n Anathoth mi, na hinna zongpa, “Ka khut ua na sih louhna ding in Toupa min in thu gen ken” chi mite tungtang ah hichi in a chi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai un, amau ka gawt ding a, tangvalte namsau in a si ding ua, a tanute uh, a tapate uh kial in a si ding uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A si val a omkei ding uh: Anathoth mite tung ah thil hoihlou ka tun dek ngal a, a gawtna kum ding mahmah uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Toupa , na kiang a ka phun in leng, nang zaw na dik nilouhlouh a; himahleh ka vuina thu pen ka gen ding hi. Bangchi’n ahia mi thulimloute lam a lamzan zel uh? Bangchi’n ahia khemhat peuhmah nuamsa a a om nak uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amau na phut a, ahi, zung a kaita ua, a khang ua, ahi, gah a suahta uhi: a muk un honnaih ua, a sunggil un hon gamlat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Toupa kei bel na honthei a, n’on mu a, nang lam ah ka lungtang na entel sek a, amaute belam goh ding bang mai in kaikhia inla, a gohna ni ding uh sep in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gam in bang tan ahia a sun ding a, Anteh louhingte a vuai ding uh? A tengmite thulimlouh ziak in gamsate a mang khin ua, vasate leng; i hun nanung uh a mu kei ding uh a chih ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khe a pai mite toh na kitaiteh a, nang a hon bahsak khit uleh bangchi’n sakolte na kitaitehpih thei dia? Muanna gam ah bittak in om lechin leng, Jordan gammang ah bangchi’n na hih ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na unaute, na pa inkuante ngei in, amau nang a honkhemta ngal ua; amau nang hondelh in ngaihtak in a honsam ua, thu hoihtak gen mahle uh taksang himhim ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka inn leh lou paisan in ka gouluah ding ka pai mangta; ka hinna in a it mahmah nu, a melma kiang ah ka peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka gouluah ding gamnuai humpinelkai bang a hong hita, ka siatna ding in a aw a suah a, huaiziak in ka mudah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka gouluah ding kei ading in sasial ne vasa gial ahi hia? Sasial ne vasate’n a kimvel in a sual ua hia? Gamsa teng va kaikhawm unla, nekbei din honpi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Belamchingmi tampi in ka grephuan a hihsia ua, ka tan a sikden ua, ka tantuan nuam mahmah mai gamdai gam segawp a suaksakta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gamsia in a bawlta ua, a segawp a, ka kiang ah a vui hi, a gam pumpi a segawp a, himahleh kuamah in a donsak kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gamdai a tang giau tengteng ah, hihsemite a hongtungta ua, gam tawp khatlam a kipan leh khatlam pha in Toupa namsau in lah a nebeita a, muanna nei himhim a omta kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Buhchi a tuh ua, ling a la ua, a kihihgim gawp ua, punna lah a om tuankei, Toupa heh mahmah ziak in gah na suahte uh na zumpih ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka mi Israel kiang a gouluah ding a ka piak khoihsemi, ka inveng giloute tengteng tungtang ah Toupa’n hichibang in a chi: Ngai un, a gam ua kipan ka botkhe ding a, a lak ua kipan Judah inkawte ka phawikhe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi ding a, ka bohkhiak nung in amau ka hehpih nawn ding a, michih gouluah ding leh michih amah gam mah ah ka honpi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi ding a, Baal kiang a ka mite kichiam a sinsak mah bang un, ka min a, Toupa a hin a a hin sung, chi a kichiam a kisin ua, ka mite omdan ngentel tak a a sin uleh ka mite lak ah ka dingkhe sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh a ngaihkhiak kei ua leh huai nam a boh in ka botkhe ding a, ka hihse ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah hichi in a chi a: “Puanmalngat kawnggak lei inla, kawtsak lou in gak in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa thu bangbang in kawnggak ka lei a, ka gakta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan, Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Kawnggak na lei, huai na gak la inla, thou inla, Euphrates lui zuan inla, huai a suangheng kal ah sel in” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n thu honpiak bang in ka kuan a, Euphrates lui chin ah ka selta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni tampi nung in Toupa’n ka kiang ah, “Thou inla, Euphrates lui zuan inla, kawnggak k’on selsak lakhia in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in Euphrates lui ah ka hohta a, ka thai a, ka selna a kipan kawnggak ka pholhkhia hi. Ngai dih, kawnggak a na ngotkhin vek a; bang ding mah in leng a phatuamta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan, Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: hichi mah bang in Judah kisathei pipi leh Jerusalem kiotsakna mahmahte ka hihse dek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiai nam gilou, ka thute ngaikhe nuam lou a, amau lungsim paupeng zui a pathian dangte nasem leh be ding a delhmite kawnggak bangmah ding a phatuam lou bang ahi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kawnggak mi kawng a a belh gige bang in Israel inkaw pumpi leh Judah inkaw pumpi ka mite, ka minthanna, ka kilawmna leh ka thupina a hong hihtheihna ding ua ka kiang a belh gige ding a ka bawl ahi uhi; himahleh a limsak kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hiai thu a kiang ua na gen ding ahi: Toupa Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi: Hiang chiteng uain in a dim ding, chi in. Huan, amau na kiang ah, Hiang chiteng uain in a dim ding chih ka theihlouh uh ahi maw? a chi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in, a kiang uah, Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngai un, hiai gam a teng tengteng, David tutphah a tu kumpipate, siampute, zawlneite leh Jerusalem a teng tengtengte zukhamna in ka dimsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amau ka kiphusak ding a, pate a tate utoh, chih Toupa thupawt ahi: amau ka hihman louhna ding khop in ka hehpih in ka hoih in ka lainat kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngaikhia unla, bildoh un; kisathei kei un, Toupa’n thu a khahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh pahtawi unla, mialna a tunsak ma a khomui tung a te na khe uh a kipal ma in, vak na lamet laitak un mial a suaksak a, mial bikbek ding in a bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh na ngaihkhiak kei uleh na kisaktheihna uh ziak in mundai ah ka kap nilouh ding; ka khitui leng nakpitak in a luang gige ding, Toupa belamhon sal a kaih a hih ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipa leh a nu kiang ah, Niam tut un, na lukhute uh a keta hi, na lallukhu thupi uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sim khopite a bingkhin a, kuamah honvual louh in; Judah tengteng sal in a tang ua, avek un a tang khin uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na mit uh dak tou unla, mallam a kipan a hong kuan en un. Na belamhon neih koi ah, huai na belamhon deihhuai tak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangmah in lawm dia na bawlte na tung a a koih hun chiang un bangchi’n na chi dia? Numei nauvei bang mai in na nasa ngial kei ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangziak in ahia hiaite ka tung a a hongtun? Chisim na hihleh, na thulimlouhna ziak in ahi na nik lem a hih a na vuaktanna a kimuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ethiopia mi vom in a vun a hihlamdang in gialbem in a zia a sel thei ahia? Huchi ahihleh nou thil gilou hihhat sekte’n leng thil hoih hihthei na ve uteh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gamdai huih in buhsi a mutleng bang mai in amau ka dalhsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hiai na tantuan, na tuam dia ka hon sehsak ahi, n’on mangngilh a, zuau a na kingak ziak in, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchi in kei mahmah in na nik na mai khuh hial in k’on lemsak ding a, na zumhuaina a dawk ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Gamlak a tangte a na angkawmnate, na huk kikou husate, na kiphalgaih thupidante, huai na thilhih kihhuaite ka muta. Aw Jerusalem, na tung a gik hi: hihsiang na hih ma bang tan hi ding ahia?
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khokheng tungtang a Jeremiah kiang a Toupa thu hongtung:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah in a sun a, a kulh kongpite a ngui; lei ah puan vom khu in a kun ua, Jerusalem kah ging a tungkah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A mi lalte’n a sikhate uh tui a tawisak ua, tuichin a zuan ua, tui a mu kei uhi, Tuibel uh hawm in a kik ua; a beidong ua, gen ding a theikei ua, a lu uh a khuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lei lah a khang a, gam pum a vuahtui a omlouh ziak in, leiletmite a lungdong ua, a lu uh a khuh ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi, zukpiin leng pawn ah nou a nei a, a taisan ve, lou hing a omlouh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gam sabiltungte mualvum ah ading ua, sehal bang in huihkhua ngai in a nak huhu ua; nekding loupa omlouh ziak in a mit uh a mial dundun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka thulimlouhna un honhek mahleh na min ziak in aw Toupa hong kuan in; ka puknate ulah a tamta ngal a, na tung mahmah ah thil ka na hih khial uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw nang Israelte lamet, mangbat lai a hondampa, bangdia hiai gam a mikhual bangzen a zan khat giak a zin banglel a om na hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangdia mi lungke gawp bang phet leh pasalpha hondam thei khollou bang lel a om na hia? Himahleh nang zaw, aw Toupa , ka lak uah na omlai a, na min ka pu ua, hon paisan ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa’n hiai mite tungtang ah hichi in a chi: Vakmang a ut nak ua, a kalsuan uh a kidek kei uh; huchi in Toupa’n amau a pom kei a, a thulimlouhna uh a theigigeta ding a, a khelhna uh a gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah, Hiai mite hoihna ding ngetsak ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An ngawl mahle uh a kikou uh ka ngaikhe kei ding a, haltum leh buh leh bal thillat lan mahle uh ka dawng kei ding; namsau, kial, hipi in amau ka hihmang zaw ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ken, Eh, Toupa Pathian, ngai dih, a kiang uah zawlneite’n, Namsau na tuak kei ding ua, kial leng na thuak kei ding uh, hiai mun ah muan mahmahna k’on pezaw ding hi, a chi sek ngal ua, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n ka kiang ah, zawlneite’n ka min a zuaugen zel eive ua leh; amau ka sawl kei a, thu ka khak kei a, ka houpih sam kei hi. Thil a muh khollouhte uh, aisan bangmah a pangloute leh a lungsim dohate uh honhilh eive ua, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ka sawl khol louh a ka minlou a, hiai gam ah kial leh namsau a tung kei ding, chi a genmi huai zawlneite namsau leh kial in a mangthang ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan, a thugenna uh nam leng kial leh namsau ziak in Jerusalem kongzing ah paihkhiak ahi ding ua, a tanute uh a tapate utoh, vuimi himhim a neikei ding uh. A thulimlouhna uh amau tung ah ka sung dek ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan, a kiang ua hiai thu na gen ding ahi; Sun leh zan in ka khitui luang hen, hul himhim kei hen, ka mi, ka tanu nungak siangthou in nakpi a liamna a tuak hi, khutkhak na mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka gam pawt leh, maizen, namsau a thahte! Khopi a a lut leh, maizen, kialpi misi! gamchih ah zawlneite, siampute a vakvai chiat ua, a dan mahmah a theikei uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah paikhe siang na hi hiam? Zion kih na hi maw? Kou dia hihdamna omlou bikbek a bangdia hon thuaksak na hia? Muanna ka zong ua, hoihna bangmah a hongtung kei; hihdamna hun ding leng, ngai dih kha phanna lel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw Toupa , ka thulimlouhdan uh ka kitheihmohbawl kei uhi, ka pipute uh ginatlouhna toh, na tung ah ka hihkhialta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na min ziak in hon musit ken, na mangtutphah thupi minse sak kenla, ka kiang ua na thukhun theigige in hihse ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Namdang pathiante lak ah vuah zusak thei a om uhia? Ahihleh, van in vuahpi a tungsak thei hia? Aw Toupa ka Pathian uh, huai pen nang na hi kei maw? Hiai thil tengteng na hih ahi a, ka lamet uh nang na hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n ka kiang ah hichi in a chi a: Mosi leh Samuel ka ma ah hongding mahle uh, ka lungsim hiai mite lam a nga tuankei ding. Ka muh phak louh ah delhkhia inla, paimang uhen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan, koi ah ka pai ding ua chi a nang a hondot uleh hichi in a kiang uah na chi ding hi: Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Sihna tuam sihna ah; namsau tuam namsau ah; kial tuam kial ah, saltanna tuam saltanna ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thil li ka sehsak ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi: that ding in namsau, keizan ding in ui, nekhin leh hihmang ding in tung a leng vasa leh gam sahangte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Hezekiah tapa Manasseh in Jerusalem a a thilhih ziak in lei kumpipa gam tengteng lak a vial sepsep ding in ka bawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kuan a hon hehpih dia aw Jerusalem? Kuan hon lungkhampih dia? Na omdan dong ding in kua a lampial dia oi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang n’on paikhia a, na nungtawn tawn a, chih Toupa thupawt ahi. Huchi in kisik ka chimtak a, na tung ah ka khut ka lik a, k’on hihmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gam pumpi a kulh kongpite ah kizapna in amau ka zap a, ta bei in ka bawl a, ka mite ka hihmang a; a omdan uh a kihei san louh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuipi piaunel sang a tam in a meithaite uh ka pungsak ding a, suntanglai in tangvalte siatna ding in a tung uah lokmi ka tungsak a, mangbatna leh thil mulkimhuai ka tungsak guih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sagih suangnu a bahgawp a; a kha a khahta; sun a hih lai in a ni a keta, zahlak in a lungbuai a: huan a omlaite a melmate khut ah namsau thah ding in ka pe ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nu ei, gam pumpi a kituahlouhna mi leh kikalhna mi a n’on na suan ka tung gik hina tele! Ka leitawi sak kei a, mite’n leng a hon leitawi sak kei uh; himahleh avek un hamsia a honloh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa’n , chihtak ngial in thil hoih ading in ka hon hihkip ding; chihtak ngial in siatna ni leh haksatna ni’n melma na kiang ah khut ka dohsak ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Min sik, mallam a sik leh ngen a kitansak thei ding ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na khelhna tengteng ziak in na sum lah pai lah na gou thilte manbei in gallak ding in ka pe ding, na gam tawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na theih ngeilouh gam ah na melmate na k’on semsak ding. Ka heh ziak a na tung a mei ampha ding a kuangkheta hi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang man na thei hi, aw Toupa ; hon theigige inla, hongveh in, hon simmohte tung ah phuba hon laksak in. Na dohzohna ken manthat loh keileng; nang ziak a minsiat thuak ka hi chih thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na thute hihlat ahia, ka ne a, na thute kei ading in kipahna leh ka lungtang nopna ahi; aw Toupa , sepaihte Pathian, na min lah ka puta ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nopbawl mite lak ah ka tel kei a, ka kipahpih sam kei; nang khut ziak in ka tu tuam a, lungkimlouhna in n’on dimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangdia ka natna dai theilou a, ka liamna dam theilou ahi, hihdam utlou bang mai a? Ka tung ah guam khemhat tui kang sekte bang na hi ding ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Na kihei leh a ngei k’on bangsak ding, ka ma ah na ding nawn ding. Thil ginalou a kipan thil manpha ngen na genkhiak leh keimah kam bang na hi ding. Amau nang lam hong nga uhenla, nang bel amau lam na nga ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hiai mite lak a zaw ngen kulh bang in k’on bawl ding a, a honsual ding ua, himahleh a honzou kei ding uh, nang hon hondam ding leh honkhe ding in na kiang ah ka om ngal a, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Migiloute khut a kipan k’on honkhe ding a, mi lauhuaite khut a kipan k’on pawtkhe sak ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zi na nei ding ahi kei a, hiai mun ah tanu tapate leng na nei ding ahi sam kei, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tanu tapa hiai mun a piangte leh hiai gam a nu leh pa amaute suangte tungtang Toupa’n hichi in a chi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hipiin a si ding ua, kuamah vuilouh leh kuamah sun louh in a om ding uh; leitung ekvut banglel ahi ding uh. Namsaute, kialte in a mangthang ding ua, a luang uh tungleng vasate leh gamsate an ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi hi: Lusunna inn ah lut kenla, sun ding in hoh kenla, amau kah ken; hiai mite lak a kipan ka lungmuanna ka hawkta ngal a, chitna leh lainatnate toh, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiai gam ah mi lian leh mi neute a si ding ua; vui ahi kei ding ua; kuamah in a sun kei ding ua, a ki at un a kimet giau loh kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lusunmite a misi ngaih uh lungmuan ding in kuamah in nek ding a lui kei ding ua, a nu uh hiam a pa uh hiam ziak in leng nepna nou dawn ding kuamah in a tun kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan, ne leh dawn ding in a lak ua tu ding in Ankuangluina inn ah na lut ding ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa , Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi ngal a: Ngai dih ua, na mitmuh un, na damsung un mou awte, mouneipa awte, nuamsakna husate, kipahna gingte hiai mun ah ka daisak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiai thu tengteng hiai mite kiang a na hilh hun chiang in amau, Bangziak in ahia Toupa’n ka tung ua hichitak a thil hoihlou a hon genkhiak? Bang ahia ka thulimlouhna uh? Toupa ka Pathian uh tung a ka thilhih khelh bang ahia? a hon chih uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hichi in na chi ding hi: Na pipute un a hon paisan ziak uh ahi, pathian dangte a delh ua, a na uh a sem ua, a bia ua, a hon paisan ua, ka dan a zuikei ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan noute’n na pipute uh sang a leklua in na hih ua, ngai un, michih in noumau lungtang gilou paupeng na zui ua, Kei n’on ngaikhe kei ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka gam a kipan noute leh na pipute un leng na theih ngeilouh uh gam ah ka hon delhkhe ding, huai ah sun leh zan in pathian dangte nna na sem ding ua, k’on hehpih dek ngal kei a, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in, ngai dih ua, nite a hongtung dek hi, Toupa thupawt in a chi; “Israel tate Aigupta gam a kipan a pikhepa a hin a a hin sung, chita lou in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mallam gam leh a delhzakna gam tengteng a kipan a Israel tate pikhepa Toupa a hin a a hin sung, a chi zawta ding uh.” A pipute uh kiang a ka piak, amau gam mahmah ah lah ka pikik nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngamanmi tampi ka thukhak ding a, amau a man ding ua; huaikhit in gamvakmi tampi ka thukhak ding a, tang chiteng leh mual chiteng a kipan amaute a beng khe ding ua, suangpi hengkal a leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A omdan tengteng uah lah ka mit a tu nilouh ngal a; kei a kipan sel in a omkei ua, a thulimlouhna uh leng ka mit a kipan sel in a omsam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in a thil kihhuai luangte ua ka gam a hihnit ua leh a kihhuaina ua ka goutan gam a dimsak ziak un a thulimlouhna uh leh a khelhna uh a zahnih in ka thuk ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Toupa , ka hatna leh ka kulhpi, mangbat ni a ka kihumbitna, kawlmong a kipan in namte a hongpai ding ua, Ka pipute un zuau, thil ginalou, punna nei hilou kia loungal bangmah gouluah in a neikei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Min pathiante a kibawlsak thei ua hia? Huaite pathian ahi sam ua, a chi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huaiziak in, ngai dih ua, tutung in amau ka theisak peuhmah ding; ka khut leh ka thilhihtheihna ka theisak ding, ka min Toupa ahi chih a thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah khelhna sik laigelhna leh suangmantam hiam muk zum a gelh ahi; a lungtang pek ua khuak in a om a, a maitam uahte leng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sing hing bul leh mualpawngte ah a tate un a maitamte uleh a Aserahte uh a theigige ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw nang gam a ka tang, gam dung tawn a na khelhna ziak in na sum leh na gou tengteng, na mun sangte toh gallak ding in ka pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai na tantuam ka honpiak na tan ding a, na gam theih ngeihlouh ah na melmate nna k’on semsak ding, ka hehna mei, tangtawn a kang ding lah na mut kuangta ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Mihing muang a, mihing ban hatna muang a, Toupa lehngatsan lungtang neimi hamse thuak in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gamdai a loupa keu gaw bang ahi a, thil hoih pawt ding a mu kei ding. Gamdai gamkeu, chi gam, kuamah luah louh ah a teng zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa muangmi, a lametpen Toupa hi bel a nuamsa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tui kiang a sing phuh, luigei a zungkai, khaw lum hongtung ding khawksa lou, a nahte hing gige, khokhen kum khawksa lou, gah suan kikhelsak tuan lou bang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lungtang bel thil tengteng sang in khemhat pen, hoihlou pumlum ahi a; kuan ahia theithei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei Toupa bel michih a omdan bangzel uleh a thilhih gah bangzel a peding a lungsim enkhepa, lungtang enchianpa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi, kilawmlou a hong hau bel vengkeng, amah tui loupi keuhsak dia op bang ahi, a damlai in amah a tuansan ding ua, atawp in mihai a hong himai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka Mun Siangthou omna bel mangtutphah thupi mahmah, a tung a kipan a tawisang a om ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Toupa Israel lamet, nang hon paisan mi tengteng a zahlak ding uh; kei hon lehngatsan mite lei a leivui a gelh banglel ahi ding uh, Toupa hinna tuikhuk pen lah a paisanta ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Toupa hon hihdam inla, huchi in ka dam ding a, hon humbit lechin, huchi in ka bit ding, ka phat gige nang na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai in, ka kiang ah, Toupa thu koi ah? Hongtung leh a ke, a chi sek uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thil hoihlou tungsak ding ka honphut kei a, siatna ni lah ka deih hetkei chih na thei hi; ka kam a thupawt lah na maima a om ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei ding in kihtakhuai hi kenla, mangbat ni a ka kihumbitna na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hon simmohte zahlak uhenla, kei bel zahlak keileng; amau bel lungzing uhenla, kei bel lungzing keileng; mangbat ni a tung uah tun inla, nakpi’n amau hihmang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah hichi in a chi: Kuan inla, Judah kumpipate lutna zel leh pawtna zel, mipite tate kongpi ah leh Jerusalem kongpite tengteng ah vading inla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A kiang uah, Nou Judah kumpipate, Judah tengtengte, Jerusalem a teng tengteng hiai kongpi a lut sekte aw, Toupa thu ngaikhia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi hi: Na hinna uh pilvang mahmah dih ua, khawlniin puak neikei unla, Jerusalem kulh kongpi ah lutpih sam kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan, khawlniin na inn ua kipan puak na pokhe ding uh ahi kei a, nna na sem ding uh ahi sam kei; na pipute uh kiang a ka thupiak bang in khawlni na tang siangthou zaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amau zaw a ngaikhe kei ua, bil a doh kei ua; thununna a zak ua a tanlouhna ding un a kigenhaksak zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa thupawt in hichi in a chi: Khawksa tak a n’on ngaihkhiak ua, khawlni a hiai khopi a kongpi a thil na puaklut louh ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nna na seplouh ua khawlni na tan siangthou uleh, hiai khopi kongpi ah leh heutute, David tutphah a tu dingte kangtalaite leh sakolte ah tuang in a honglut ding ua, amau leh a miliante uh Judah leh Jerusalem a tengte toh; huchi in hiai khopi ah mi a teng denta ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Judah khopi leh Jerusalem kim a kipan, Benjamin gam a kipan, gamniam gam a kipan, tanggam a kipan leh Sim gam a kipan in a hongpai ding ua, haltum thillat leh kithoihnate buh leh bal thillat leh gimlimte, kipahna kithoihnate Toupa inn ah a hontawi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Himahleh khawlni tang siangthou ding leh khawlni a puak neih louh leh Jerusalem kulh kongpi a lutpih louh ding thu ah n’on ngaihkhiak kei uleh a kulh kongpite ah mei ka pawtsak ding a, Jerusalem kumpipa innte a kang bei ding a, a mit kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa a kipan a Jeremiah kiang a thu hongtung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Thou inla, belvelmi inn ah hohsuk inla, huai ah ka thute ka hon theisak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in belvelmi inn ah ka hohsukta a, a belbawlna khawl ah nna a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tung a bel a bawl lai a hong hoih kei leh belvelmi’n hoih a sak bang in bel dang din a bawl nawn zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Israel inkawte aw, hiai belvelmi hih bang in nou ka honhih theikei a hia? chih Toupa thupawt ahi. Ngai dih ua, “Belvelmi khut a tung banglel in ka khut ah na om uhi, aw Israel inkawte aw.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chiklai in leng nam hiam gam hiam tungtang thu ah, k’on dokkhe ding, k’on phel ding a, k’on hihse ding, chi in na gen mah leng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai nam in a tungthu ka gen ziak a a thil hoihlou hih a lehngatsan leh a tung a thil hoihlou hih ka tup ka kikhelsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan, chiklai in leng nam hiam gam tungtang thu ah, k’on bawl ding a, k’on dingsak ding a, chi in na gen zong hileng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka paukam suak ngaikhe lou a ka mitmuh a thil hoihlou ahihleh amah ading in thil hoih hih ka tup ka kikhelsak sam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in Judah mite leh Jerusalem a tengte kiang ah, Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngai dih ua, na tung uah thil hoihlou ka ngaihtuah a, nou k’on sawmlai na hi uh, michih in a omdan hoihlou uh lehngatsan uhenla, na omdan uleh na thilhihte uh bawlpha un, vachi peuhmah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh amau zaw, “Kilawm kei e! Koumau phasak bangbang in ka om ding ua, michih koumau lungtang gilou genhak bangzel in ka om ding uh” a chi sek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Namdangte dong him dih ua, hichibang mahmah kuan a thei a? Nungak siangthou Israel in thil lauhuai mahmah a hihta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lebanon vuk in a mualvum a nuse ngei ahia? Gamla a kipan a tui vot hongluang sukte a kangtat ngei ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka mite’n a hon mangngilh ua, bangmah lou phet kiang ah gimlim a hal ua, huaite’n a tuma lam lampi ua kipan a ki suisak a, lampipen hilou lamkhem lam a zui uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A gam uh hih siatgawp ahi dia, tangtawn a enghou ding; kivialleh min lamdangsa in a lu uh a sing ding ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Suahlam huihpi bang in melma ma ah ka thehzak ding, a vangtah ni un ka mel hilou, ka dek ka musak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan, amau, Kisa un, Jeremiah i sawm ding uh, siampu a kipan dan a dai kei ding a, mi pil a kipan thudot a dai sam kei ding, zawlnei a kipan thu a dai kei ding hi. Kisa un, i gense gawp ding ua, a thu i limsak kei ding, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hon limsak inla, aw Toupa kei hon ngetna thu limsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gilou thil hoih a dit hi ngei hia? Amau lah ka kha ading in kawkhuk a tou ngal ua. Amau a kipan a na hehna heimang ding leh amau adia thil hoih gen ding a na ma a ka din sek theigige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in a tate uh kialpi kiang ah pekhia inla, namsau hatna kiang ah pia in; huan a zite uh taneilou in, meithai uhen; a pasalte uh hipi in si uhenla, a tangvalte uh leng kidouna ah namsau si uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Simmite a kiang uh na tunsak guih lai in a inn ua kipan kap husa thangkhia hen: kei ading in kawkhuk a tou ngal ua, ka khe awkna ding in thang a kam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh nang, aw Toupa kei honthat ding a a hon sawmna tengteng uh na thei hi; a thulimlouhna uh ngaidam kenla, na mitmuh in a khelhna uh thaimang sam ken: Na ma ah kipuk uhenla, na heh ni’n amaute soisa in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Kuan unla, belvelmi lei bel valei un; mipite upate leh siampu lak a upate pi inla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Belvelmi kongpi lutna chin a Ben Hinnom guam ah hoh inla, huai ah na kiang a thu k’on hilh ding na phuang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hichi in na chi ding hi: Judah kumpipate leh Jerusalem a tengte aw, Toupa thu za un: Israel Pathian, sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngai dih ua, hiai mun ah a za peuhmah bil am khop hial a thil hoihlou ka hontun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mite’n a honpai san ua, hiai mun a hihnin un, amau leh a pate uh leh Judah Kumpipate’n leng a theih ngei nai hetlouh uh, pathian dangte kiang ah gimlim a hal ziak uleh hiai mun mi hoih sisan a a dimsak ziak un leh Baal kiang a haltum thillat ding a a tate uh a halna ding ua Baal mun sangte a lamkhiak ziak un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai zaw ka thupiak ahi kei a, gen leng ka gen sam kei a, ka lungsim ah leng a om ngeikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in, ngai dih, nite a hongtung ding, Toupa thupawt in a chi: huai nite chiang in hiai mun Tophet chih ahita kei ding a, Ben Hinnom guam chih ahi sam kei ding; kithahna guam chih ahi zawta ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan, hiai mun ah Judah leh Jerusalem thil tupte ka vuak suaksak ding a; amau pen namsau in a melmate uh ma ah leh a hinna uh lak tummite khut ah ka puksak ding; a luangte uh tung a leng vasate leh lei a gamsate an ding in ka pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in, hiai khopi lamdang sak ding leh enghou ding in ka bawl ding a, a vialpai peuh in siatna a tuahte ziak in lamdang a sa ding ua, a enghou lai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A tanute uleh a tapate uh sa ka nesak ding a; a melmate uh leh a hinna uh lak tummite’n a um ua a mangbat sak hun chiang un kuapeuh in a invengte uh sa a ne ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan, na paipihte mitmuh in bel na hihtam ding a, a kiang uah huchi in na chi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Hichimah bang in hiai mite leh hiai khua ka hihtam ding; belvelmi bel min a kitamsak a, bawlhoih nawn vual ahi lou bang in; Tophet ah a vui ding ua, vuina ding mun dang a omlouh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi hial in hiai mun ka bawl ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi; hichimah bang in hiai khua Tophet bang a bawl hial in, asung a tengte tung ah leng ka hih ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem innte leh Judah kumpipate innte, inn chiteng mahmah a tung a vanlam thilte kiang a gimlim halkhitna tengteng leh pathian dangte kiang a dawn ding thillat butkhiaknasa tengtengte Tophet mun bang hial a hihnit ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan, Jeremiah bel, Toupa’n thugen ding a a sawlna mun Tophet a kipan in a hongpai a; Toupa inn um sung ah ading a, mipi tengteng kiang ah hichi in a chi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israelte Pathian, sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngai dih ua, thil hoihlou ka gen tengteng hiai khopi leh a khaw dang tengteng ah k’on tungsak ding hi: ka thu ngaikhe lou ding a a lungtang uh a khauhsak ziak un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan Immer tapa, Toupa inn a heutupa pen, siampu Pashur in Jeremiah in huai thute a gen chih a naza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Pashur in zawlnei Jeremiah a khen a, Toupa inn a Benjamin Kongpi saknung a koltanna ah a tangsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A zing in Pashur in Jeremiah a khahkhia a, huan Jeremiah in a kiang ah, Toupa’n na min ding in Pashur a chi kei hi, Magermissabib a honchi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa’n lah hichi in a chi ngal a: Ngai in, nang ading leh na lawmte tengteng ading in kihtak in k’on bawl ding: amau a melmate uh namsau in a puk ding ua, nang zaw na mit in na en lel ding. Judahte tengteng Babulon kumpipa khut ah ka pe vek ding: aman Babulon ah sal in a pi ding a, namsau in a that ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaiban ah, khopi hauhna tengteng, a sepkhiak tengteng, a thil manpha tengteng leh Judah kumpipate gou tengteng a melmate uh khut ah ka pe ding a, amau a lok ding ua, a man ding ua, Babulon ah a pi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan, nang Pashur, na insung a om tengtengte toh sal ah na tang ding ua; Babulon ah na pai tei ding; huai ah na si ding a, huai ah vui in na om ding a, nang leh na lawm zuauthu na hilhsekte tengteng toh, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Toupa , nang n’on khem a, khem a om keita ve, nang zaw kei sang in na hat a, n’on zou a; nitum in nuihsat ka hita, mi kuapeuh in a hon nuihsan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thu ka gen peuhmah chiang in, ka kikou khia a, hiamgamna leh siatna, chi in ka kikou; Toupa thu bel kei ading in, nitum a dem leh muhsit lohna kia ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah ka kan kei ding a, a min in leng thu ka gen n’on sam kei ding, chi mah leng, ka guh sung a mei kang ki khumkhin bang mai in ka lungtang sung ah a om a, ka pai kinken zou kei a, ka pha zou mahmah kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tampi a guk phun uh ka za: kil chih ah lauhuai a om, hek unla, i hek khawm ding uh, chi in. Ka lawmte ka puk ding tang gigete’n, Khem in a om dia, i zou ding, a tung ah phu i la ding, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa mihangsan kihtakhuai mahmah bang in ka kiang ah a om a, a hon simmohte a puk ding ua, honzou kei ding uh. Zahlaktak in a om ding ua, a lohchin sinlouh ziak un. Tangtawn a a minsiatna uh mangngilh in a omkei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw sepaihte Toupa , mi diktatte enchianpa, lungtang leh lungsim mu paisuakpa, a tung ua na phulak hon musak dihve, ka tungtang thu k’on kemsakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa kiang ah lasa unla, Toupa phat un; thil gilou hihmite khut a kipan panpih deihte hinna a humbitta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka piankhiak ni hamse thuak in om hen, ka nun a hon piansak ni vualzawl in om dah hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka pa kiang a, Tapa na neita, chih thu hontun a, hong kipaksakmi tak hamse thuak in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai mi, Toupa’n hehpih hetlou a a sukgawp khuate bang in om hen, zingsang lam in kikou husa za henla, sun a hih chiang in galdou husa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sul sung a a hon hihlup louh ziak in; huchi hihleh ka nu ka han himai ding hi a, a sul in tangtawn a honpai ding hi ven.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangdia sul a kipan hongpawt chitchiat ka hia, semgim leh lungkham a om ding a zahlak mawngmawng a ka damsung nite zang ding in?
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa Zedekiah in Jeremiah kiang a Malkijah tapa Pashur leh siampu Maaseiah tapa Zephaniah a sawl lai a Jeremiah kiang a Toupa a kipan a thu a hongtung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in a hondou a, Toupa’n a thilhih thupitak a hihsek bang in a honhuh nuam in, a kiknawn sak mai kha diam chih Toupa hon dotsak dihve” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan Jeremiah in a kiang uah, Zedekiah kiang ah hichibang in vagen un: Israelte Pathian, Toupa’n hichi in a chi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai in, Babulon kumpipa leh Kaldai mi, kulh pua a nang honumpa na douna galvan zat ka kiksak ding ahi; hiai khopi sung ah amau ka pikhawm ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keimahmah in leng heh leh lungkimlou mahmah leh thangpaitak in banzak in ban thahat zang in nang ka hondou ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiai khua a teng mihingte leh gante ka that ding a, hipi in a si ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huai nung in, Toupa thupawt in a chi, kumpipa Zedekiah leh a nungzuite leh midang hiai khua a hi leh namsau leh kial a siloute, Babulon kumpipa leh a melmate uh khut leh amau that tummite khut ah ka pe ding. Namsau hiam in a that ding a, a hehpih hetkei ding a, a hawi hetkei ding, a lainat sam kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan hiai mipite kiang ah huchi in vagen in: Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngai un, sihna lampi leh hinna lampi k’on koihsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hiai khopi sung a om namsau in hiam kial in hiam hi in hiam a si ding uh; Kaldai mite nou hon umpa kiang a pawt a kipiate bel a hing ding uh, a hinna uh kidouna kipahman ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiai khopi hoihna ding hilou, a siatna ding ka tum bilbel ahi: Babulon kumpipa khut a piak ahi ding a, aman mei in a hal ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah kumpipa inkawte tungtang thu ah; Toupa thu ngaikhia un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw David inkawte aw! Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Zingsang in vai diktak in hawm unla, simmohmi khut a kipan loh thuakmi hunkhia unla, huchilou in zaw ka hehna mei bang in a pawt ding a, kuamah phelh vual louh ding in a kang dia, na thil hihgiloute uh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngai dih ua, guam zang a tengte aw, nou guam zang suangpi a teng a, Kuate ahia i omna ua honglut ding? chite aw, nou ka honlang ding hi. Toupa thupawt in a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na thilhih uh gah bangzel in k’on gawt ding a, a gam gammang ah mei ka khah ding a, a kim tengteng a kangmang ding, Toupa thupawt in a chi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Judah kumpipa inn ah hohsuk inla, hiai thu vagen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Judah kumpipa, David tutphah tung a tu, nang leh na nungzuite leh na mi hiai kongkhak a lutte toh, Toupa thu ngaikhia unla, chi in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Diktak leh hoihtak in vai hawm unla; simmohmi khut a kipan loh thuakmi hunkhia unla; mikhualte, pa neiloute leh meithai tung ah diklouhna hiam hiamgamna hiam ching kei un; hiai mun ah mi hoih sisan leng suah sam kei un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiai thu zui ngei hile uchin zaw, David tutphah tung a kumpipate kangtalaite leh sakolte tung a tuang in, amaute, a nungzuite uh leh a mite uh hiai na inn kongkhakte uah a lut ngeingei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh hiai thute na ngaihkhiak kei uleh, hiai in a segawp ding a, chi in, kei leh kei kilou in ka kichiam ahi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n Judah kumpipa inkuan tungtang thu hichibang in a gen hi: Nangzaw kei ading in Gilead bang, Lebanon mualvum bang na hi: Himahleh gamdai ka hon suaksak ding, luahmi omlou khopi bang mai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang hihmang dingte, galvan neichiatin, ka bawlkhol ding a; na sidar sing telte a phuk ding ua, mei ah a khul ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan, namdang tampite’n hiai khopi a pal paisuak ding ua, michih in amau invengte kiang ah Toupa’n hiai khopi thupi mahmah bangdia hichitak a hih hi ding ahia eita? a chi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A Pathian uh Toupa thukhun a lehngatsan ua pathian dangte a biak ua, a na a sep ziak uh ahi, chi in a dawng ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Misi kah kei unla, sun sam kei un; paimangmi bel nakpi mahmah in kah un, a hong kiknawn kei ding a, a pianna gam a muh nawn louh ding ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Shallum, Josiah sik a vaihawmpa, hiai mun a kipan paikheta tungtang thu bel Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Hiai ah a hongkik nawnta kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sal a a pi na mun uah, huai mah ah a si ding a, hiai gam a mu nawnta kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Diktatlouhna a inn lam a, diklouhna a dantan tungnungte bawlmi, a thawn a amah invengte tha zang, loh pe nuamlou mite tung a gik hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Inn thupi mahmah ka kilam ding a, dantan tungnung zapite nei inn, tohlette ka hong ding a, sidar sing in ka thuap suak ding a, zesan ka nuh ding, chi mi tung mah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sidar sing a vuallehpai na khen ziak in, kumpipa kisa na hi maw! na pa’n a ne in a dawn a, diktak in vai a hawm kei maw? Huai amah ding in a hoih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi genthei leh tasamte vaihawm sak a, huai a hoih ahi. Hiai tak n’on theihdan ding ahi maw? chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh na huaihamte ading in, mi hoih sisan suahna ding, nuaisiahna ding leh hiamgamna ding lel in na mit leh na lungsim na pu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huaiziak in Judahte kumpipa Jehoiakim, Josiah tapa tungthu bel Toupa’n hichi in a gen a: Aw ka unaupa, chi in hiam, Aw ka sanggampa, chi in hiam amah a kah kei ding ua, Aw toupa, chi in hiam, Aw thupipen, chi in hiam amah a sun sam kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem kulh pawlam a lotkhiak a, paih in, sabiltung vui in a vui ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lebanon ah paitou inla, kikou in, Bashan ah na aw suah inla, Abarim apan in kikou in, na itte tengteng a mangthangta ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na lohchin in na kiang ah thu ka gen a, nang lah ka ngaikhe kei ding, na chi a, ka kamsuak ngaihkhiak louh na tuailai kipan in hiai na omdan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na belampute tengteng uh huih in a kivak ding ua, na mi itte sal in a tang ding ua, nang leng gitlouhna tengteng ziak in zahlaktak leh mangbangtak in na om ngei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw Lebanon tang a teng, sidar sing lak a buseptu na tung a natna a tun a na hong hehpihhuai ding dan mai zaw! numei nauvei na bang mai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A hin a ka hin sung, chih Toupa thupawt ahi; Judah kumpipa Koniah, Jehoiakim tapa bel ka khut taklam a sawnna zungbuh himah lechin, huai a kipan ka honbot ngeingei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thah ding a nang hon zawngmi khut ah, Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar khut ah leh Kaldaite khut ah ngeingei nang k’on pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na pianna hilou gamdang ah nang leh na nu nang honsuang k’on paikhe ding a, huai ah na si ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A lungsim ua kiknawn a ut mahmahna gam uah a kiknawn kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hiai Koniah pen bel kitam gawp, simmohhuai ahi ka hia? Bel asung a lungkimna omlouhna ahi kei maw? Bangdia amah leh a suante paihkhiak a gam a theih ngeilouh ua paihkhiak a a om uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw, gam, gam, gam, Toupa thu ngai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi, Hiai mi ta neilou, a damsung a lohchinglou ding mi ahi, a suante kuamah lohching a, David tutphah tung a tu ding leh Judah gam a vaihawm nawn ding a omkei ding uh, chi in gelh in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A Gam tatna mun a belam hih mangthang a dalhzaksak belamchingmite a tung uh a gik hi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa Israelte Pathian in ka mite chingpa belamchingmite tungtang thu ah hichi in a chi: Ka ganhonte na dalhsak ua, na delhmang ua, na veh kei uh, ngai un, na thilhih uh gilou ziak in nou k’ong veh ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan, ka ganhon omsunte ka delhzakna gam tengteng a kipan ka pikhawm nawn ding a, a huangsung uah ka hawlkhawm ding a, gah nuam mahmah ahi ding ua, a pung ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau limsak ding amau ading in belamchingmi ka koih ding a, a lau nawnta kei ding ua, a kuamah a mang nawn kei ding uh, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai dih ua, David adin Hiang diktat ka suahsak hun ding a hongtung dekta hi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi; amah kumpipa in a tu ding a, piltak in a gamta ding a, gam pumpi ah dikna leh diktatna a tangtung sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hun sung in Judah hotdam ahi ding a, Israel bittak in a om ding. Huai a min ding a a sak ding uh hiai ahi, “ Toupa i diktatna uh ahi” chih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in, ngai dih ua, a hun a tung sinta, Toupa thupawt in a chi. Israel mite “Aigupta gam a kipan a hon pikhepa Toupa a hin a a hin sung, chi nawnlou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mallam gam leh a delhzakna gam tengteng a kipan Israel inkawte suante pikhia a, pikik nawnpa Toupa a hin a a hin sung, a chi zawta ding uhi.” Huchi in, amau gam ngei ah a teng ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zawlneite tungtang thu pen, ka sung ah ka lungtang a puakkham hi, ka guh teng a ling a, zukham bang mai ka hi, zu in a zelh zoh mi bang mai in, Toupa ziak leh a thu siangthou ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gam angkawm in a dim a, hamsia ziak in gam in a sun a, gamdai louhing munte a keu khinta; a lampi uh a gilou a, a hatna uh a dik kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zawlneite leh siampute’n Pathian khawk a sa kei ua, ka inn sung mahmah ah leng a khelhna uh ka mu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in amau ading in a paina lampi uh, zan khomial lampi nal bang ahi ding a, huai ah delh in a om ding ua a tolhpuk ding ua, a tung uah thil hoihlou ka tungsak ding a, amau gawtna hun, Toupa thupawt in a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samaria zawlneite tung ah kihhuai ka mu, Baal lou in thu a gen ua, Israelte a pi mang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem a zawlneite tung ah thil mulkimhuai ka mu, ang a kawm ua, zuau in a gamta ua, thil gilou hihte khut a hatsak ua, kuamah in a gitlouh uh kisik a tuplouh loh uhi; kei ding in Sodom khua a mite bang a honghi vek ua, a khaw sung a mite tengteng leng Gomorrah khua a mite bang hial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huaiziak in zawlnei hon tungtang thu ah sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngai dih ua, gamsai in ka vak ding a, thil kha ka dawnsak ding a; Jerusalem a zawlneite kiang a kipan in gam pumpi ah Pathian poisaklouhna lah a pawtta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Zawlnei na kiang ua thugente thu ngaikhe kei un; bangmahlou a hon sinsak ua. Toupa kam a kipan hilou amau lungsim geltawmte a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa thu musitmite kiang ah, Nang ding in a hoih ding, a chi vial ua; amau deihlam engtat a hih teiteimite kiang ah, Thil hoihlou bangmah na tung ah a hongtung kei ding, a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa thugelna ah kua a pang ngei a, a thu sang a thei ding kua a om? Ahihleh a thu pen kuan ahia limsak a ngaikhia om?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai dih ua, Toupa huihpi, hehna a pawtta, ahi, pingpei huihpi; migiloute lutang a nuai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa hehna a mawk kik kei ding, a lungsim a a tup chinten a tangtungsak a, a hih khit phot masiah; ni nanung lam ah n’on theichian ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zawlneite bel ka sawl louhpi in a tai ua, a kiang ua thu ka gen louh in leng thu a gen uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka thugelna a om tei hile uzaw, ka thu ka mite kiang a phuang ding hi ve un, a thilhih diklou ua kipan lehngatsak ding hi ve un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gamlapi a om Pathian hilou in, Pathian nai gige ka hi hia? chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mun kisel ah ka muhtheih louh dia bu theimi a om ua hia? chih Toupa thupawt ahi. Lei leh van ah ka dim ahi kei maw? chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Mang ka nei, mang ka nei, chi a ka min a zuaugen zawlneite thugen ka zata hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zawlnei zuau gente, amau lungtang kikhem tawm a thu sekmite lungtang ah hiai bang tan ahia a om ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amau bel a invengte uh kiang ah a mang uh a hilh ua ka mite ka min mangngilh sak a tum ua, a pate un Baal ziak a ka min a mangngilh khit bang un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zawlnei mangnei in a mang gen hen, ka thu neimi in ka thutak diktak in gen hen. Buhpawl leh buhtang in kibatna bang a nei ua? chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka thu mei bang ahi kei maw, sek suang seknenna bang? chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huaiziak in, ngai un, zawlnei hon, ka thu kiguksak tuah sekte ka dou ahi, chih “ Toupa thupawt” ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ngai dih ua, zawlnei amah dangnal sak a, Toupa’n a chi, chisekte ka dou ahi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ngai dih ua, mang zuau leltak gen a, hilh a, a zuau thute uh leh a kiotsakna thu ginaloute uh ziak a ka mite pimang zawlneite ka dou ahi, Toupa thupawt in a chi; ka sawl ngal kei a, thu lah ka pe kei a, hiai mipite a lohtak sak kei ding uh, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hiai mipite lak a mi kuahiam, zawlnei kuahiam in, siampu kuahiam in, “ Toupa puakgik bang ahia?” chi a a hondot leh hichi in na dawng ding hi, “Noumau mah puakgik pen na hi uh, k’on paimang ding” chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Zawlnei hiam, siampu hiam, mi kuahiam, Toupa puakgik, chi a om uleh, huai mi leh a inkawte ka gawt ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huchi in mi kuapeuh in a invengpa kiang ah leh kuapeuh in a unaupa kiang ah, Toupa’n bangchi’n a dawng a. Toupa’n bang a gen a? chi in na kidong ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Toupa puakgik na loukha nawn kei ding ua, mi kuapeuh amah mah thugen a puakgik ahi ding hi. Pathian hing, sepaihte Toupa , i Pathian thu ulah na lehbulh khinta ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zawlnei kiang ah, “ Toupa’n bangchi’n nang a hondawng a? Toupa’n bang ahia a gen?” na chi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Huan, “ Toupa puakgik, na chih peuhmah uleh, Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Toupa puakgik na chi ding uh ahi kei,” chi a ka honsawl a, Toupa puakgik chi a thu na gen ziak in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Huchi in, ngai un, “K’on mangngilh keuhkeuh ding a, noute leh hiai khopi na kiang uleh na pate uh kiang a ka na piaksa toh k’on paimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Huan, tangtawn demsiatna leh zahlak nilouhna mangngilh vuallouh na tung uah kontun ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n a hon ensak a, ngai dih, theipi bawm nih Toupa biakin ma ah a kitung a, Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in Judahte kumpipa Jekoniah, Jehoiakim tapa leh Judah heutute, mi khutsiamte leh siksekmite toh Jerusalem a kipan a Babulon sal dia a pi nung in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawm khat ah theipi hoihtak, theipi min masa bang tak, a om a; bawm dang ah bel theipi hoihlou, nektak louh khop a sia a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah, “Bang ahia na muh, Jeremiah?” a chi a. Ken, “Theipi, theipi hoih, hoih mahmah; leh a hoihlou, nektak louh khop a sia” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan, Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa Israelte Pathian in hichi in a chi: Judah saltangte, Kaldaite gam a a thahna ding ua ka sawlkhiakte, hiai theipi hoih bang in ka en ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hoihna ding un a tung uah ka mit ka tusak ding a, hiai gam ah ka pikik nawn ding: amau ka dingsak ding a, ka phel kei ding; ka suan ding a, ka bot kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in, Toupa ka hi chih n’on theihna ding in lungtang k’on pe ding a: ka mite ahi ding ua, a Pathian uh ka hi ding: a lungtang tengteng utoh ka kiang ah a hongkik ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Theipi sia, nektak louh khop a sia bang in Judah kumpipa Zedekiah leh a heutute uh leh Jerusalem a nituang hiai gam a omlaite leh Aigupta gam a tengte, ka lehngatsan ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Haksatak a leitung gam teng lak ah sep leng ding in, ka delhmangnate gensiat leh tehpih leh tai leh hamsiat khum hi ding in ka tawpsan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amau leh a pate uh kiang a ka piak gam a kipan valh khit a hih pha un a lak uah namsau, kial leh hi, ka sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judahte kumpipa, Jehoiakim, Josiah tapa kum lina a Judah mite tengteng tungtang a Jeremiah kiang a thu hongtung: Huai hun bel Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar kum khatna ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huai thu zawlnei Jeremiah in Judah mi tengteng leh Jerusalem a om tengtengte kiang a a gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum sawmnih leh thum sung, Judahte kumpipa Josiah, Ammon tapa kum sawmlehthumna a kipan a tutan in, Toupa thu a hongtung zel a, phalvak a thou in na kiang uah ka gengen a, himahleh na ngaikhe kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa’n na kiang uah a nasemmi zawlneite tengteng a sawl a, phalvak a thou in a sawl a, himahleh na ngaikhe kei ua, thei ding in na bil uh na doh sam kei uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai, zawlneite’n, “Michih noumau lampi gilou a kipan hongkik unla, Toupa’n na kiang ua leh na pate uh kiang a nidanglai a kipan tangtawn a ding a nou a honpiak gam ah teng un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian dangte kiang ah a na uh sem ding leh amau be ding leh na khut nasep ua ka lungkimlou sak ding in hohkei un; huchi in, k’on hihna kei ding hi, a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh nou ding a hoihlou ding a na khut nasep ua hon hehsak ding in n’on ngaikhe kei uh” Toupa’n a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaiziak in sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ka thu na ngaihkhiak louh ziak un, ngai dih ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mallam nam tengteng ka thukhak ding a, Toupa thupawt in a chi. Ka nasempa Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar leng ka thukhak ding a, amaute hiai gam leh asung a omte leh hiai kim a nam om tengteng sual ding in ka honpi ding a; ka hihmang sipsip ding a, lamdangsak ding leh enghou ding leh segawp nilouh ding in ka bawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan a kiang ua kipan nuamsakna husa leh kipahna husate, mouneipa aw leh mou awte, buhgawi husa ging leh khawnvak vakte ka lamang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hiai avek in a se ding a, lamdangsak ahi ding; hiai namte’n Babulon kumpipa na kum sawmsagih a sem ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan, kum sawmsagih a man hun chiang in Babulon kumpipa leh huai nam, Kaldaite gam, a gitlouhna uh ziak in ka gawt ding a; tangtawn in ka segawp sak ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huai gam tung ah ka thu a tung ua ka gen tengteng, Jeremiah in namte tung a a gen, hiai laibu a gelhsa tengteng ka tungsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nam tuamtuam leh kumpipa thupi takte’n amaute in nna a kisep un, amau mahmah in leng amau nna a hon sepsak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa Israelte Pathian in ka kiang ah hichi in a chi: Ka khut a hiai hehna uain nou la inla, k’on sawlna ding nam teng dawnsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A dawn ding ua, a hoi dongdong ding ua, a hai ding ua, a kiang ua ka sawl ding namsau ziak in chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in, Toupa khut a nou ka la a, Toupa’n hon sawlna nam teng ka dawnsak hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai bel hiaite ahi uhi: Jerusalem leh Judah khopite, huai kumpipate leh heutute, siatgawpnate, lamdangsakte, enghou dingte, hamsiatte tang ding in, tua a omdan bang uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aigupta kumpipa Pharo leh a sikhate, a heutute leh a mi tengtengte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Milak a hel tengteng; Uz gam a kumpipa teng; Philistia gam a kumpipa tengteng, Askelon leh Gaza leh Ekron leh Ashdod a omsunte kumpipate;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Edom leh Moab leh Ammon suante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tura kumpipa tengteng leh Sidon kumpipate leh tuipi gei kumpipate;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dedan leh Tema leh Buz leh a bak sam uh mette tengteng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Arabia kumpipa tengteng, Gamdai a teng nam kihelte kumpipate;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zimri kumpipa tengteng; Elam kumpipa tengteng; Media kumpipa tengteng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mallam kumpipa tengteng, a gamla leh a nai a mi a kizom zel in; leitung a kumpi om tengteng in a dawn khit chiang in Seshak kumpipa’n a dawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huan, a kiang uah sepaihte Toupa , Israelte Pathian in hichi in a chi: Dawn unla, kham unla, lau unla, kipuk unla thou nawn kei un, namsau na lak ua ka sawl ding ziak in, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huan, na khut a nou pen dawn ding a a lak nop kei uleh huchi in na chi ding: sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Na dawn ngeingei ding uh; hiai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka min tam khopi ah thil hoihlou ka hih pan a, noute gawtlouh hial in na om ding umaw? Gawtlouh in na omkei ding ua; lei a teng tengteng tung ah namsau ka kan ding, chih sepaihte Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huaiziak in a tung ah hiaite gen inla, a kiang uah huchi in chi in: Toupa mun sang a kipan in a thum ding, a tenna siangthou a kipan a aw a suah ding, a huang tung ah nakpi’n a thum ding; grep sukmite bang in a kikou ding, lei luahte teng tung ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lei tawppha in husa a thangkik ding a, Toupa’n namte a lang a, sa tengteng tung ah vai a hawm ding, mi thuginalou zaw namsau kiang ah a pe ding, Toupa thupawt in a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngai in, thil hoihlou in namchih a honnuai ding hi, huihpi hat mahmah lei mun tawp a kipan in a hong kuan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Huai ni chia Toupa thahte’n lei tawp a kipan in lei tawppha in a khak ding ua; sun louh leh khop louh leh vui louh in a om ding ua; leitung a eklei lel ahi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Belamchingmite aw kikou tuaituai unla, kap un, nou belamhon lak a makaite aw, kitung buatbuat un, thah a na om ni uleh na dalhzak nite uh a hongtung petmahta hi. Bel deihhuai bang in na puk ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Belamching mite’n taimangna lampi a neikei ding ua, belamhon lak a makaite’n leng pelhna lampi a neikei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Belamchingmite kah husa, belamhon lak a makaite mau ging toh, Toupa’n a tatna mun uh a suksiat lel ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huang muanhuaite daihsak sipsip in a omta ua, Toupa heh mahmah ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A bukna pawtsanta, humpinelkai bang in, nuaisiahna namsau lauhuai ziak leh, a heh mahmah ziak in a gam uh a sekhinta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Josiah tapa Jehoiakim vaihawm pattung in hiai thu Toupa kiang a kipan a hongtung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Toupa inn huangsung ah ding inla, Judah khopi tengteng Pathian be ding a Toupa inn a hongpaite kiang ah a kiang ua gen ding a thu ka honpiak tengteng khat lel leng im lou in genvek in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Michih in a omdan gilou uh paisan in a ngaikhe zenzen mawh ding uhia, a thilhih gilou uh ziak a a tung ua thil hoihlou hih ka tup ka khek theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang a kiang uah, Toupa’n hichi in a chi: n’on ngaihkhiak louh ua, ka dan na ma ua ka koih na zuih louh ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zing pipi a thou a amau ka sawlna kiang ua ka sawl ka nasemmi zawlnei thu na limsak kei uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiai inn Siloh bang in ka bawl ding a, leitung a nam tengtengte hamsia thuak ding in ka bawl ding, na chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan, siampute, zawlneite leh mipi tengteng in Toupa inn a Jeremiah in hiai thu a gen a ngaikhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in, hichi ahia, mipi tengteng kiang a gen ding a Toupa’n a piak teng a gen khit in, siampute, zawlneite leh mipi tengteng in amah a manta ua, “Si peuhmah niteh!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangdia Toupa min lou a, “Hiai inn Siloh bang ahi ding, hiai khopi luahmi omlou in a segawp ding, chia gen na hia?” a chi ua. Huchi in Toupa inn a mipi tengteng in Jeremiah a boh lutlut uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah heutute’n hiai thu a zak un, kumpipa inn a kipan in Toupa inn lutna Toupa inn kongpi thak ah a tu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in, siampute leh zawlneite’n heutute leh mipi tengteng kiang ah, “Hiai mi sitak ahi, khopi siat ding thu, na bil ua na zak bang un a genkhol ngal a” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan, heutute leh mipi tengteng kiang ah Jeremiah in, “Na thu ngaihkhiak khitsate uh bang in hiai inn leh hiai khopi siat ding thu gen ding in Toupa’n kei a honsawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaiziak in tuin na omdan uleh na gamtatdan uh bawlhoih unla, Toupa na Pathian uh thu mang un; huchi in Toupa’n na tung ua thil hoihlou tungding a phuankhiaksa a kikhelsak thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei ka hihleh, na khut ua om ka hi. Dik leh hoih na chih bang un hon bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na honthah uleh, noumau leh hiai khopi leh khua leh tuite tung ah mi hoih sisan na tungsak ding uh chih thei mai un; a diktak in na bil ua hiai thute gen dia Toupa’n na kiang ua honsawl ka hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in heutute leh mipite’n, siampute leh zawlneite kiang ah, “Hiai mi a sih ding ahi kei, Toupa i Pathian mun a i kiang ua thu gen ahi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan, huai gam Upa kuate hiam a hong dingua, mipi omkhawmte kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mikah, Moreseth mi’n Judah kumpipa Hezekiah vaihawm lai in thu a gen a, Judah mi tengteng kiang ah, Sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Zion lou bang a leh ahi ding a, Jerusalem thil se omkhawm ahi ding, a inn mual gammang mun sang bang ahi ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Hezekiah leh Judahte tengteng in amah a that uhia? Toupa lau in Toupa deihsakna a ngen ua, Toupa’n a tung ua thil hoihlou tung ding a phuan a kikhelsak ahi kei maw? En zaw i tung ua thil hoihlou tungsak ding i hi ve ua! a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huan, midang, Toupa min a thugen Keriath jearim a mi Semaiah tapa Uriah mah leng a om a, Jeremiah thugen tengteng mah bang in hiai gam leh khopi siat ding thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kumpipa Jehoiakim leh a mi thupite leh heutute in a zak un kumpipa’n hihlup a tuma; himahleh Uriah in a zak in a lau a, a taimang a, Aigupta gam ah a paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kumpipa Jehoiakim in Aigupta gam ah mi a sawl a, Akbor tapa Elnathan leh midangte toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in, Aigupta gam a kipan in Uriah a pi khia ua, kumpipa Jehoiakim kiang ah a honpi ua, huai in namsau in a that a, a luang vantang han ah a pailut ua, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Himahleh Saphan tapa Ahikam in Jeremiah a gum a, huchi in hihlup ding in mipite kiang ah piak ahita kei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Josiah tapa Zedekiah vaihawm pattung in, Toupa kiang a kipan in hiai thu a hongtung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n ka kiang ah hichi in a chi: Hakkolte leh a khaute bawl inla, na ngawng ah bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan, Edom kumpipa, Moab kumpipa, Ammon mite kumpipa, Tura kumpipa, Sidon kumpipa kiang ah kumpipa Zedekiah kiang a a mi sawl, Jerusalem a hongpaite khut ah khak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiai thute a pute uh kiang ah gensak in: Hichi in Israel Pathian, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi: huchi in na pute uh kiang a na gen ding uh ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka thilhihtheihna thupitak leh ka banzak in leite, mihingte leh leitung a sate ka bawl vek a, piak tuak ka chihte kiang ah ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin leng ka nasempa Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar khut ah hiai gam tengteng ka pe khinta hi, gamsate leng amah nasem ding in ka pelai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah gam hun tak a tun ma in nam tengteng in amah leh a tapate leh a tapa tate na a sem ding ua, huai nung in bel nam tampite leh kumpipa thupi mahmahte’n amah sikha din a bawl ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar hakkol paw nuam lou leh a na sem nuam lou nam leh lalna gam namsau leh kial leh hipi a amah khut a ka hihman vek masiah amau ka gawt zel ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Noute’n a hileh na zawlneite uh, na aisansiamte uh; na mangte uh, na bumsiamte uh, na kiang ua, “Babulon kumpipa nna na sem kei ding uh” chi a genmite ngaikhe kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na gam ua kipan a gamlapi a pimang a na om theihna ding un, na kiang uah zuauthu a gen khol uh ahi: ka hondelh khiak a na manthat na ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh Babulon kimpipa hakkol pua a, na sem nuam nam bel a gam ngei uah ka omsak ding a, lei a let ding uh, huai ah a teng gige ding uh, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan, Judah kumpipa Zedekiah kiang ah hiai thu tengteng bangzel in ka gen a: Babulon kumpipa hakkol pua unla, amah leh a mite nasem unla, na hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Babulon kumpipa nasem nuam lou nam tungtang Toupa’n a gensa bang in bangdia namsaute, kialte, hipite a nang leh na mite si ding na hi ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zawlnei na kiang ua, Babulon kumpipa na sem kei un, chite thu ngaikhe kei un; na kiang uah zuauthu a gen lel uh ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka sawl ahi kei ua, ka min sial in zuauthu a gen nak ua, nou leh na kiang ua thugen zawlneite ka delhkhia a, na manthat theihna ding un Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Siampute leh hiai mipite tengteng kiang ah leng ka gen sam a: Toupa’n hichi in a chi ahi: Zawlnei na kiang ua thugen, “Ngai un, Toupa inn a belsuante Babulon a kipan inn hontut ahi pah ding hi,” chi mite thu ngaikhe kei un, na kiang uah zuau a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amaute ngaikhe hetkei un; Babulon kumpipa na sem unla, na hing ding uh; bangdi’n hiai khopi a segawp dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Himahleh zawlnei a hih ua, Toupa thu a kiang ua om petmah ahihleh Toupa inn leh Judah kumpipa inn leh Jerusalem a belsuan nutsiat a omlaite Babulon a tut a hih louhna ding in sepaihte Toupa kiang ah ngen uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n , khuam sangte, dal tuipangte, kingaknate leh hiai khopi a belsuan nutsiat a omsunte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in Judah kumpipa Jehoiakim tapa, Jekoniah leh Judah leh Jerusalem a mi hoih tengteng Jerusalem a kipan a Babulon sal a dia a pi lai a a lak val tungtang thu huchi in a gen hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi, sepaihte Toupa , Israel Pathian in Toupa inn leh Judah kumpipa inn leh Jerusalem a belsuan nutsiat a omlai tungtang thu a gen ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Babulon ah lakmang ahi ding ua, amaute ka hongveh masiah huai ah a om nilouh ding uh; amau ka latou nawn ding a, hiai mun ah ka koih nawn ding a, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hichi a honghi a, huai kum mah in, Judah kumpipa Zedekiah vaihawm pattung lam, a kum lina, kha ngana ah zawlnei Hananiah, Azzur tapa Gibeon min siampute leh mipi tengteng ma ah, Toupa inn ah, hon houpih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa , Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi: “Babulon kumpipa hakkol ka hihtanta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum nih sung vengveng in Toupa inn a belsuan Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in hiai mun a kipan a a lak a, Babulon tan a a paipih tengteng, hiai mun mahmah ah ka hontun nawn vek ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiai mun ah Judah kumpipa Jehoiakim tapa, Jekoniah leh Babulon a hoh Judah sal tengteng ka pi nawn ding; Babulon kumpipa hakkol lah ka hihtan ding ahi ngal a, chih Toupa thupawt ahi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan zawlnei Jeremiah in siampute leh Toupa inn ading mipi tengteng ma ah zawlnei Hananiah kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zawlnei Jeremiah ngei in, “Amen, Toupa’n huchibang in hih ngei hen; Toupa inn a belsuante leh saltanna a mi tengteng Babulon a kipan hiai mun a hontun ding a na gen Toupa’n hih ngei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh mipi tengteng leh nang bil a ka thugen ngaikhia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei leh nang ma a nidang a zawlneite’n gam tampi tung ah leh lalna gam thupi pite tung ah kidounate, thilhoihloute, leh hipi thute a gen sek uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zawlnei muanna thu genmi thugen a hongtun hun chiang in, huai zawlnei pen Toupa’n a sawl ngei ahi chih a kithei mai ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan, zawlnei Hananiah in hakkol, zawlnei Jeremiah puak a la a, a hihtan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mipi tengteng ma ah Hananiah in, “Hichi in Toupa’n a chi: Hichibang ngei in Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar hakkol kum nih sung vengveng in namte tengteng ngawng a kipan ka hihtan ding a chi hi” Huchi in, zawlnei Jeremiah in a paisanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan, zawlnei Hananiah in zawlnei Jeremiah ngawng a kipan hakkol a hihtan nung in Jeremiah kiang ah Toupa thu a hongtung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kuan inla, Hananiah kiang ah huchi in vachi in, Hichi in Toupa’n a chi: Sing hakkol na hihtan a, a tang in sik hakkol na bawlsak zaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hichi in Israel Pathian, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi ngal a, Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar na a sep theihna ding un hiai nam tengteng sik hakkol ka pawsak ding ahi: amah na a sem ding uh: gamnuai a gamsate leng amah ka pelai ahi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan, zawlnei Jeremiah in zawlnei Hananiah kiang ah, “Ngai in, Hananiah, Toupa’n nang a honsawl peuhmah kei hi: Hiai mite zuau na muangsak lel ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huaiziak in huchi in Toupa’n a chi: Ngai dih, leitung a kipan k’on hihmang vengveng ding: Toupa tung a helna thu na gen ziak in tukum mahmah in na si ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in, huai kum mah in, kha sagihna ah zawlnei Hananiah a sita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zawlnei Jeremiah in Jerusalem a kipan a saltang upate, siampute, zawlneite, midangte, Nebukadnezzar in Jerusalem a kipan a Babulon a a pi khit, a damsunte kiang a a laikhak thu hiai ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa Jekoniahte, kumpinute, michilgehte, Judah leh Jerusalem heutute, mi khutsiamte, siksekmite Jerusalem a paikhiak nung ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sha-phan tapa, Elasah leh Hilkiah tapa, Gemariahte khut ah a khak hi: huaite bel Judah kumpipa Zedekiah in Babulon gam a Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar kiang a a sawlte ahi uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel Pathian, sepaihte Toupa’n saltang tengteng, Jerusalem a kipan Babulon sal dia ka pisaksate kiang ah hichi in a chi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Inn lam unla, huai ah teng un, huan bawl unla, a gah ne unla, zi nei unla, tanute tapate nei un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na tapate uh zi neisak unla, na tanute uh pasal neisak unla, tanu tapa a neih theihna ding un: huai ah hongpung unla, kiam lam nawt kei un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sal dia k’on tansakna khopi hoihna ding zong unla, Toupa kiang ah ngetsak un: amah hoihna ah nou leng hoihna na mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel Pathian, sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Na lak ua zawlneite leh aisansiamte’n honkhem kei uhenla, a mang a mat uh leng ngaikhe sam kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka min sial in zuauthu na kiang ah a gen uhi: kei sawl ahi kei ua, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi ngal a, Babulon ading in kum sawmsagih a chin chiang in ka hongveh ding a, na kiang ua ka thuchiam hoihtak ka tungsak ding, hiai mun ah k’on kiknawn sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nou lam a ka lungsim putdan ka kithei hi, na hun nanung tawp ua lametna leh tunung honpe ding in thil hoihlou hilou in hoihna ngaihtuah ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan, n’on kan ding ua, ka kiang ah n’ong thum ding ua, k’on ngaikhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />N’on zong ding ua, na lungtang tengteng ua n’on zon hun chiang un n’on mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in, n’on muh un ka om ding, Toupa thupawt in a chi, na omdan uh ka kheng ding a, nam tengteng lak a k’on dalhsakna mun a kipan k’on pikhawm nawn ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi; sal dia k’on matsakna mun ngei ah k’on tungsak nawn ding hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“ Toupa’n Babulon gam ah leng zawlnei hon bawlsak” na chi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa’n David tutphah ah kumpipa tungtang thu leh hiai khopi a teng mipi tengteng, sal dia pi tellouh, na unaute uh tungtang thu ah hichi in a chi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngai un, a tung uah namsau, kial leh hipi in ka delhzui ding a, theipi hut, a hoihlouh mahmah ziak a nek tuak hetlou bang mai in ka bawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Namsau, kial, hipi in ka delhzui ding a, leitung a lalna gam tengteng lak ah thil mulkimhuaitak in ka bawl ding a, amau ka dalhsakna nam tengteng lak ah hamsethuak din, lamdang sak chiat din, hamsiat khum, selphou leh gensiat hi ding in ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Phalvak a thou a ka nasem, zawlnei zang a ka thu na kiang ua ka hontut khawk a sak louh ziak un. Toupa thupawt in a chi: na ngaikhe nuam ngal kei ua, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huaiziak in nou Jerusalem a kipan a Babulon a ka sawl, saltang tengteng aw, Toupa thu ngaikhia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel Pathian, sepaihte Toupa’n Kolaiah tapa, Ahab leh Maaseiahtapa, Zedekiah ka minsial a na kiang ua zuauthu genmite tungtang thu ah hichi in a chi: Ngai un, Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar khut ah ka mansak ding hi; na mitmuh ngei un a that ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amau thu ah Babulon gam a Judah saltang tengteng in, “Babulon kumpipa’n mei a a em Zedekiah leh Ahab bang mai in Toupa’n na tung ah hih hen” chih hamse lohna in a neih loh ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel gam ah thil haihuaitak a hih ua, invengte uh zite ang a kawm ua, ka minsial in ka thupiak louh in zuauthu a gen ziak un; kei a theipa leh a theihpihpa ka hi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nehelam mi, Semaiah tungtang thu ah nang hichi a na gen ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel Pathian, sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi a, Jerusalem mipi tengtengte kiang ah nangmah min mahmah in lai na khak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Toupa’n siampu Jehoiada sik in siampu di’n nang a honbawl a, Toupa inn kemmi na hi ua, mihai, zawlnei kichi peuhte kemte, sikkolte na butsak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huchi in bangdia Anathoth khua a mi Jeremiah, na kiang ua zawlnei kichi na taihilh louh uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Babulon gam ah i kiang uah, “Saltanna ding a sawt ding a, inn lam unla, hiai ah teng unla, huan bawl unla, a gah ne un, chih thu a honkhak hi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huan, siampu Zephaniah in huai laikhak zawlnei Jeremiah zak in a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi in, Jeremiah kiang ah Toupa thu a hongtungta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Saltangte tengteng kiang ah, Nehelam mi Semaiah tungtang thu ah Toupa’n huchi in a a chi: Ka sawl hetlouh in Semaiah in na kiang uah thu a gen a, zuauthu nou a hon gingta sak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngai un, Nehelam mi Semaiah leh a suante ka gawt ding a, hiai mite lak ah mi khat lel leng a neikei ding, ka mite ding a thil hoih ka hih ding a mu kei ding: Toupa tung ah helna thu a gen ziak in, chih Toupa thupawt ahi, chi in khak in a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeremiah kiang ah Toupa a kipan thu hongtung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi: Na kiang a thu ka gen tengteng laibu ah gelh in, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai in, Israel leh Judah, ka mite omdan ka kikhelsakna ding nite a hongtung lellel hi; gam, a pipute uh kiang a ka piak ah ka pikik nawn ding a, a luahta ding uh, chih Toupa thupawt ahi, chi in Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan, Judah leh Israel tungtang thu a Toupa thugen hiaite ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi ahi: Lauthawngna husa ka za ua, launa kikou husa, muanna hilou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dong vialvial unla, en vialvial dih ua, pasal in nau a vei ngei uhia? Bangdia numei nauvei bang zen a, pasal a tai uh a dep chiat ua, a melte uh a hong molh khit?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maizen aw! Huai ni thupi hina mai e, a kibatpih mahmah a omkei, Jakob mangbat ni ahi mah ngut hi, himahleh hotkhiak in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai ni’n hichi ahi ding a, a hakkol puak ka hihtan ding a, a khau leng ka kitatsak ding: pautuam mite’n amah nasempa ding in a zang ngei nawn kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa a Pathian uh leh a kumpipa uh ding a ka tunding ding David na a sem zaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaiziak in, aw ka nasempa Jakob, Lau het ken aw, Israel lunglel hetken, chih Toupa thupawt ahi. Ngai in, gamlapi a kipan in ka hong hunkhe ding a, a saltanna ua kipan na suante ngei, huan Jakob a kiknawn ding a, kuamah in a lausak ngei nawn kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang honhun ding in na kiang ah ka om gige ngal a, k’on dalhsakna nam tengteng, ka beisak ding a, nang bel beisak lou in: a hunlel in k’on gawt ding a, gawtlouh in na pawt hetkei ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi ngal a, Na liamna hihdam theih ahi kei a, na meima a thupi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang hon panpih ding a omkei ua, na damna ding damdawi a omsam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang honitte’n a hon mangngilhta ua, hon limsakta kei uhi: melma liamna in k’on liamsak a, dawmlou in k’on gawt hi, na thulimlouhna a thupi a, na thilhih giloute a pun ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangdia na liamziak a kap na hia? Na liamna hihdam theih ahi kei, na thulimlouhna a thupi a, na thilhih khelhte a pun ziak in, hiai thilte na tung a hih ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh nang hon negaite, nekgaih in a om ding ua, na melmate michih, sal dia pi in a om ding uh, nang honlokte loh in a om ding ua, gallak a honlate gallak in ka la ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />K’on damsak nawn ding a, na liamnate ka hihdam ding; Toupa thupawt in a chi; Delhkhiak, a honchi ua, Kuamah limsaklouh Zion ahi, a honchih ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi, Ngai in, Jakob puanin saltangte ka lehhei ding a, a tenna munte ka hehpih ding a, a khopi a omna mual ngei ah lam ahi ding a, a kumpipa in a omdan ngei in ading nawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kipahthugenna leh nuamsakna husa, huaite apan a hong pawtkhe ding a, Mite ka pungsak ding a, a tawm kei ding uh, amau ka hihthupi ding a, a neu kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A tate uh leng nidanglai bang in a om ding ua, ka ma ah a pungkhawm un a kip ding ua; amaute nuaisiahmite peuhmah ka gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A heutupa uh amau mi mah ahi ding a, a vaihawmpa uh amau lak a hongpawt mah ahi ding; a honnaih ding a, amah ka bawl dia, aman a honnaih ding; kua ahia amah thu a honnaih ngam ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huan ka mite na hi ding ua, kei na Pathian uh ka hi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngai un, Toupa huihpi, a hehna huihpi hat mahmah a pawtkheta a: migiloute lu a nuai ek ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A lungtang tupnate a tangtun a a hih khit masiah, Toupa hehna lauhuai mahmah a kikhel kei ding: ni nanungte ah n’on theisiam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in kei Israel inkuante Pathian ka hi ding a, amau leng ka mite ahi ding uh, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Namsau thah valte, gamdai gam a ka khawl tawldamsak lai in hehpihna a mu ua, Israel mahmah ka tawldamsak lai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nidang a ka kiang a Toupa hong kilang in, hichi in a chi: Ahi, it tawplou in ka hon it a, huaiziak in lainatna in ka hon kai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />K’on ding thaksak ding, aw: nungak siangthou Israel, din kipsak na honghi ding a, na khuangte toh kizem in na om nawn ding a, nuamsak lai lamna munte ah na tel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Grephuante Samaria tangdung tawn in na bawl ding a, a tengmite’n a ching ding ua, a gahte a ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ephraim tanggamte ah, chingmite kikou ni a tung ding hi. Thou un, Zion ah i hoh ding uh, Toupa i Pathian uh kiang ah, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi hi, Jakob ading in nuam in lasa unla, nam thupipen ading in kikou khia un, phuang unla, pahtawi unla, Toupa Israel omsun, na mite hondam in, chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai un, mal gam a kipan in ka honpi ding, kawlmong tawp a kipan ka kaikhawm ding, mittaw, khebai, numei naupaite, nauvei lelte toh, mipi thupitak a hongtung khawm ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khitui toh a hongpai ding ua, khamuangtak in ka pi ding, tui luang lamte ah ka vaksak ding a, a kisuih louhna ding uh lamtangte ah; Israel ading in pa ka hi a, Ephraim bel ka ta chil ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw namte aw, Toupa thu ngaikhia unla, tui gei gam gamlapi ah phuang unla, Israel dalhsakpa’n a pikhawm nawn ding a, Belamchingpa’n a belamte a kem bang in a kem ding chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jakob bel Toupa’n a tankhia a, a sang a hat apan a hunkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zion vum ah lasa in a hongpai ding ua, Toupa hoihna ah a kipak ding ua, buhte, uainte, thaute, belam leh ganhon noute tungte ah a kipak ding uh; a hinna uh tui a vak huan bang ahi ding a, tangtawn in a lungkham nawn kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan, nungak siangthoute lam in a nuam ding ua, tangvalte leng a tek a khang in a nuam ding ua, a lusunna uh kipahna ka suaksak in ka khamuan ding, a dahna ua pan ka kipaksak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siampute hinna thau in ka taisak ding a, ka hoihna in ka mite leng a tai ding uh, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ramah khua ah husa a za ua, misi ngai a kap huphup, Rakil in a tate a kah a, a tate a om nawnlouh ziak in a khamuan theih kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Kap lou ding in na aw dek inla, na khitui hul hen, na thilhih in kipahman a nei ding chih Toupa thupawt ahi. Gal gam a kipan in a hong painawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na hun tawp lam ading in lametna a om a, amau gam ah na tate hong kiknawn ding uh, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ephraim kah leh mauna ka za hi, nang n’on gawt a, bawngtal tuai sawi bang mai in sawi ka hi a, Na kiang ah hon kiksak inla, ka kik ding hi, Toupa ka Pathian na hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />N’on kiksak khitnung in ka kisik a, n’on thuzoh nung in ka pheipi ka beng a, ka zum a, ahi, ka tuailai minsiat thuak in ka amhai hi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ephraim bel ka tapa deihtak, ka nau deihtak a hih ziak hia amah ka thunun teng a ka lungtang a a ten chinten nak? Huchi in ka lungtang in amah a lainat sek a, a tung ah zah ka ngai ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lampi chiamtehna kibawl inla, nang ading in lampi kawkmuhna phut in, na vapawtna lam lampi, lampipen lamngei chiamteh chinten in: aw nungak siangthou, Israel, hong kiknawn in, na khopi ngei ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aw, nang tanu nungtawn, bang tan ahia na vial vakvak ding? Toupa’n lei ah thil thak a bawl ta a, numei in pasal a hum zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel Pathian, sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: A saltanna ua kipan ka pikik hun chiang in Judah gam leh a khopite ah hichibang paukam a zang nawn ding uh: Aw, diktatna tenna mun, Aw tang siangthou, Toupa’n hon vualzawl hen, chih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huai ah Judahte leh a khopi ua mi tengteng a teng khawm ding ua, louneimite leh ganvulmite toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi bahte ka taisakta a, mi lungkham peuhmahte leng ka hihhalhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchi in ka honghalh a, ka nga vialvial a, mang hoihtak a na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngai dih, nite a hongtung ding hi, Israel inkawte leh Judah inkawte ah mihing chi leh gan chi ka tuh ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi ding a, amau botkhia a, hihzan leh paikhia a, hihmang a, hihgim ding a ka tan bang in amau ding hoihsak ding leh tungding ding in ka enkhe nawn ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huai nite in, Pate’n grep thuk a ne ua, a tate uh ha a zau a, a chinawn ngeikei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Michih in amau gitlouhna a sihpih zaw ding ua, grep thuk ne peuhmah ha a zau ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ngai dih, nite a hongtung ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi: huai nite ah Israel inkawte leh Judah inkawte kiang ah thukhun thak ka bawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A pipute uh Aigupta gam a kipan a pikhe ding a a khut uh ka let ni a ka thukhun bang hilou in, amau dia heute ka hih in leng ka thukhun a boh sia ua, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Huaini khit chiang a Israel inkawte kiang a ka thukhun ding bel hiai ahi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi: a sunggil uah ka thupiak ka koih ding a, a lungtang uah ka gelh lai ding a, kei a Pathian uh ka hi ding a, amau ka mite ahi ding uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kuamah in, Toupa thei in, chi in amau invengte leh amau unau a hilh kei ding ua; a neupen a kipan in a lianpen tan in avek un a hon theichiat ding uh, chih Toupa thupawt ahi: a bohsiatna uh ka ngaidam ding a, a khelhna uh leng ka theigige kei ding hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hichi in Toupa , sun vaksak ding a ni pepa, kha leh aksite adia dante sehsak a, zan vaksak ding a pepa, tui kihotte ging honhon ding a tuipi tokthoupa’n a chi ahi: a min sepaihte Toupa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hiai dansehte ka ma a kipan a man leh Israel suante ka ma a kipan in nam hih a tawp den sam ding uh, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Tunglam van tehtheih a hih a, lei kingaknate zonkhiak theih ahihleh Israel suante a thilhihsate uh ziak in ka paimang sam ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ngai in, nite a hongtung lellel hi, Hananel inn sung a kipan in kulh ning kongpi tan in Toupa adin khopi lamkhiak ahi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A tehna khau bel Gareb tang tan in tangtak in a pai zinzen ding a, Goath lam ah a kawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Misi luang leh vut paihna guam pumpi leh gamlak tengteng, Kidron luiguam tan in, suahlam pang Sakol Kongpi ning tan Toupa ding a tan ding ahi; huai bel chikchiang mah a hihzak leh phelsiat ahi nawn kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Zedekiah kum sawmna, huai bel Nebukadnezzar kum sawmlehgiatna Jeremiah kiang a Toupa thu hongtung:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huai in Babulon kumpipa sepaih hon in Jerusalem a um ua; Zawlnei Jeremiah Judah kumpipa inn ngakmi huangsung ah a tang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Zedekiah in, “Bangdia, Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngai in, hiai khopi Babulon kumpipa khut ah ka pe ding a a la ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Zedekiah leng Kaldai mite khut a kipan a pawt kei ding, Babulon kumpipa khut a matsak in a omzaw ding a, kimaituah in a kihoupih ding ua, a mit ngei in a mel a mu ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zedekiah bel Babulon gam ah a pi ding a, amah ka veh mateng huai ah a om nilouh ding: Kaldaite dou mahle uchin na lohching kei ding uh, chih Toupa thupawt ahi, chih gen na hia?” chi in a tangsak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan, Jeremiah in, Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai in, na pangak Shallum tapa Hanamel in Anathoth khua a ka lou nang ading in lei in: “Goukhawm thei na hih ziak in n’on leisak ding ahi chi in na kiang ah a hongpai ding” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in ka pangak tapa Hanamel in, “Anathoth khua a ka lou hon leisak tanla, goukhawm thei na hih ziak in na tat ding ahi, nang ading in lei mai in” a chi a. Huchi in hiai Toupa thu ahi chih ka theita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan, ka pangak tapa Hanamel Anathoth khua a lou ka leita a, dangka ka buksak a, a dangkasik sekel sawmsagih tak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in, lai ka gelh a, ka hilh a, theihpihmi ka sam a, dangka pen bukna ah ka khai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kileina lai kilei dan leh a omdan gelhna bilh leh bilh louhte ka la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan, ka pangak tapa Hanamel mitmuh in leh theihpihmi leina a min tuang teite mitmuh in leh ngakmi huangsung a Judah tu tengteng ma ah Mahseiah tapa Neriah tapa Baruk ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Baruk bel a ma uah thu ka pia a, Israel Pathian sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hiai lai, leina lai, bilh louhte la inla, leibel ah koih inla, a om sawt theihna ding in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel Pathian sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi ngal a: hiai gam ah innte, loute, grephuante mite’n a honlei nawn ding uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan, Neriah tapa Baruk kiang ah leina lai ka piak nung in Toupa kiang ah ka thum hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw Toupa Pathian, ngai in, na thilhihtheihna thupi leh na khutzak in lei leh van na bawl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang adin thilhih haksa lua a om hetkei hi: sang tampite kiang a hehpihna musak sekpa leh pate thulimlouhna a nung ua a tate uh tung a thukpa: Pathian thupi leh thilhihthei: a min sepaihte Toupa :
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thilgel siam tak, thilhihtheitak, mihing tate omdan tengteng mu chianpa:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Michih a omdan uleh a thilhih uh bang a thukpa: Aigupta gam a chiamtehnate leh thillamdang hihpa, tuni tan a Israel leh midang lak a hih zelpa, tuni bang mahmah a min kibawlpa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na mi Israelte, Aigupta gam a kipan chiamtehnate, thil lamdangte, khut hat leh ban zak leh thil mulkimhuai thupitak a pipa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hiai khuaizu leh nawitu a luang gam a pipute uh kiang a kichiam a piakchiam a pepa:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A honglut ua, a luah vek ua, himahleh na paukam a taksang kei ua, na dan a zuikei uhi; hih ding a na piakte a hih kei ua, huaiziak in hiai thil hoihlou tengteng a tung uah na tungsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />En dih, khopi lakna ding leivupte a hong omta ve: namsaute, kialte, hipite ziak in khopi leng a simmi Kaldaite khut ah piak ahita: na gensa a hongtungta: en dih, na muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi a lah, Aw Toupa Pathian, nang ka kiang ah, “Na sum in lou lei inla, thutheimite sam in: khopi bel Kaldaite khut a piak ahita” na chi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huan Toupa thu Jeremiah kiang ah a hongtung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngai in, kei Toupa sa nei tengteng Pathian ka hi, kei ading in haksa lua a om ahia? chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngai in hiai khopi Kaldaite khut ah leh Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar khut ah ka pe ding a, a la ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchi in, hiai khopi simmi Kaldaite a hongpai ding ua, hiai khopi a hal ding ua, a kang ding, hon hehsak ding a Baal kiang a gimlim latna, pathian dangte kiang a dawn ding lat butkhiakna inn tung nei inn tengteng toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Israel tate leh Judah tate’n a tuailai chik ua kipan in ka mitmuh in thil hoihlou ngen a hih uhi: Israel tate’n a khut nasepte un a hon hehsak phet uhi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hiai a khopi a lam tung ua kipan tutan in hon hehsaktu leh hon thangpaisaktu ahi nilouh ngal a: ka ma a kipan a ka hihman vengveng na ding in: Israel tate leh Judah tate hon hehsak ding a a thil hoihlou hih sate uh tengteng ziak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amau, a kumpipate uh, a heutute uh, a siampute uh, a zawlneite uh, Judah mite Jerusalem luahmite tengteng toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kei lam hong ngalou in a deksah uh a honngat ua, tawlnga lou hial in sinsakta mah leng, sinsakna lasawn ding in a ngeingaih kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka min tuanna inn hih thanghuai ding in a kihhuainate uh a koih zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ben Hinnom guam a Baal biakna mun sangte a lamkhia ua, a tanute uh, a tapate uh Molech kiang a mei a a paihna ding un, Judahte thil gilou hihsak ding a hiai kihhuai a hih uh ka thupiak ahi hetkei hi, ka lungsim ah leng a lut ngeikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Huaiziak in tuin zaw Toupa Israel Pathian in, “Hiai khopi, namsau, kial leh hipi in Babulon kumpipa khut ah piak ahita na chih nak uh thu ah hichi in a chi”:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ngai dih, ka hehna, ka lung hihlouhna, ka thangpaihna thupi mahmahte a amau ka delh manna gam teng a kipan ka pikhawm ding a, hiai mun ah ka hontun ding a, bittak in ka omsakta ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Huchi in, ka mite ahi ding ua, kei a Pathian uh ka hi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tangtawn a a honlau den theihna ding un lungtang kibang leh omdan kibang ka bawlsak ding: amau leh a nung ua a tate uh hoihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A kiang uah tangtawn thukhun ka bawl ding a, amau lehngatsan lou in, a hon launa ka hih gige ding; a hon tuamsan louhna ding un a lungtangte uah honlauna uh ka koih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ahi, a hoihna uh hih ka kipahlam ahi ding a, ka lungtang tengteng in hiai gam ah ka phut ngeingei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi ahi: Hiai mite tung a thil hoihlou thupi mahmah ka tut bangtak in amau kiang a thil hoih ka chiam tengtengte ka tungsak ngeingei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Gam segawp, Kaldaite khut a piaksa, mi leh sa om nawn lou, na chih gam uah loute a kilei nawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Benjamin gamte ah, Jerusalem khopi kim munte ah, Judah gam khopite leh simlam khopite ah mite’n dangka in lou a lei ding ua, leina lai a gelh ding ua, a bilh ding ua, theihpihmite a sam ding uhi: a omdan uh ka hei ding hi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Jeremiah kiang ah, ngakmi huangsung a a omlai in, a nihveina ding in Toupa thu a hongtung nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lei bawlpa Toupa , kip ding a bawlpa Toupa’n , Toupa a min ahi, chi in a chi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Honsam lechin, k’on dawng ding a, thil thupi leh thil kisel na theih ngeilouh ka hon ensak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel Pathian Toupa’n hiai khopi innte leh Judah kumpipa innte, namsau leh leivupte lak a venna bawl ding a a phelsiat uh tungtang thu ah hichi in a chi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kaldaite sual ding in amau a hong kuan ua, ka hehna leh thangpaihna a ka thah luangte in a dimsak zaw ding uh, a gitlouhna tengteng ziak un hiai khopi lak ah ka mel ka na sel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai in, damna leh hihdamna ka hontun ding a, k’on damsak ding: muanna leh bitna kiptak k’on musak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah omdan leh Israel omdan ka hei ding a, a tung a ka dinsak bang in ka dingsak nawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan, a thulimlouhna uh, ka tung a a thilhih khelhna lak ua kipan ka sawpsiang ding a, a thulimlouhna uh, ka tung a a thil hihkhelhna uleh ka tung a a tatleknate tengteng uh ka ngaidam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in, hiai khopi lei a nam tengteng, amau adia ka hihhoih tengteng mumite ma ah kei ding in nuamna, pahtawina leh thupina ahi ding a: hoihna muanna a tung ua ka tut tengteng ziak in lau in a ling ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Hiai mun, Judah khopi a mi leh sa om nawn lou a segawp, Jerusalem kholak a mi leh sa leh tengmi omlou a kigawpsa, a chih uah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Sepaihte Toupa kiang ah kipahthu gen un. Toupa lah a hoih ngal a: a chitna lah tangtawn in a om ding hi, chi mite aw leh Toupa inn a kipahna kithoihna hontawi lasa mite aw leh mou awte mouneipa awte a honza nawn ding uh.” A tung a a om bang in gam ka omsak ding," chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Hiai mun, mi leh sa omlou khop a segawpsa leh a khopi tengteng ah, belamchingmi a belamhon uh kualsakmite tenna mun a hongom nawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tang gam khopi ah, phai gam khopi ah, simlam khopi ah, Benjamin gam ah, Jerusalem kim munte ah, Judah khopi ah, amau sim mi khut nuai ah belamte a pai zungzung ding uh, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai in, nite a hongtung lellel hi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi, Israel inkawte tungtang ah leh Judah inkawte tungtang a thu hoihtak ka na genpen ka tangtung sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huai nite leh huai hun chiang in diktatna Hiang David kiang ah ka khangkhe sak ding, huai gam ah diktak leh diktattak in vai a hawm ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai nite in Judah humbit in a om ding, Jerusalem bittak in a om ding: huan, a min put ding hiai ahi ding, “ Toupa i diktatna” chih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi ahi: David in Israel inkawte mangtutphah a tu ding mi a tasam ngeikei ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siampu Levi chite’n leng ka ma a haltum na lan ding leh buh leh bal thil lan ding leh kithoih zel ding in mi a tasam sam kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan, Toupa thu Jeremiah kiang ah a hongtung a: Toupa’n hichi in a chi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka sun seh leh ka zan seh thu na phel theih ua, sun leh zan a hun tak ua omlou ding a na hih theih uleh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka nasempa David kiang a ka thukhun leng a mangtutphah a tu ding tapa a neihlouhna ding a hihsiat ahi phet ding hi: Levi chite, siampute, ka nasem mite kiang a leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Van a omte sim senglouh leh tuipi a piaunel sim senglouh bang mai in ka nasempa David suan leh Levi chi kei n’on sepsak mite ka pungsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toupa thu Jeremiah kiang ah a hongtung:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Inkuan nih Toupa’n a telte a paimangta” chi a hiai mite’n a gen uh na ngaihtuah ngei ka hia? A mitmuh ua namchih tham a hihlouhna ding un hichibang in ka mite a musit uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: ka sun leh zan thu seh a om den louh a, lei leh van omdante ka seh louh ahihleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jakob suante leh ka nasempa David suante ka paimang ding, Abraham, Isak leh Jakob suante tung ah vaihawmmi a suan a kipan ka lakei ding: a omdante uh ka kiheisak in a tung uah hehpihna nei ding ka hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzarte, a sepaih hon tengteng, amah thunuai a lei a vaihawmna gam tengteng leh mipi tengteng in Jerusalem leh a khopi tengteng a sual lai ua Toupa kiang a kipan a Jeremiah kiang a thu hongtung:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel Pathian, Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Judah kumpipa Zedekiah vahoupih in, hichi in a chi: Ngai in, hiai khopi Babulon kumpipa khut ah ka pe ding a, mei in a hal ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A khut a kipan na suakta hetkei ding: mat na hi ding a, a khut ah honpe ding ua, na mit ngei in Babulon kumpipa na mu ding a, paukam ngei in na kihoupih ding ua, Babulon gam ah na hoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh, aw Judah kumpipa, Zedekiah, Toupa thu ngaikhe zel dih: na tungtang thu ah Toupa’n hichi in a chi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Namsau in na si kei ding a, muangtak in ahi na sih ding: na ma a kumpipa masa, na pipute gimlim a halsak bang un, nang leng a hon halsak ding uh: a honsun ding ua, "Ehe heh, ka pu," chi in. Thu ka khahta hi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zawlnei Jeremiah in hiai thu tengteng Jerusalem a Judah kumpipa Zedekiah kiang ah a gen a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Babulon kumpipa sepaih honte’n Jerusalem leh Judah khopi omlai tengteng, Lakish leh Azekah a sual lai un: Judah khopi lak a kulh neite hiaite kia ahita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa Zedekiah in Jerusalem a om mipi tengteng kiang ah, michih in a sikhanu toh a sikhapate uh, Hebru nu hiam Hebru pa hiam a hih uleh, a khah ding uh ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A unaupa Hebru mi nasep sak in kuamah a om ding uh ahi kei, chi a noplenna thu a phuan a, thukhun a bawl nung a Toupa kiang a kipan Jeremiah kiang a thu hongtung:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Michih in nasemnu hiam nasempa hiam a khah ding ahi, amau nna sepsakin kuamah a om ding uh ahi kei, chih thukhun pommi heutu tengteng leh mipi tengteng in thukhun a mang ua, a khahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh huai nung in a kihei ua, a nasemnu uh leh a nasempa uh a khahsate uh a kaikik ua, a thunuai uah nasemmi ding in a koih nawn uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in Jeremiah kiang ah Toupa thu a hongtung nawn hi; Toupa Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aigupta gam, saltanna inn a kipan ka pikhiak ni’n na pipute uh kiang ah thukhun ka bawl a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Michih in a unaupa, Hebru mi, a kiang a zuaksa, kum guk a na nasemsa a kum sagihna tawp in a khah ding ahi, chi in: na pipute un bel a hon ngaikhe kei ua, a bil uh a doh sam kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuin noute’n, na hong kihei ua, michih in a invengpa kiang a noplenna thu phuang in ka mitmuh in thil dik n’on hihta ua: Ka min tam inn ah ka ma ah thukhun na hong kibawlta ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh na kihei nawn ua, ka min na hihbuah un a ut bang tak ua na khahsa nung uh, na sikhanu leh na sikhapa uh na pi kiknawn ua, na thunuai uah nasemmi ding bang sikhanute ding bang in na koih nawn uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Michih amah unau leh amah invengte kiang a noplenna thu phuang ding in ka thu na ngaikhe kei ua; ngai un, ken na kiang uah noplenna thu ka phuang hi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi; namsaute, hipite, kialte in ahi ding; lei a kumpigamte tengteng lak ah vik lenlen ding in k’on bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan, ka thukhun bohsiate, ka ma a bawngnou atphel kikal a paisuak hial a thuchiam a tangtung sakloumi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah heutute leh Jerusalem heutute, michilgehte, siampute, mipi tengteng, bawngnou atphel kikal a paite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A melmate uleh a hinna zongmite khut ah ka pe ding a; huchi in, a luangte uh tung a leng vasate leh lei a gamsate an ding lel ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan, Judah kumpipa Zedekiah leh a lawite a melmate uleh a hinna zongmite leh Babulon kumpipa sepaih hon, nou hon paisansate khut ah ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai un, hiai khopi a hong kiknawn ding in thu ka pe ding a, chih Toupa thupawt ahi, huchi in a sual ding ua, a la ding ua, mei in a hal ding uh: luahmi omlou in Judah khopite ka hihgam vek ding hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Josiah tapa Jehoiakim vaihawmlai a Toupa kiang a kipan a Jeremiah kiang a thu hongtung in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rekab inkawte kiang ah hoh in va houpih inla, Toupa in a dantan khat ah pilut inla, uain dawn ding pia in, a chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan, Habazziniah tapa, Jeremiah tapa, Jaazaniah leh a unaute, a tapa tengteng Rekab inkawte tengteng toh ka pi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian mi Igdali tapa Hanan tate dantan, Toupa inn ah ka pilut a; huai dantan bel heutute dantan chin kongpi ngakmi Shallum tapa Maaseiah dantan tung a om ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in, Rekab suante pate ma ah belhbute, noute uain dim ka tung a, a kiang uah, “Uain dawn un” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amau bel, “Uain ka dawn kei hial ding uh; kou hon suangpa Rekab tapa Jonadab in, Noumau leh na suante un leng tangtawn a uain na dawn ding uh ahi kei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />inn na lam un haichi na tuh un, grephuan leng na bawl un na nei ding uh ahi sam kei hi: na damsung nite un puanin a na ten zawk ding uh ahi, na omna gam ua na damsawt theihna ding un, chi in thu a honpia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in kou hon suangpa Rekab tapa Jonadab in paukam a thu hon thukhah tengteng, ka damsung ua kou leh ka zite uh, ka tapate uleh ka tanute un uain dawn louh ding un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka tenna inn uh lam louh ding, grephuan hiam lou hiam haichi hiam neih louh ding tan in ka zui uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puaninte ah ka teng zaw ua, kou hon suangpa Jonadab thupiak tengteng mang in ka zui vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahia, Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in gam a hongsual lai in kou, Kisa un, Kaldai sepaih honte leh Suria sepaih honte lau ziak in Jerusalem ah i hoh ding uh, ka chi ua, huchi in Jerusalem ah ka tengta uhi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan, Toupa thu Jeremiah kiang ah a hongtung nawn a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel Pathian sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Judah gam a mite leh Jerusalem a mi tengte kiang ah vagen inla, “Ka thute ngaikhe ding in sinsakna na sang kei ding uh maw? chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rekab tapa Jonadab thu, a tapate kiang a a piak, uain dawn louh ding pen a zui ua, tunitan in bangmah a dawn kei ua, amau suangpa thupiak a zui mahmah uh hi: ken bel phalvak a thou in na kiang uah thu ka gen a, n’on ngaikhe kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka nasem zawlneite phalvak a thou in na kiang uah ka sawl a, michih na omdan gilou ua kipan hongkik vek unla, na thilhihte uh bawlhoih unla, pathian dangte zaw a na uh sem ding in zuikei unla; nou leh na pipute uh kiang a gam ka piak ah na teng ding uh chi in; himahleh na bil uh na doh kei ua, n’on ngaikhe sam kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rekab tapa Jonadab suante’n amau suangpa thupiak a zui ua, hiai mite’n zaw a hon ngaikhe kei uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaiziak Toupa Israel Pathian sepaihte Pathian in hichi in a chi: Ngai un, Judah leh Jerusalem a tengte tung ah thil hoihlou a tung ua hongtung ding ka gen khiaksate k’on tun ding: a kiang uah thu ka gen a, a ngaikhe kei ua, amau ka sam a, a hon dawng sam kei uh” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in, Jeremiah in Rekab suante kiang ah: Sepaihte Toupa Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi: Na pa Jonadab thupiak na zui ua, a thupawt tengteng bang a na hih ziak un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rekab tapa Jonadab in tangtawn in ka ma ading ding mi a tasam ngeikei ding, chi in sepaihte Toupa Israel Pathian in a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahia, Judah kumpipa Josiah tapa Jehoiakim vaihawm kum lina ah hiai thu Toupa kiang a kipan Jeremiah kiang ah a hongtung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Laibuzial la inla, hiai ah na kiang a thu ka gen tengteng, Israel tungthu, Judah tungthu, nam tengteng tungthu, na kiang a thu ka gen ni a kipan Josiah hunlai a kipan tuni pha a thu gelh in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah inkawte’n a tung ua thil hoihlou hih ka tup tengteng, a ngaikhia un michih in a omdan gilou uh a heithei khamoh kei ding uh, a thulimlouhna uh leh a khelhna uh ka ngaihdam theihna ding in a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in, Jeremiah in Neriah tapa Baruk a sam a, huchi in Baruk in Toupa thu tengteng, a kiang a a gensa Jeremiah paukam a kipan laibuzial ah a gelh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan, Jeremiah in Baruk kiang ah, “Khakkhum ka hi a, Toupa inn ah ka hoh theikei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in nang hoh inla, Toupa thu ka paukam a kipan laibuzial a na gelh anngawl ni’n, Toupa inn a mipite bil a zak in vasim khia in; a khopi ua kipan a hongpawt Judahte tengteng bil a zak in leng na simkhiak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Michih in a omdan gilou uh a hei un, Toupa ma a hehpihna a ngetna uh a tun thei zenzen kha ding ua, hiai mite tung a hehna leh thangpaihna Toupa’n a genkhiak lah a thupi mahmah ngal a” chi in thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Neriah tapa Baruk in zawlnei Jeremiah thupiak tengteng bang in Toupa inn a Toupa thu laibu a om a simta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahia, Judah kumpipa Josiah tapa Jehoiakim vaihawm kum ngana, kha kua na ah Jerusalem mi tengteng leh Judah khopi a kipan a Jerusalem a hongpai tengteng in anngawl thu a phuangta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan, Baruk in Toupa kongpi thak lutna ah, um sung tungnung zaw a Laigelhmi Shaphan tapa Gemariah dantan, Toupa inn a om ah Jeremiah thu laibu a om, mi tengteng bil a zak in a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan, Shaphan tapa Gemariah tapa Mikaiah in laibu a om Toupa thu tengteng a na zak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kumpipa inn ah a hohsuk a, Laigelhmi dantan ah a lut a, huan, ngai dih, huai ah heutu tengteng a na tu ua, Laigelhmi Elishamte, Semaiah tapa Delaiah, Akbor tapa Elnathan, Shaphan tapa Gemariah, Hananiah tapa Zedekiah leh heutu tengteng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan, Mikaiah in mite bil a zak in Baruk in laibu a sim thu a na zak tengteng a hilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan, heutu tengteng in Kusi tapa, Shelemiah tapa Nethaniah tapa Jehudi Baruk kiang ah a sawl ua, a kiang ah, “Mite bil a zak a nasim laibu tawi in hong in” chi ding in. Huchi in Neriah tapa Baruk bel laibuzial tawi in a kiang uah a hong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kiang ah, “Tu inla, ka bil ua ka zak ngei un sim dihve leh” a chi ua, huchi in Baruk in a bil ua a zak un a simta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, huai thute a zak uleh lau in a ki en chiat ua, Baruk kiang ah, “Hiai thu tengteng kumpipa ka hilh ngeingei ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Baruk kiang ah, “Hiai thu tengteng na kam a kipan bangchi dan a gelh na hia, honhilh in?” chi in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Baruk in, “Hiai thu tengteng a paukam in a honhilh a, laitui in laibu ah ka gelh mai ahi” chi in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Heutute’n Baruk kiang ah, “Kuan unla, Jeremiah toh bu un; kuamah in na omna uh theikei uhen” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in, huangsung ah kumpipa kiang ah a lut ua; laibuzial bel Laigelhmi Elishama dantan ah a koih ua; a thu tengteng paukam in kumpipa a hilh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n laibuzial la ding in Jehudi a sawl a, Laigelhmi Elishama dantan a kipan a la uhi. Huan, Jehudi in kumpipa leh kumpipa kiang a ding heutu tengteng bil a zak in a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kha kua na ahia, kumpipa bel a phalbi in ah a tu a, a ma ah meihol thuk ah kuang a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hichi a honghi a, Jehudi in khep thum hiam khep li hiam a sim in kumpipa in a temta in a at tan a, thuk mei ah a zial bu pum kangmang vek ding in a lawnlutzel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kumpipa leh a nasemmi’n hiai thu tengteng ngaikhia mite kuamah a lau kei ua, a puansilh uh leng a botkek sam kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huai phet hilou in Elnathan leh Delaiah leh Gemariahte’n laibuzial hal lou ding in kumpipa kiang ah a ngen ua, himahleh a ngaikhe nuam kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huan, kumpipa’n kumpipa tapa Jerahmeel leh Azriel tapa Seraiah leh Abdeel tapa Shelemiah Baruk Laigelhmi leh zawlnei Jeremiah man ding in thu a pia: himahleh Toupa’n amau a sel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huan, laibuzial leh Jeremiah kam a kipan Baruk in a gelh tengteng thute kumpipa’n a haltum khit in Toupa thu Jeremiah kiang ah a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Laibuzial dang la inla, laibuzial masa a thu tengteng, Judah kumpipa Jehoiakim in a hal mangsate gelh nawn vek in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Jehoiakim tungtang thu ah huchi in na chi ding hi: Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Babulon kumpipa hongpai ding a, hiai gam a hihsia in, hiai mi leh sa a hihmang vek ding, chi a gelhna bangdia huchibang thu gelh, chi in laibu na halta hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Judah kumpipa Jehoiakim tungthu ah Toupa’n hichi in a chi: David tutphah a tuding mi a neikei ding: a luang leng sun nisa ah leh zan vuk nuai ah paihkhiak ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A thulimlouhna uh ziak in amah leh a suante leh a nasemmite ka gawt ding: amau leh Jerusalem a tengte leh Judah mite tung ah a tung ua ka phuansa, a ngaihkhiak kei uleh thil hoihlou tengteng ka hontun ding, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huchi in Jeremiah in laibuzial dang a la a, Neriah tapa Baruk laigelhmi a pia a, aman huai ah Jeremiah kam a kipan laibu gelhsa tengteng, Jehoiakim in mei a a khulmangsa thute a gelh a: huaiban ah a kibatpih thu tampi a behlap lai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Josiah tapa Zedekiah, Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in, Judah gam kumpipa ding a a bawl Jehoiakim tapa Koniah sik in vai a hawmta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Himahleh amah leh a nasem mite leh a gam a mite’n Toupa thu zawlnei Jeremiah kam a gen a ngaikhe kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan, kumpipa Zedekiah in Shelemiah tapa Jehukal leh Maaseiah tapa siampu Zephaniah bel zawlnei Jeremiah kiang ah, “ Toupa ka Pathian kiang ah hon thumsak in” chi ding in a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jeremiah bel mipite lak ah a utut in a vakthei lai a: tanna inn ah lah a koih ngal kei ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pharo sepaih honte Aigupta a kipan a hong pawtkheta ua: huchi in Kaldaite Jerusalem um mite’n a tanchin a zak un Jerusalem a tawpsanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in, Toupa thu zawlnei Jeremiah kiang ah a hongtung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi: Judah kumpipa hondong ding a nou honsawl kiang ah, ngai in, Pharo sepaih hon, nou hon panpih ding a hongpaite amau gam Aigupta ah a kiknawn ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kaldaite a hongding ua, hiai khopi a sual dingua, a la dingua, meiin a halding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Kaldaite’n a hon paisan ngei ding uh” chi in, nou kikhem kei un, a hon pai sankei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nou honsual Kaldai sepaihte bawl ek mahle uchin, a lak ua miliam omsunte kia in leng amau puanin a kipan in hong thouin hiai khopi mei in a hal thouthou ding uh, chi in na gen ding ahi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, Pharo sepaih honte lau ziak a Kaldai sepaih honte’n Jerusalem a paisan lai un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jeremiah in mite lak a a tantuan la ding in Benjamin gam a lut ding in Jerusalem a pawtsan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Benjamin kongpi a tun in ngakmi heutu Hananiah tapa Shelemiah tapa a min Irijah a na om a; huai in “Kaldaite kiang a kipia na hi” chi in zawlnei Jeremiah a na man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jeremiah in, “Zuau ahi; Kaldaite kiang ah ka kipe kei” a chi a: himahleh a ngaikhe kei a, huchi in Irijah in Jeremiah a na man a, heutute kiang ah a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan heutute Jeremiah tung ah a heh mahmah ua, a sat ua, Laigelhmi Jonathan inn ah a khum uhi; huai tan in dia a zat him uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in, Jeremiah leinuai kawkhuk ah a lut a, ni tampi tak a om nung in kumpipa Zedekiah in a samkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan, kumpipa’n a inn ah a guk in a kiang ah “ Toupa kiang a kipan thu banghiam bek a om hia?” chi in a dong hi. Jeremiah in, “Om e” a chi hi. A kiang ah, “Babulon kumpipa khut ah matsak in na om ding” a chilai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jeremiah in kumpipa Zedekiah kiang ah, “Nang hiam na nasemmi hiam hiai mite tung ah bang thil ahia ka hihkhelh a n’on matsak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang kiang a ‘Babulon kumpipa nang leh hiai gam dou ding in a hongpai kei ding, chi a thu genmi na zawlneite koi a om ahita ua?’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw, ka pu, kumpipa ngaikhia in, k’on ngen ahi, ka ngetna na sang in, ka hon ngen hi; Laigelhmi Jonathan inn ah hon kiksak nawn ken, huai ah ka si kha ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in, kumpipa Zedekiah in thu a pia a, Jeremiah bel ngakmi huangsung ah a tangsak a, tanghou bawlmite kongzing a kipan niteng in tanghou beu khat, khopi a tanghou a omlai siah a pia ua, huchibang in Jeremiah bel ngakmi huangsung ah a om nilouh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Mattan tapa Sephatiah leh Pashur tapa Gedaliah leh Shelemiah tapa Jukal leh Malkiah tapa Pashurte’n, mipi tengteng kiang ah Jeremiah in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: hiai khopi a om nilouhte zaw namsau, kial leh hipi in a si ding ua, Kaldaite kiang a kipia bel a hing ding ua, a hinna a ki humbit ding a a hing ding, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: hiai khopi Babulon kumpipa sepaih honte khut ah piak ahi ngei ding a, a la ding, chi a a gen a ngaikhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in, heutute’n kumpipa kiang ah, “Hiai mi hihlup hi hen, k’on ngen uh; aman a kiang ua hiai thute gen in hiai khopi a galkapmi omlaite leh mipi tengteng tha a hatkei sak a: hiai mi’n hiai mipite hoihna a zong kei a, a siatna a zong zaw hi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan, kumpipa Zedekiah in, “Ngai un, amah na khut ua om ahi: kumpipa na deihlouh lam uh hihthei ahi sam a” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in, Jeremiah a pi ua, ngakmi huangsung a om kumpipa tapa Malkiah lei nuai khuk ah a pailut ua; Jeremiah bel khau in a khe suk ua, huai lei nuai khuk ah buannawi kia loungal tui a omkei a: Jeremiah bel buannawi ah a kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan, Ethiopia mi, michilgeh kumpipa inn a om sek Ebed-melek in Jeremiah lei nuai khuk ah a koih uh chih a naza a; huchih lai in kumpipa bel Benjamin kongpi ah a tu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ebed-melek bel kumpipa inn a kipan a pawt a, kumpipa kiang ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ka pu, kumpipa, hiai mite’n zawlnei Jeremiah lei khuk a a na paihkhiak uh thil gilou thupi mahmah hih ahi uh, gilkial ziak in a omna mun ah simai ding a kei maw; khopi ah tanghou a om nawn kei a,” a chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan, kumpipa’n Ethiopia mi Ebed-melek thu a pia a, “Hiai a kipan in mi sawmthum pi inla, lei nuai kawkhuk a kipan in a sih ma in zawlnei Jeremiah va lakhia un” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Ebed-melek in mite a pi a, kumpipa dangka inn nuai ah a lut ua, puanak lui paihte leh puansilh siate a lakhia ua, lei nuai khuk ah Jeremiah kiang ah khau in a khaikhe suk uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan, Ethiopia mi Ebed-melek in Jeremiah kiang ah, “Hiai puanak luite leh puansilh siate na lenuai ah khau in gakkhum in” a chi hi. Huan, Jeremiah in huchibang in a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan, Jeremiah bel lei nuai khuk a kipan khau in a kaikhia ua: Jeremiah bel ngakmi huangsung ah a om nilouh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan, kumpipa Zedekiah in Jeremiah a sam a, Toupa inn a lutna thumna ah a kiang ah a pilut a: huan, kumpipa’n Jeremiah kiang ah, “Thil ka hondong ding; ka lak ah bangmah im ken” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jeremiah in Zedekiah kiang ah, “Honhilh leng n’on that mahmah kei dia hia? Thu hon hanthawn leng hon ngaikhe lou ding chin a” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan kumpipa Zedekiah in Jeremiah kiang ah, “ Toupa hiai ka hinna bawlpa a hin a a hin sungteng k’on hihlum kei hial ding, na hinna zong mite khut ah leng nang ka honpe sam kei ding” chi in a sim in a kichiam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in Jeremiah in Zedekiah kiang ah, “ Toupa , sepaihte Pathian, Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi, ‘Babulon kumpipa heutute kiang ah na kipiak leh na hinna na bitsak ding a, hiai khopi leng a kang kei ding, nang leh na inkawte leng na hing ding uh.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Babulon kumpipa heutute kiang a na kipiak kei lebel hiai khopi Kaldai khut a piak ahi ding a, a hal ding ua, a khut ua kipan na suakta hetkei ding a chi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan kumpipa Zedekiah in Jeremiah kiang ah, “Kaldai mite kiang a kipia Judahte khut ah a hon mansak in nuihzat in a honbawl kha ding uh ka lau ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jeremiah in bel, “A hon mansak kei ding uh; na kiang a ka gen Toupa aw mang mai in. Huchi in nang adin a hoih ding a hin leng na hing ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kipiak na utkei lebel hiai Toupa’n hon thu kawkmuh ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ngai in, Judah kumpipa inn a numei omlaite tengteng Babulon kumpipa heutute kiang ah pi in a om ding ua, huai numeite’n, Na lawm hoih hoihte’n a honkhem ua, a honzouta ua, na khe buannawi a a tumtak in a hon lehngatsan ua” a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na zite, na tanute Kaldai mite kiang ah a pivek ding ua, a khut ua kipan na suakta kei ding a, Babulon kumpipa khut a mat in na omzaw ding a, nang ziak in hiai khopi a kang ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huan Zedekiah in Jeremiah kiang ah, “Hiai thute kuamah in theikei uhen, huchi in na si kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Himahleh heutute’n ka hon houpih a zak ua, na kiang a a hong ua, na kiang a, Kumpipa kiang a na gen honhilh in; ka lak uah bangmah im kenla, k’on that kei ding uh; na kiang a kumpipa thugente leng, a chih uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nang a kiang uah, Jonathan inn a hon kiksak lou a, huai a vasi lou ding in kumpipa kiang ah ngetna ka pelut lel ahi, na chi ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Heutu tengteng in Jeremiah kiang a a hongpai un, a dongta ngei ua, kumpipa’n thu a piak tengteng bang in amau a hilh hi. Huchi in a kihoupih un a tawp ua; a thu theih phak ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in Jeremiah bel Jerusalem lak ni tan in ngakmi huangsung ah a om nilouh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Judah vaihawm kum kua na kha sawmna ah Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar leh a sepaihte’n Jerusalem a sual ua, a um uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zedekiah vaihawm kum sawmlehkhatna kha lina, kha ni kua na ah khopi kulh a phu pailet uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahia, Jerusalem a lak un Babulon kumpipa heutute a honglut ua, kongpi laita ah a tu ua, Nergal sharezarte, Samgar nebote, Sarsekim Rabsari mi Nergal sharezar Rabmag mi leh Babulon kumpipa heutu dangte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan, hichi a honghi a, Judah kumpipa Zedekiah leh galkapmi tengteng in amau a muh un a taikek ua, khopi a kipan zan in kumpipa huai lampi lam ah kulh bang nih kikal kongpi ah a taikhia ua, amah pen Arabah lampi lam ah a pawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh Kaldaite sepaihhon in amah a delh ua, Jeriko phaizang ah Zedekiah a pha ua; huchi in, a mat nung un Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar kiang ah, Hamath gam a Riblah khua ah a pi ua, aman a tungthu a ngaihtuah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in, Babulon kumpipa’n Riblah khua ah amah mitmuh ngei in Zedekiah tapate a that a, Babulon kumpipa’n Judah mi hoihteng leng a that lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huailou leng Jedekiah mit a khelkhia a, kol a bunsak a, Babulon ah a pita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kaldaite’n kumpipa inn leh midang inn tengteng a hal ua, Jerusalem kulh bangte leng a hihsia uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan, ngakmi heutu Nebuzaradan in khopi a mipi omlaite a kiang a amau a kipiate leh mipi omsunte Babulon ah sal in a pi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himahleh ngakmi heutu Nebuzaradan in Judah gam mi genthei bangmah neiloute a nusia a, grephuan leh loute a pe pah ngal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan, Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in Jeremiah tungtang thu a ngakmi Nebuzaradan kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amah pi inla, hoihtak in bawl inla, hihna himhim ken, na kiang a a gen bangbang in hihzel zaw in, chi in thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan, ngakmi heutu Nebuzaradan in Nebushazban Rabsari mi Nergal sharezar Rabmag mi leh Babulon kumpipa sepaih heutu deuhdeuhte a thukhak vek a, amau Jeremiah ngakmi huangsung a kipan a samkhia ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Shaphan tapa Ahikam tapa Gedaliah kiang ah a inn a puak ding in a kemsak ua, huchi in mite lak ah a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan, ngakmi huangsung a khakkhum a a omlai in, Jeremiah kiang ah Toupa thu a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ethiopia mi Ebed-melek kiang ah, Sepaihte Toupa , Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi: Ngai in, a hoihna ding hilou in, hiai khopi siatna ding in ka thute k’on tun ding a, huai ni mahmah in na ma ah tangtun sak ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huai ni’n nang bel k’on hunkhe ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi, na mi kihtakte khut a piak na hi kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang lah k’on humbit ding a, namsau in na puk kei ding a, kei n’on muan ziak in, chih Toupa thupawt ahi, chi in vagen in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah leh Jerusalem sal tengteng, Babulon sal a a pite uh lak a Jeremiah khainiang lenkawm a a pilai a ngakmi a pawtsak nung a Toupa a kipan Jeremiah kiang a thu hongtung:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngakmi heutu in Jeremiah a pia, a kiang ah, “ Toupa i Pathian in hiai mun a thil hoihlou tungding a na phuangkhin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa’n a hon tungsakta ngei a, a gen bangbang in ahita hi; Toupa tung ah thil na hihkhial ua, a paukam na manlouh ziak un hiai thil na tung uah a hongtung ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuin, ngai in, tuni in na khut a khainiang but k’on phelsak ahi. Babulon a ka kiang a hong na ut leh hong inla, na ut kei leh hong dahmai in; en dih, gam tengteng na ma ah a om hi, hoh pha nasak leh hoih na sak bang in pai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kik ma in aman, Judah khopite tung a ukpi dia Babulon kumpipa’n a bawl Shaphan tapa, Ahikam tapa Gedaliah kiang ah kik inla, mite lak ah a kiang ah om in, ahihkeileh hoh pha na saksakna ah hohmai in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in ngakmi heutu in nekding leh thilpiak a pia a, a paisanta hi. Jeremiah bel Ahikam tapa Gedaliah kiang ah Mizpah khua ah a hoh a, a kiang a gam a omsun mite lak ah a om teita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan, sepaih pawl heutu tengteng gamlak a omte’n, amaute leh a heute uh Babulon kumpipa’n, Ahikam tapa Gedaliah huai gam a mi genthei penpen, Babulon sal a pilouhte a kemsak chih a zak un Mizpah khua ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gedaliah kiang ah a hongpai ua, Nethaniah tapa Ishmael, Kareah Johanan leh Jonathan, Tanhumet tapa Seraiah, Netophath khua a Ephai tate leh Maakat khua a mi tapa Jezaniah leh a heute uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in, Shaphan tapa, Ahikam tapa Gedaliah in amau leh a heute uh kiang ah, “Kaldaite nasep kihta kei un: gam ah om dinden unla, Babulon kumpipa na sem unla, nou ding in a hoihmai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei zaw Mizpah khua ah ka om ding a, Kaldai mi ka kiang a hong dingte ma ah noute sik in ka ding ding: noute’n ahihleh uainte, nipi theite, thaute lakhawm unla na bel uah koih unla, na khopi laksate uah teng un” chi in a kichiam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in Judah mi tengteng, Moab gam a tengte, Ammon mite lak a tengte leh Edom gam a tengte leh gamdang a omte’n Babulon kumpipa’n Judah mi khenkhat a nusia a, a tung uah Shaphan tapa, Ahikam tapa, Gedaliah a koih chih a zak un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah mi tengteng a hawlzakna gam tengteng ua kipan in a hong paikik ua, Judah gam a Mizpah khua ah Gedaliah kiang ah a hongtung ua, uain leh nipi thei a lakhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huailou leng Kareah tapa Johanan leh sepaih pawlte heutu, gamlak a om tengteng Mizpah khua ah Gedaliah kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ammon mite kumpipa Baalis in na hinna la ding in Nethaniah tapa, Ishmael a sawl chih na za hia?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan, Kareah tapa Johanan in Mizpah khua a Gedaliah kiang ah, “Hon paisak dihve, Nethaniah tapa Ishmael ka vathat mai ding, kuamah in a theikei ding uh: Judah mi na kiang omkhawm tengteng a dalh vek ua, Judah mi omsunte manthatna hih ding in bangdia na hinna la ding ahia?” chi in a simtham in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahikam tapa Gedaliah in bel Kareah tapa Johanan kiang ah, “Hiai thil na hih ding ahi kei; Ishmael na gendan a dikkei hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan hichi ahi a, kha sagihna ah Elisha tapa Nethaniah tapa Ishmael, kumpi chi a mi, kumpipa upate lak a khat, mi sawm pi in Mizpah khua ah Ahikam tapa Gedaliah kiang ah a hong ua; Mizpah khua ah an a ne khawm uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan, Nethaniah tapa Ishmael bel a mipi sawmte toh ading ua, Shaphan tapa Ahikam tapa, Babulon kumpipa’n gam ukpipa dia a bawl Gedaliah namsau in a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kiang a Judah mi om tengteng, Mizpah khua a Gedaliah kiang a omte leh Kaldai galkap mi om teite Ishmael in a that lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gedaliah a thah nung ni nih in hichi a honghi a, kuamah in a theih ma un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sekem a kipan, Shiloh a kipan, Samaria a kipan in mi sawmgiat, a khamul uh met a, a puansilhte uh kek a, amau ki at in, tanghou latte leh gimlimte tawi in Toupa inn ah lan ding in a hong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nethaniah tapa Ishmael bel Mizpah khua a kipan in amau dawn ding in a pawtkhia a, lamtawn in a kapkap a: huan, hichi ahi a, amaute a muh in a kiang uah, “Ahikam tapa Gedaliah kiang ah hongpai un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in, hichi a honghi a, khopi sung a tun uleh Nethaniah tapa Ishmael leh a mipite’n amau a na that ua, kawkhuk ah a pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A lak ua mi sawmte’n bel, “Honthat kei un, gam ah buh, buhman, sathau leh khuaizu tampi ka sel ngal ua” a chi uhi. Huchi in amau a hawi ua, a unaute uh lak ah a that telta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan, kawkhuk, Ishmael in Gedaliah toh a mi thahte luang a paihna bel kumpipa Asa in Israel kumpipa Baasha a kihtak ziak in a bawl ahi. Nethaniah tapa Ishmael in huai luangte in a dimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in, Ishmael in Mizpah khua a mi hing a omsun, kumpipa tanute, Ahikam tapa Gedaliah kiang a ngakmi heutu Nebuzaradan in a kepsak, Mizpah khua a omlai tengteng toh sal in a pivek a; Nethaniah tapa Ishmael in huaite sal dia pi in Ammon mite zuan in a pawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh, Kareah tapa Johanan leh a kiang a om sepaih pawl heutu tengteng in Nethaniah tapa Ishmael thil hoihlou hih tengteng a na zak un mi tengteng a pikhia ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nethaniah tapa Ishmael sual ding in a kuan ua, tui tampi omna mun Gibeon ah a va mu uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahia, Ishmael kiang ah mi tengteng in Kareah tapa Johanan leh a kiang a sepaih heutu tengteng a vamuh un a na kipak law mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in Ishmael in Mizpah khua a kipan a sal a a pi tengteng a kihei ua, a kiknawn ua, Kareah tapa Johanan kiang ah a pai diam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nethaniah tapa Ishmael bel mi giat toh Johanan a kipan a taikhe geigei ua, Ammon mite kiang ah a paita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan, Kareah tapa Johanan leh a kiang a sepaih pawl heutu tengteng in, Nethaniah tapa Ishmael in Ahikam tapa Gedaliah a thah nung a Mizpah khua a kipan Nethaniah tapa Ishmael lak a Johanan in a hutkhiaksa mi omsun tengteng, kidou mite, numeite, naupangte, michilgehte, Gibeon a kipan a a pinawnte a pivek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in, a pawt ua, Kaldaite ziak a Aigupta gam a tailut tum in Bethlehem khaw kiang ah Geruth Chimham ah a khawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nethaniah tapa Ishmael in, Ahikam tapa Gedaliah, Babulon kumpipa’n huai gam ukpipa dia a bawl a thah ziak in amau a kihta mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, sepaih pawl heutute leh Kareah tapa Johanan leh Hoshaiah tapa Jezaniah leh mipi tengteng, a neupen a kipan a a lianpen tan in a hongnai ua, zawlnei Jeremiah kiang ah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na ma ah ka ngetna uh pom hi henla, hiai omsun mi tengteng ading ngei in na Pathian kiang ah hon thumsak ding in k’on ngen uhi; n’on muh bang ngei in mi tampite lak a kipan tawmchik kia nutsiat in ka omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian in ka paina ding thil uh hon kawkmuh theihna ding in ” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in, zawlnei Jeremiah in a kiang uah, “Na thu uh ka za hi, ngai un, na thu uh bangbang in Toupa na Pathian kiang uah ka ngen ding hi: huan, hichi ahi ding a, Toupa’n nou a hon dawn peuhmah k’on hilh zel ding: na lak uah bangmah ka im kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amau Jeremiah kiang ah, “ Toupa na Pathian in ka kiang ua nang a honsawlna thu tengteng bangzel a ka hihkei uleh ka lak uah Toupa thu theipa dik leh muanhuai hi hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A sia hiam a pha hiam k’on sawlna uh Toupa ka Pathian uh paukam suak ka mang ngeingei ding uh: Toupa ka Pathian uh paukam suak ka man uleh kou hoih theihna ding ahi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in, hichi a honghi a, ni sawm nung in Toupa thu Jeremiah kiang ah a hongtung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in, Kareah tapa Johanan leh a kiang a sepaih heutu om tengteng leh sepaih tengteng, neupen a kipan a lianpen tan in a sam a, a kiang uah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“ Toupa na Pathian uh, a ma a na ngetna tundia na honsawl napa un hichi in a chi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiai gam a na omdet uleh k’on tungding ding a, k’on phelzak kei ding a, k’on phutkip ding a, k’on botkhe kei ding, na tung ua thil hoihlou ka tutte lah ka lungheita ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Babulon kumpipa na lau sek uh lau nawn kei un, amah lau kei un chih Toupa thupawt ahi; a khut a kipan noute hondam ding leh honkhe ding in na kiang uah ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na tung ua zah a ngaih theihna ding in zahngaihna nou ka honphal ding a, na gam mah uah k’on kiksak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh, hiai gam ah i omkei ding uh, chi a Toupa na Pathian uh aw na man kei ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi hetlou Aigupta gam ah i paizaw ding ua, huai ah kidouna himhim i tuak kei ding a, pengkul ging leng i za kei ding a, an taksap a omsam kei ding, huai ah i teng zaw ding uh, na chih uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw Judah omsunte aw, Toupa thu ngai dih ua: sepaihte Toupa Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aigupta gam a lutding leh huai a teng ding in kihei teitei na hih uleh hichi a honghi ding a, namsau na kihtak ngei un Aigupta gam ah hon pha ding a, kial na kihtak sek un leng Aigupta gam ah nou a hondelh zui ding a, huai ah na si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aigupta gam a teng ding a kihei teiteite tengteng huchibang in a om ding ua, namsau, kial leh hi in na si ding uh, thil hoihlou a tung ua ka tut ding a kipan kuamah a suakta un a bit kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Sepaihte Toupa , Israelte Pathian in huchi in, a chi ahi: Jerusalem a tengte tung a ka hehna ka sun mah bang in Aigupta gam na lut hun chiang un na tung uah ka hehna ka sung sam ding: hamse thuak leh lamdangsak chiat, mi kamse banna, gensiat na hi ding ua, hiai mun na mu nawn kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Judah omsunte aw, Toupa’n na tungtang uh a genta hi, Aigupta gam ah lut kei un, hiai ni’n nou k’on theichiansak ahi chih thei mahmah un. Na hinna uh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh kiang ah n’on sawl ua, Toupa ka Pathian uh kiang ah hon thumsak inla, Toupa ka Pathian un a chihchih honhilh inla, ka hihzel ding uhi na chi ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuni in na kiang uah ka phuangta ahi; himahleh na kiang ua a hon sawlna bangmah in Toupa na Pathian uh paukam lah na mang ngal kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huaiziak in tunzaw theita un, tenna na lunggulhna mun ngei uah namsau, kial leh hi in na si ngeingei ding uhi” chi in a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Jerusalem mipi tengteng kiang a Toupa a Pathian uh thu tengteng Toupa Pathian in gen ding a a sawlna thu, huai thu tengteng a gen khit in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hoshaiah tapa Azariah leh Kareah tapa Johanan leh mi kiphasak tengteng in, Jeremiah a houpih ua, a kiang ah, “Zuaugen na hi, Toupa ka Pathian un, ‘Aigupta gam a teng ding in na pai ding uh ahi kei, chi a gen ding in nang a honsawl sam a’:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kaldaite khut a matsak a ka om ua honthah theihna ding un leh Babulon sal dia hon pitheihna ding in Neriah tapa Baruk in kou honsual ding a honsawl ei zaw ve” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in Kareah tapa Johanan leh sepaih pawl heutu teng leh mipi tengteng in Judah gam a teng ding in Toupa kam a mangkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Kareah tapa Johanan leh sepaih pawl heutu tengteng in Judah omsun tengteng, Judah gam a teng ding a hawlzak a a omna namte uh lak a kipan a hongkik;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasalte, numeite, naupangte, kumpipa tanute leh michih ngakmi heutu Nebuzaradan in Saphan tapa, Ahikam tapa Gedaliah leh a kiang a a nutsiatte uh zawlnei Jeremiah leh Neriah tapa Baruk leng, a pikhawmvek zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in Aigupta gam a tungta ua, Toupa paukam a mang kei ua, huchi in Tahpanhes khua ngei a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tahpanhes ah Jeremiah kiang ah Toupa thu a hongtung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Suang lianpi la inla, Tahpanhes a Pharo inn lutna chin a teklei lep zutna ah Judah mite mitmuh ngei in phut in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kiang uah, Sepaihte Toupa , Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi: Ngai un, ka nasempa Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar ka thukhak ding a, aman hiai ka suang phumguk tung ah a mangtutphah a tung ding; aman a tung uah a kumpi puanin a kai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan, a hong ding a, Aigupta gam a honggawt ding, sihna tuam sihna ah, saltanna tuam saltanna ah, namsau tuam namsau ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aigupta mite pathian innte ah meite a khah ding a, a kang ding, sal in a pi ding a; belamchingmi puan a silh bang in Aigupta gam a silh ding, huai a kipan in galmuang in a pawt ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aigupta gam a Beth-shemesh suang khuam sang pipite a chimsak ding a, Aigupta pathian innte mei in a hal ding, a chi, chi in, a chi a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aigupta gam a Judah om tengteng, Migdol khua, Tahpanhes khua, Noph khua leh Pathros gam a tengte tungtang a Jeremiah kiang a thu hongtung:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa , Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi: Jerusalem leh Judah khopite tung a thil hoihlou k’on tutte na muta uh; ngai dih ua, tuin a hong segawpta a, kuamah a teng kei uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amau nou leh na pipute un pathian dangte a theih ngei nailouh uh na sem ding leh a kiang ua gimlim hal in, kei hon hehsak ding a, a ginatlouhnate uh a hihkhit tak ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi pipi in na kiang uah nasem zawlnei tengteng phalvak a thou in ka sawl a, a kiang uah, “Aw, hiai thu kihhuai, ka huatlam tak hihkei un” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh a ngaikhe tuankei ua, a ginatlouhna uh pathian dangte kiang a gimlim hallouh ding pen a ngeingaih kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka hehna leh ka thangpaihna Judah khopite leh Jerusalem kongzingte ah ka sung a a kuangta a, tuni a a om bang in a sia a, a segawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in tuin zaw Toupa sepaihte Pathian, Israel Pathian in: na lak ua kipan numei pasal, naungekte leh nawi nelaite Judah lak a kipan kuamah hawi lou a gawimang vek ding in bangdia hiai thil hoihlou tak na hinna uh tung a hih na hi ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na vatenna uh Aigupta gam pathiante kiang a gimlim hal in khovel gam tengtengte lak a hamsethuak leh gensiat na hih theihna ding uh leh gawimang na hih theihna ding ua na khut thilhih ngei ua hon hehsak na hi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na pipute uh gitlouhnate, Judah kumpipate gitlouhnate leh na zite uh gitlouhna, Judah gam leh Jerusalem kongzing a a hihkhitsate uh na mangngilh ta ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tunitan in leng a kisik tuankei ua, na pipute uh leh noumau ma a ka taklat ka dan leh ka dan bawlte na zuikei ua, na lau sam kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in, sepaihte Toupa , Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi: Ngai un, na siatna ding un Judah tengteng gawimang vek ding in nou k’on matuah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan, Judah omsun, Aigupta gam a ten tuma kihei teiteite ka man ding a, a chimit vek ding uh; Aigupta gam ah a puk ding ua, namsau leh kialte a hihman in a om ding uh; neupen a kipan a lianpen tan in namsau leh kial in a si ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem ka gawt bangmah in Aigupta gam a tengte namsaute, kialte leh hipite in ka gawt ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in Aigupta gam a teng ding a kuan Judah omsunte Judah gam, a omna ding ua kiknawn a ut mahmahna gam uah kik ding in khat lel leng hihdam in a suakta kei ding uh, a sim a taikhe kia loungal kuamah a kik kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in mi tengteng, a zite un pathian dang kiang a gimlim a hal chih theite leh numei huai a dingte mipi tampi, Aigupta gam a teng mipi tengteng in, Pathros ah Jeremiah a dawng ua, hichi in a chi uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Toupa min a ka kiang ua na thugente zaw k’on ngaihkhiaksak kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kou leh ka pipute uh, ka kumpipate uh leh ka heutute un Judah khopite ah leh Jerusalem kongzingte ah a na hihzel bang un van kumpinu kiang a gimlim halte leh a kiang a dawn ding thillat butkhiakte, ka paukam suak peuhmah bang un ka hih ngeingei ding uh; huchihlai in ka lamzang ua, nek leh dawn ding a tama, siatna himhim ka mu sam ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Van kumpinu kiang a thil hal leh a kiang a dawn ding thillat butkhiakte ka tawp nungsiah uh bang peuh ka tasamta zaw ua, namsau leh kialte a hihman in ka omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan, numeite’n, Van kumpinu kiang a gimlim ka hal lai uh leh a kiang a dawn ding thillatte ka butkhiak uh?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in Jeremiah in mipi tengteng, numei pasal amah dawngmite tengteng kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Judah khopite leh Jerusalem kongzingte ah, nou leh na pipute uh, na kumpipate uh leh na heutute uh, leh gam a mipite in gimlim a halte uh Toupa’n a theigige in a lungsim ah a khum kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na thil gilou hihziak uleh na thil kihhuai hihte uh ziak in Toupa’n a thuak ngap nawnta kei hi; huaiziak in, na gam uh tua a om bang in a sia a, lamdang sak chiat, hamse thuak, tengmi omlou, a hong hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gimlim na hal ua, Toupa tung ah na gilou ua, Toupa paukam suakte na mang kei ua, a dan hiam a dan bawl hiamte a thu theihsakte hiam na zuih sam louh ziak un hiai thil hoihlou tua a om bang in na tung uah a hongtung ahi” a chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huailou leng Jeremiah in mipi tengteng leh numeite kiang ah, “Aigupta gam a Judah tengteng aw, Toupa thu za un, sepaihte Toupa , Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nou leh na zite un, Van kumpinu kiang a gimlim hal leh dawn ding thillat butkhiakte ka na chiamsa bangzel in ka hih ngeingei ding, chi in na kam un na genta ua, na khut un na pichingsak lai uhi. ‘Na thuchiamte uh hihkip unla, na thu tupte uh tangtung sak vanglak un.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />huaiziak in, nou Judah, Aigupta gam a tengte aw, Toupa thu ngaikhia un: Ngai un, Toupa Pathian a hin a a hin sung chi in Aigupta gam pumpi a teng, Judah mi kua kam mah ah ka min a ging nawn ngeikei ding chi in ka min thupi lou in ka kichiam ahi chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngai in, a hoihna ding uh hilou in a siatna ding un amau ka tang thek ahi: huchi in Judah mi, Aigupta gam a omte tengteng, namsau leh kialte a hihman in a om ding uh, a manthat vek matan un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Namsau hihman val tawmchik Aigupta gam a kipan a pawt in Judah gam ah a lut ding uh; huan, Judah mi omsunte tengteng, Aigupta gam a teng ding a kuan mite’n kua thu ahia paizaw ding, ka thu hia amau thu, a thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huan, hiai nou ading in chiamtehna ahi ding: ka thu na tung uah thil hoihlou lam ding in a pai ngei ding hi chih na theihna ding un hiai mun ah nou ka hon gawt ding ahi chih Toupa thupawt ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngai un, Pharo Hophra, Aigupta kumpipa bel a melma, a hinna zong mite khut ah ka mangsak ding, Judah kumpipa Zedekiah, a melma, a hinna zawngmi Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar khut a ka piak bangmah in” a chi a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Jehoiakim, Josiah tapa kum lina ah Jeremiah kam a kipan hiai thute laibu a a gelh lai a Neriah tapa Baruk kiang a zawlnei Jeremiah thugen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa Israel Pathian in, Aw Baruk, na kiang ah hichi in a chi: Nang, ka tunggikta na mai e:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa’n “Ka thuakna ah lungkhamna a hon behlapta ngal a: ka thum ka bahpih a, tawldamna ka mu zoukei” na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kiang a hichia na gen ding ahi: Toupa’n hichi in a chi: “Ngai in, ka lamsa ka phel nawn ding a, gam pumpi mahmah ah ka phuhsa ka botkhe nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan, nang ading in thil thupi na zong hia? Zong dah mai in: sa tengteng tung ah thil hoihlou k’on tungsak ding a, chih Toupa thupawt ahi: himahleh na hinna bel munchih a na paina ah gallak ding in ka honpe ding” chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Namte tungtang a zawlnei Jeremiah kiang a Toupa thu hongtung:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aigupta thu, Euphrates luigei a Karkhemish khua a om, Judah kumpipa Jehoiakim, Josiah tapa kum lina a Nebukadnezzar in a bawl ek Aigupta kumpipa Pharo Neko sepaih hon tungtang thu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lum bemte, lum zawlte mansa in om unla, gal nawt un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sakol van unla, sakol tuang mite aw, tuang un, dal lukhu khu in ding kip unla, tei tat-hiam in sik puanak silh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangchidan, a taikekta uh! A dek uh a ngat uh, a galkapmite uh a vuallel uh, baksam leng zen in a tai ua, nunglam nga hetlou in, ning chih ah gal a lang chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi zuanzang a taimang theikei, galkapmi a pawt tuankei uh, huai a mi Euphrates luigei ah a hawi ua, a puk khinta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nile lui bang a khang kua ahia? Luipi tui kihot kimvel bang in?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aigupta Nile lui bang in a khang a luipi tui kihot kimvel bang mai in, ka khang ding a, leitung ka luahsuak ding, khopi leh a luahte ka hihse ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw sakolte aw, nawk zel unla, aw kangtalai aw, nakpi’n pang un: galdoumite’n ma phu uhenla, Ethiopia mi leh Put mi, lum tawimite, Lud mi thalpeu zang siamte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai ni ahi, Toupa , sepaihte Toupa ni tak, phulak ni, a melmate tung a phu a lak theihna, namsau in a gai ding a, a tai ding, a sisan uh taitak in a dawn ding; sepaihte Toupa’n mal gam ah Euphrates lui gei ah mi tampi a gou phengphung mai ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw, Aigupta tanu siangthou, Gilead ah hohtou inla, sing nai nuh chi vala in, damdawi tampi a thawn in na zangta, nang ading in damna himhim a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Namte’n na zahlakna a za ua, na kah in lei pumpi a dim hi, galhatmi leh galhatmi a kiphu ua, lei ah a puk khawm uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nebukadnezzar, Babulon kumpipa a hongpai a, Aigupta gam a hong bawl ek ding dan thu Toupa’n zawlnei Jeremiah kiang a a gen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aigupta gam ah gen unla, Migdol ah phuang un; Noph leh Tahpanhes ah phuang unla; ding kip in kigalging un; na kim a mi namsau in a gaita ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangdia na mi hatte phiatmang a om ahi ua? A ding zou kei ua, Toupa’n a paihkhiak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi tampi a kisui sak a, ahi, a kiphu puk lemlum ua, Nuaisiahna namsau taisan in kisa un, i kik ding uh, i pianna gam ah i mite kiang ah, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aigupta kumpipa Pharo pen husa lian lel, a hun sehsa a paimang sak a om, chi in huai ah a kikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hin a ka hin sung in chih Kumpipa, a min sepaihte Toupa thupawt ahi hi, tangte lak a Tabor tang bang in tuipi chin a Karmel tang bang in a hongpai ngei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw nang, tanu, Aigupta gam a teng, saltang ding in kibawl mai in: Noph khua a segawp dek a, teng ding omlou in a kang mang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aigupta bel bawngla hoihtak ahi, himahleh mal a kipan nasemmi ding hong kuan in a hongpai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A lak ua sepaih goih laite bel bawngtuai vak thau bang mai ahi ua, a dek uh a ngat ua, a taikek ua, khawllou in, a tung uah a siatna ni uh a tungta, a gawtna hun ding uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gulpi kitholh bang mai in husa a nei a, a melmate kiton in a hongpai ua, singphukmite bang in hei toh a hongsual uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A gam gammang vaksuak zoh louh a hong hihse ding uh, khaukhup sang in a tamzaw ua, simsenglouh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aigupta tanu a zahlak ding, mallam a mi khut a matsak in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa , Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi: Ngai un, Nou khua a, Ammon leh Pharo; Aigupta leh a pathiante, a kumpipate, Pharo ngei leh amah muangmite ka gawt ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A hinna uh, zong mite khut ah leh Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar leh a nasemmite khut ah ka mansak ding: huai hun chiang in luah in a om ding, nidanglai nite mah bang in, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aw Jakob, ka nasempa, lau kenla, aw Israel, lunglel sam ken, Ngai in, gamlapi a kipan nang k’on hunkhe ding a, na suante leng a saltanna gam ua kipan, Jakob a hongkik ding a, muangtak in a om hiathiat ding a, kuamah in a lausak nawn kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aw Jakob, ka nasempa, lau ken, k’on ompih ahi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi: ka hondelh zakna nam tengteng ka beisak ding a, nang zaw k’on beisak hetkei ding: diktak in k’on gawt ding a, gawtlouh in k’on khak kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pharo in Gaza a gawt ma a Philistia mite tungtang a zawlnei Jeremiah kiang a Toupa thu hongtung:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngai un, mal a kipan in tui a hong khang hi, a kuang dim in a luang let ding; gam a tum ding a asung a om tengteng toh, khopi leh asung a tengte leng; mite a kap ding ua, gam a mi tengteng a mau tuaituai ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A sakol hat chinte leitot ging in kidou kangtalai ging dopdop in, a kangtalai ging in, pate a lunglel ua, a tate uh enlou zen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Philistia mi tengteng lohna ni, Tura leh Sidon a kipan a panpihmi omsunte sattanna ni ziak in, Toupa’n tuipi gei Kaphthor omlaite a hihse ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gaza mite lu a hong giauta, Askelon a chimitta a, a gam phaizang a teng laite; bang tan kiat ding na hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Toupa namsau, na om kinken ma bang tan ahia? Na pai ah kikhum in; khawl inla om kinken ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n Askelon leh tuipi gei tung a gamtang ding a, a honseh a, hih ding a honpiak ngal leh bangchi’n na om kinken thei dia?
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moab tungtang thu: sepaihte Toupa Pathian in hichi in a chi: Nebo tung a gik hi: hihgawp in a omta: Kiriathaim bel zahlak sak in a omta, laksuan ahi. Misgab bel zahlak leh hihsiat in a omta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moab minthanna a mangta; Heshbon ah a siatna ding gen in, Kisa un, nam a hihna kipan i hihmang ding uh, a chi ua. Aw Madmen khua, nang leng daihsak sipsip na hi ding a, namsau in a hondelh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Horonaim a kipan a kikou husa, lohna leh siatna thupi mahmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moab a a mang hi, a tate kap ging zak in a om hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Luhithte ah kap in a paitou ua, Horonaim sul ah manthatna kikou ging lunglelhhuai a za uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tai mang unla, na hinna uh humbit un, gamdai gam sabiltung bang in om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na nasep leh na sum leh pai na muan ziak in nang leng mat in na om ding hi; Khemosh sal a pi ahi ding a, a siampute leh a heutute toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khaw chih ah hihsemi a hontung ding, khaw khat lel in leng a pel kei ding; phaizang gam leng a mang ding; phaizang hihsiat ahi ding. Toupa’n a chihsa bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A lenmang theihna ding in Moab kha pia unla, a khuate a segawp ding a, tengmi omlou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Limsaklou tak a Pathian nna semmi hamsethuak in om henla, sisan a suah ding a a namsau zang nuamlou mi hamsethuak in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tuailai a kipan Moab in nuam a sa a, a uain a bohkhum a, bel dang a teituah leng a tuak kei a, sal a pi in a om ngeisam kei hi, a lim ngeingei a lim gige in, a gim leng a lamdang tuankei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />huaiziak in ngai un, Ni a hongtung hi, a bungkhe ding mi k’on sawl ding a, huan amau a bungkhe ding uh, chih Toupa thupawt ahi: a belte a vuaksak ding ua, a umte a hihkek ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel inkawte’n a muanpi pen uh Bethel a zahpih bang un Moab in Khemosh a zahpihta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasal hoih leh galdou mi hangsan i hi ua, bangchidan a chi na hi ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moab bel hihgawp in a om a, a khopi meikhu in a zam khinta, a tangval hoih teng a pukkhinta chih Kumpipa, a min sepaihte Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Moab siatna a hongtung lellel, a thuakna ding a kinoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nou a kim a miteng in amah sun in a min thei teng in chiang khauh leh chiang thupi a kitanta hi, chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw nang tanu, Dibon a teng, na thupina paisan inla, dangtak in tuin: Moab lokmin nang a hon sual a, na kulhte a hihseta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Aroer a teng nu, kongbul ah ding in, enkhia in, taikekpa, suaktanu dong inla, Bang a maizen a? chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moab zahlaksak in a omta, a chim gawpta ngal a, mau tuaituai in kap un, Moab hihsiat ahita, chih Arnon ah phuang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gam tampi tung ah; Holon, Zahjah, Mephaath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />leh Dibon, Nebo, Bethdiblathiam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />leh Keriathiam, Bethgamul, Bethmenon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />leh Kerioth, Bozrah leh Moab gam a khua tengteng, a gamla leh a nai ah vaihawmna a hongtungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moab ki attan in a om a, a ban hihtan in a omta, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amah khamsak unla; Toupa tung ah a kiliansak ngal a; huan, Moab bel amah luak ah a kitholh ding a, nuihsan in a omlai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel nang ding nuihzabawlna ahita kei maw? Gutate lak ah a tel ahia? Amah tungtang na gen teng in na lu na sinkhum hilou hiam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Moab a tengte aw, khopite taisan unla, kawl kikal ah teng un, vakhu, kawhawm geia bu bawlsek bang in om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moab kisaktheihna ka zata ua, a kisathei ngutve, a kikoih sandan, a kisaktheih dan, a kiotsak dan leh a lungtang ki deihkhop dante.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A hehna bangmah ahi kei chih ka thei; a kiotsaknate’n bangmah a hihkaw kei, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi in Moab tung ah ka mau tuaituai ding a, ahi, Moab pumpi ading in ka kap ding, Kir hareseth mite sun ahi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jazer kap sang a thupi in ka honkah ding a, aw Sibmah grepkung, na hiangte tuipi tung ah a kiphalh a, Jazer tuipi leng a tung hialta a, na nipi thei leh grep gahte hihsemi in a bawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nuamna leh kipahna a mangkhin hi, theibil leh Moab gam a kipan: uain sukna khuk a ka uain ka beisakta a, kuamah in nuamsa a kikou in a chil nawn kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Heshbon leh Elealeh ah a kikou ua, Jahaz tan in aw a suah ua, Zoar a kipan Horonaim tan, Eglath shelishijah tan in leng, Nimrim tui kim a dai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huailou in Moab mun sangte thillanmi leh a pathiante adia gimlim halmi ka hihmang ding, Toupa thupawt in a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Huchi in tamngai bang in ka lungtang Moab ading in a ging a, Kir hareseth mite ding in tumging bang in ka lungtang a ging hi; huaiziak in niang leh tai a thil a muhsate a mangthang khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lu chiteng metgiau ahi a, khamul chiteng met ahi; khut tengteng at ahi a; kongte ah saiip puan a om chiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Moab inn tung tengteng, kongzing leh munchih ah kahna a om a; Moab bel phatuam nawnlou bang in ka hihkham khinta hi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Seta namai e! Segawp zou hina tel e: Moab zahlak in a lehngat tave: huchi in Moab bel a kimvel a mite tengteng adin nuihzabawlna leh mulkimhuai a hong hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi ahi: Ngai in, mu bang in a leng ding a, Moab tung ah a kha a zak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kerioth lak a hi a, a kulhte a phawng guih a, huai ni’n Moab pasalphate lungtang numei nauvei lungtang bang mai ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Moab a mangthang ding, nam a ching nawn kei ding; Toupa a nuaisiah zawk ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Launa, kawkhuk leh tangte, aw Moab luahmi, na tung ah a tung hi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Launa taisanmi kawkhuk ah a ke ding, kawkhuk a pawt thang ah a awk ding, a gawtna kum ka hontun ding ngal a, a tung ah, Moab tung ah ngei, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Heshbon lim ah taikekpawl bahgawp in a khawl ding ua, Heshbon a kipan in mei a pawt a, Sihon lak a kipan in meikuang, chiak vengvungmite sip a sam toh Moab baksam a kang khin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Na tung a gik hi, aw Moab! Khemosh mite a mangta ua; na tapate sal a pi in, na tanute sal in a tangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Himahleh ni nanung chiang in Moab omdan ka hei ding a, chih Toupa thupawt ahi. Hichi tan Moab tungthu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ammon mite thu, Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Israel in tate a nei ka hia? Gouluahmi neilou hia? Bang achia ahia a kumpipa’n Gad a tantak a, a mite khopite a a ten uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huaiziak in, ngai un, nite a hongtung hi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi. Ammon tate Rabah khua ah kidou husa ging ka kizasak ding, thilsia omkhawm lel a honghi ding hi, a tanute mei in a kang ding a, huchi in Israel in amah neimi a nei thuk ding, Toupa’n a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Heshbon, mau tuaituai inla, Ai a lok khinta ua; Rabah tate aw, kap un, kap unla, umna sungte ah vial tai un. Kumpipa, siampu leh a mi liante toh sal a pi in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangdia na guam hoihte suang na hia, aw muanhuailounu a neih hoihhoihte muang a, Kua ahia honsual ding, chichi nakmi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai in, launa na tung ah ka hontun ding a, na kim a mi tengteng a kipan, chih Toupa , sepaihte Pathian thupawt ahi: michih delhkhiak na hi vek ding uh, kuamah in taikekpawl a kaikhawm kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaikhit chiang in bel Ammon tate omdan ka kiheisak ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Edom thu, Sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Teman a pilna om nawn lou ahi maw? Lemthei lemtheihna a mangkhinta ahia? A pilna uh mang khin hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Dedan a tengte aw, taikek unla, lehngat unla, tummang vengveng un; amah ka gawt hun chiang in, Esau siatna a tung ah k’on tun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Grep loumite na kiang a a hongpai un, maih a neikei ding ua hia? Zan a guta mite’n a deihzah uh a ngah masiah un a a lok zel kei ding ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Esau ka vuaktang sakta a, a guk khuhte ka hongta, a bu thei nawn kei ding. A suante hihsiat ahi ua, a unaute, a invengte toh, a omta kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na tagahte limsak ken, ken ka hum ding, na meithaite’n kei hon muang uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Nou dawn lou dingte’n leng a dawn mawk uleh, nang gawtlouh hial in na suakta ding ahia? Gawtlouh in na pawt kei ding, na dawn mahmah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa’n keimah kilou in ka kichiamta ngal a, Bozrah lamdang sak chiat, gen siat, hihgawp, hamsethuak ahi ding, a khua tengteng leng a segawp tawntung ding, a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa kiang a kipan thupuan ka zata, namte kiang ah sawltak sawl ahita, Kikaikhawm unla, amah sual unla, kidou din kuan un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai in, mihingte muhsit in namte lak nang k’on neusakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na kihih mulkimhuaina tak na lungtang kisathei in a hon khemna ahi, aw nang kawl suangkal a, mualvum a tengzel, mu bang in, sangpi ah bu sep mahle chin, huai a kipan in k’on lakhe suk ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in, Edom bel lamdangsak chiat a honghi ding a, mi vialvak peuh in lamdang a sa ding ua, a naksiat ziak in a tekkhum ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sodom leh Gomorrah leh a kim a khopite hihsiat a om mah bang in, kuamah a teng nawn kei ding ua, mihing ta kuamah huai ah a om ngei nawn kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai un, Jordan gam gammang a kipan a humpinelkai, gan khahna mun ah a hong tou ding a; amah a kipan amau ka taimang sak pah ding a, a tung a thunei ding in ka utut ka sep ding. Keimah bang kua ahia om? Kuan ahia hunbi honkhiah sak ding? Belamchingmi kua ahia ka ma ading ding pen?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huaiziak in Edom tung a Toupa thuhilh leh Teman mite tung a a thilseh, hih a tuppente ngaikhia un: ganhon nou neute ngei kaihmangin a om ding ua; a tenna uh a hihgawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A puksiatna husa uah lei a ki sing a; a kap husa uh Tuipi san ah leng zak ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai un, muvanlai bang in a hong lengtou ding a; Bozrah tung ah kha a zak ding: huai ni’n Edom mi hangsante lungtang numei nauvei lungtang banglel ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Damaska thu. Hamath zumta, Arpad toh, thu hoihlou a zata ngal ua, a zulta uh; tuipi kihot om kinken theilou bang in a buai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Damaska a thazaw, taikek a tuma, linna in a lap a, Lungkhamna leh natna in numei nauvei bang mai in a lenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khopi minthang leh kipahhuai khingta namai e:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchi in huai ni’n a tangval honte kongtual ah a puk ding ua, galdoumi tengteng a mangthang ding uh, chih sepaihte Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Damaska kulh bang ah mei ka khah ding a, Benhadad kumpipa innte a kang khin ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kedar leh Hazor gamte Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in a gawtna thu: Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Thou unla, Kedar sual unla, suahlam tate bawl ek un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A puaninte uh, a ganhonte uh a laksak ding ua, a puanzakte uh, a tuium-belsuan tengteng uh, a sangawngsaute uh a paimang pih ding uh, ning chih ah launa a om a, chi in mite’n a kikou khum ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tai kek unla, vak mang vengveng un, tummang vengveng unla, Aw Hazora tengte aw, chih Toupa thupawt ahi. Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in nang a hon sawm a, na tung ah hihtup a neita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Thou unla, lungmuangtak a om, amah a khosa, kulh kongkhak leng neilou, kalhna siktawn leng neilou nam sual un, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A sangawngsaute uh gal in a la ding ua, a bawnghonpi uh a lok ding uh. Baksam metgiau honte ning chih ah ka dalhsak ding, a siatna ding uh ning chih a kipan in ka hontun ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Huan, Hazor bel sihna tenna mun ahi ding a, a segawp tawntung ding, huai ah kuamah a teng nawn kei ding uh, mihing tate a omta kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Zedekiah vaihawm pattungna Elam tungtang a Toupa thu, zawlnei Jeremiah kiang a hongtung:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngai un, Elam thalpeu, a hatna bulpi pen uh, ka kitansak ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Kawlmong li a kipan in huih lite ka hontun ding, Elam tung ah; ka dalhsak ding, kawlmong chih ah, Elam delhkhiak mite phak louh nam a omkei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A melma uh, a hinna uh zongmite ma ah, Elamte ka lunglel sak ding, a tung uah siatna ka hontun ding, ka hehna mahmah tak, chih Toupa thupawt ahi. Amau ka hihman vek masiah namsau ka delhsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A kumpipate uleh a heutute uh hihmang in Elam ah ka mangtutphah ka tung ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Himahleh ni nanungte ah hichi ahi ding, Elam omdan ka kiheisak ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babulon tungtang, Kaldai mite gam tungtang a zawlnei Jeremiah kam a Toupa thugen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Namchih lak ah gen unla, phuang un, puanzak khai in, phuang un, selkei un, Babulon lak ahita. Bel a zahlak a, Marduk mulkimna in a dim a, milimte a se khinta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mal a kipan amah nam khat in a honsual a, huai in a gam a hihgawp ding a, huai ah kuamah a teng nawn kei ding ua; a taikek ua, mi leh sate leng a mangkhinta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai nite in leh huai hun chiang in Israel tate a hongpai ding ua, amau leh Judah tate toh; kap kawm in a hongpai ding ua, Toupa a Pathian uh a zong ding uh; chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zion lam nga in a kalsuanna ding uh a dong ding ua, Kisa un, tangtawn thukhun mangngilh nawnlou ding in Toupa honglen un, a chi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mite zaw belam mang ahi ua; amau chingmite’n a pimang ua, mualte ah a paimang sak ua, tangte, mual dungte ah a pai ua, a huang uh a mangngilh khinta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A mu peuh in a ne zel ua, a melmate un, I gilou kei, Toupa dikna omna a pipute uh lamet Toupa hilhial tung a thil a hihkhelh ziak ahi, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Babulon sung a kipan in taikhia unla, Kaldaite gam a kipan paikhia unla, kelhon lak a keltalte bang in om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai dih ua, Babulon hongsual ding in mal gam a kipan nam honpi thupitak kikaikhawm ka tokthou ding a, amah dou ding in a kisa ding ua: huai a kipan in lak ahi ding uh: a thalte uh lah galbawl siamtak vuaksuak ngeilou bang ahi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan, Kaldai loh in a om ding, a lok mite a tai ngial ding uh, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kipak mahle uchin, nuamsa mahle uchin, aw ka goutan lok mite aw, lou lak ah bawngla takhialkhial bang leh sakoltal ham ngekngek bang himahle uchin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na nu uh a hongzum mahmah ding a, nou hon suangnu a hong zahlak ding hi. Ngai un, namte lak a nuainungpen, gamdai, gamkeu, gamvuak ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa hehna ziak in luahmi a omkei ding a, a sevek zaw ding hi, Babulon hoh peuhmah a mulkimsak ding a, a siatna tengteng ziak in a tek ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thalpeu tawimi tengteng aw, Babulon umsuak in kivual unla, kap unla, thalte chil kei un, Toupa tung ah a khialta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kimvel in awng unla, amah leh amah a kipeta, a kulhte a pukta a, a bangte a chimta, Toupa phulakna ahi ngal a, a tung ah phu la unla, a hih bangbang in a tung ah hih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Babulon a kipan chi thehmi attan unla, buhlak lai a kawite tawimi toh, nuaisiahna namsau lau in amau mite lam a zuan chiat ding ua, amau gam chiat ah a tai ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel bel belam dalhzak ahi a; humpinelkaite’n a delhmang ua; Assuria kumpipa’n amah a ne phot a, a tawp in Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in a guhte a haizanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huaiziak in sepaihte Toupa , Israelte Pathian in hichi in a chi: Ngai un, Assuria kumpipa ka gawt bang in Babulon kumpipa leh a gam ka gawt ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan, Israel a tatna ah ka pinawn ding a, Karmel leh Bashan ah a ta ding a, Ephraim tang ah leh Gilead ah amah a ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huai nite leh huai hun chiang in Israel thulimlouhnate a zong ding ua, muh ding a omkei ding; Judah thilhihkhelhte leng muh ding a omsam kei ding; omsun ding a ka koihte ngaidam ding ka hi ngal a, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Merathim gam sual un, a gam leh Pekod luah mite mahmah; that unla, hihgam sipsip unla, thu ka honpiak bangbang in hih un, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huai gam ah gal husa a om, siatna thupi mahmah husa toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khovel pumpi sek kitam in, nak keknen hina tele: Namte lak ah Babylon kinaksiat nah e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aw Babulon, nang ding in thang na kam a, theilou a awk neita ve; muhkhiak leh mat in na omta, Toupa na sual ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Toupa’n a galvan bawm a hongta, a hehna vanzatte a lakhia a, Toupa , sepaihte Toupa’n Kaldaite gam ah hih ding a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Gamgi tawp pek a kipan in honsual unla, a thil koihkhawmna innte hong vek unla, paikhawm unla, hihse vek un, a bangmah hawi kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A bawngtal tuaite that vek unla, goh in om uhen. A tung uh gik hinatel e! A ni uh, amaute gawtna ni mahmah a hongtungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Toupa i Pathian phulak, a biakin phulakna ngei Zion a gen ding a Babulon a kipan a taikhia leh taimangte husa ngei:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Babulon sual ding in thalkap siam, thalpeu zangmi tengteng samkhawm un; a kimvel in buk bawl unla, kuamah suakta kei uhen; A thilhih bangbang in thuk un, a hihsa bang tengteng amah tung ah hih un: Toupa , Israel Mi Siangthou lah a tou ngam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huaiziak in tangvalte a kholakte ah a puk ding ua, galkapmi tengteng huai ni’n a mangthang ding uh chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ngai in, nang mi kisathei, ka hondou ahi, Toupa , sepaihte Toupa’n a chi. Na ni a hongtungta, na gawtna ding ni mah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huan mi kisathei a kisui in a puk ding a, kuamah in a phong kei ding ua, a khopite ah mei ka khah ding a, a kimvel a om tengteng ka kang siangsak vek ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Israel tate leh Judah tate nuaisiah in a om khawmta ua; sal a amaute pimite tengteng in amau a len chinten ua, a khah nuam kei uhi. Amaute tanpa bel a hat a; a min sepaihte Toupa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amah amau lam ah a pang a, Babulon a tengte hihbuai in, khovel a muanna a tut theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kaldai mite tung ah namsau a leng hi, Babulon a tengte, a heutute uh leh a mipilte uh tung ah leng, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mi zuautheite tung ah namsau, mihai a hongsuak ding uh: a galkap mi tung ah namsau, a lunglel khin ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A sakolte uh leh kangtalaite uh tung ah namsau, a sung a mi kilak hel tengtengte tung ah leng, numei bang phet a honghi ding uh: a gou thil tung ah namsau lok in a om maimai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A tuite kangin a keu khin a, milimte gam lah ahi ngal a, milimte lah a hailoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Huaiziak in gamdai gam sahang, ngia toh huai ah a teng ding ua, Ostrik leng huai ah a teng ding uh; luah in a om ngei nawn kei ding; suan tengteng pha in leng luah in a omkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Pathian in Sodom leh Gomorrah leh a khaw invengte a hihsiat bangbang in; huai ah kuamah a tengta kei ding ua, mihing ta kuamah in a veh nawnta kei ding uh, Toupa thupawt in a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ngai un, mallam gam apan mite a hong ua, mun tawp a kipan nam thupitak leh kumpipa tampi a hong kuan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Thalpeu leh tei a tawi ua, hiamgam tak, zahngaihna neilou ahi uh. A husa uh tuipi ging huhu bang ahi a, sakol tung ah a tuang ua, michih galkapmi bang a kivan in, Babulon tanu aw, nang a hongsual ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A husa uh za in Babulon kumpipa khut a zawgawpta a, numei nauveilai natna bang in, natna thupitak in a manta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ngai un, Jordan gammang a kipan humpinelkai, kahna mun a a hongtou bang in a hong paitou ding a; amah a kipan in amaute ka taimangsak pah ding; a tung a thunei ding ka utut ka sep ding. Kei bang kua a om a! Kuan sep ding. Kei bang kuakua a om a? Kuan ahia hunbi hon sehsak ding? Belamchingmi kua ahia ka ma ading ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Huaiziak in Babulon tung ah Toupa thuhilh, Kaldai mite tung a a thilseh ngaikhia un. Ganhon noute ngei kaihmang in a om ding ua, gankhahna mun a mite a mulkimsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Babulon lakna husa ah lei a ling ding a, a kahna husa namte lak a zak ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngai dih, Babulon leh Kaldai mite tung ah, hihse ding huihpi ka sawl ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zapsiangmi ka sawl ding, Babulon tung ah, amah zap in a gam a zapsiang ding ua, siatna ni’n um in a sual ding ahi ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thalpeu zangmi in thalpeu lailou in, sik puanak silh in, ding kei heh, tangval hon khat leng hawilou in, a sepaih tengteng nuai mang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kaldai gam ah thah in a puk ding ua, a kholakte uah sut pailet in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel leh Judah, a gam uah Israel Mi Siangthou tung ah khelhna in a dim na ua, a Pathian uh sepaihte Toupa’n a mangngilh kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Taimang unla, Babulon khaw sung a kipan, michih in amah hinna humbit hen; a thulimlouhna man loh kei un, Toupa phulak hun ahi ngal a, aman a thuk ngeigngei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Babulon bel Toupa khut a dangkaeng nou, lei pumpi hihkhamna ahi a, namte’n kham in a lung uh a mawl khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Babulon bel a puk guih a, a mangta, amah kah ekek un, hihdam theih ding dan ahihleh singnai damdawi nuh chi laksak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Babulon hihdam ka tuma, a dam tuan ngal kei a, amah nusia in eimah gam chiat uah pai ni, a mawhna in van a suna, van dum pha a dopkang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa’n ka dikna a phuangta; kisa un, Toupa i Pathian thilhih, Zion ah i phuang ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thalte tat-hiam unla, lumte len un, Media kumpipate lungsim Toupa’n a tokthouta a, a thiltup Babulon hihsiat ahi. Huai Toupa’n a biakin ziak a phulakna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Babulon kulh bul ah kidouna puan zakthak un, venna hihhat in, galvilmi koih un, galbuknate bawl unla, Babulon mite tungtang thu ah Toupa’n a gentak, a ngaihtuah in a hihkhinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw nang, tui tamna mun a tengmi, sum leh pai hau mahmah, na tawpna a tungta, na hinna khau a kitanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa amah kilou in a chiamta hi, Khaupe bang mai in mihing in k’on dimsak ngeingei ding, nakpi’n a hon otkhum ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thilhihtheihna in lei a bawl a, A pilna in khovel a ding khesak a, a lemtheihna in van a phalhsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A aw a suah a, van a tui a ging hawhaw a, kawlmong a kipan meipi a paitou sak a, vuah zukna ding in khua a phesak a, a goubawm a kipan huih a nungsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Michih a mual ua, theihna lou in, dangkaeng sek michih in a lim sek pen a zumpih ua, a milim sun lah zuau ngen ahi a, amau ah nakna a omkei lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangmahlou, khemna nasep lel ahi ua, a gawt hun chiang in a mang ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakob tantuan zaw hichibang ahi kei, thil tengteng bul ahi; Israel a gouluah nam ahi a, a min sepaihte Toupa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang bel ka galdouna heipi leh vanzat na hi a, nang honzang in namte ka hih zan a, nang zang in lalna gamte ka hihmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nang honzang in sakol leh a tung a ka hihzan a, nangmah zang in kangtalai leh a tung a tuang ka hih zan a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangmah zang in numei leh pasal ka hihzan a, nangmah zang in putek leh tuailai ka hihzan a, nangmah zang in nungak leh tangval ka hihzan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangmah zang in belamching leh belamhon ka hihzan a, nangmah zang in lou neimi leh bawngtal kop ka hihzan a, nangmah zang in gam ukpipate leh upate ka hihzan sek ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nang mitmuh ngei in Zion tung a a thil hoihlou hih tengteng uh Babulon leh Kaldai mite tung ah ka thuk ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ngai in, lei pumpi hihsia, aw hihsetu tang lian, nang ka hondou ahi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi: Na tung ah ka khut ka lik ding a, kawl sang a kipan ka honkhukkhe ding, tangkang mit khinsain k’on bawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nang a kipan suang ning ding leh suangphum ding lakkhiak ahi nawn kei ding; tangtawn in na segawp zaw ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huai gam ah kidou puanzak tak unla. Namte lak ah pengkul mut un, amah dou ding namte kisa sak unla, Araratte, Minnite, Askenaz gamte, amah sual ding sepaih sep unla, khaupe zuanzang bang mai in sakolte kaikhawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amah dou ding namte kisa sak un, Media kumpipate, ukpipate leh upate, a thuneihna gam tengteng toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huai gam nat thuak in a ling a, Babulon gam, tengmi omlou a hihsiat ding in, Babulon tung a Toupa thiltup ading gige ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Babulon galdoumite’n galkap ding ngapta lou in, a kulhpi uah a ton maimah uh, a pasalphatna uh a khing a, numei bang mai a hong hita ua, a tenna munte a kangkhin a, a deidanna siktawn a kitan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Thangkou tai in midang leng a ki tuahpih a, misawl in leng midang a tuak a, Babulon kumpipa kiang a a khopi ning chih ah a manta uh chih hilh ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lui kannate a man ua, phailuangte a hal siang ua, kidoumite leng a lunglelta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa , Israel Pathian in hichi in a chi: Babulon tanu phual sikngil lai bang ahia, sawtlou nung in buhchil hun a tung ah a hongtung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hon negaita, Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in, hon haizan a, bel vuak lel in a hon bawlta, gulpi bang in hon nawmvalhta, ka thil limte’n a gilpi a dimsak a, a hon paikhe nawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kei leh ka sa tung a hiamgam thilhih, Babulon tung ah om hen; ka sisan Kaldai mite tung ah om hen, Jerusalem in a chi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ngai in, nang lam ah ka pang ding a, na phu k’on laksak ding, a tuipi ka kangsak ding a, a tuikhuk leng ka keugaw sak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huan, Babulon bel hoihlou paihkhawm lel, sehal tenna mun, lamdang sak chiat leh enghou, tengmi omlou mun a honghi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A kikou ton ding ua, humpinelkai lunlai bang in, a ngik tuaktuak ding ua, humpinelkai nou bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A kham mahmah lai un Ankuang ka luisak dia, khothei hetlou in ka khamsak dia, khanglou hetlou ding a a ihmut den theihna ding un, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ka pikhe ding a, belam goh ding bang in, belamtalte keltalte bang mai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Shesak lak ahita ve: lei pumpi pahtawi zel mat in a omta ve, namte lak ah Babulon a segawpta ve:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Babulon tuipiin a tumta, a kihot thupi mahmah in a khuh khinta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A khopi a segawpta a, gamkeu, gamdai, mihing tenlouhna mihing ta kuamah phaklouh gam a hongsuakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Babulon bel ka gawt ding, a valhkhitsa a kam a kipan a suahkhe ding, namte bel a kiang ah a luangkhawm nawn kei ding uh, ahi Babulon kulhpi a chim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ka mite aw, asung a kipan hongpawt unla, Toupa hehna lauhuai mahmah a kipan, michih amau ki humbit chiat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Na lungtang uh bah kei hen, huai gam a thuthang leng lau kei un; kum khat in thuthang a hongtung ding a, kum dang in thuthang a hongtung nawn ding ahi, kumpipa leh kumpipa kisual in gam ah hiamgamna a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Huaiziak in, ngai un, nite a hongtung hi. Babulon milim sektawmte tung a vai ka hawm a, a gam pumpi a zumna ni ding; huan, asung ah a mi thahte a puk ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Huchi in lei leh van leh asung a om tengteng in, Babulon tung a kipak in la a sa ding uh; mallam a kipan simmite a kiang ah a tung ding uh ahi ngal a, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Babulon in Israel mi thahte a puksak bang in Babulon ah gamchih a mi thahte a puk ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Nou namsau pel mite aw, kuan unla, ding maimai kei un, gamlapi a kipan in Toupa theigige unla, na lungsim uah Jerusalem lut hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Gensiatna thu ka zak ziak un ka zum ua, lungdonna in ka mai uh a tuam a, Toupa inn a mun siangthoute ah pautheihlouh mite a honglutta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Huaiziak in ngai un, nite a hongtung hi, chih Toupa thupawt ahi, a milim sektawmte uh tung a ka vaihawmna ding leh a gam pumpi tung a mi liamte thumna ni ding ngei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Babulon bel van sun in sang mahleh, a kulh sangte hihkip mahleh, a tung ah ka kiang a kipan hihsemi a hongtung ding, chih Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Babulon a kipan kah husa leh Kaldai gam a kipan a siatna thupitak husa:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Toupa’n Babulon a sim a, a husa uh thupitak a hih daihsak hi. A gamtat husa uh tui tampi ging hawhaw bang ahi, a awng zuazua ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />A tung ah simmi a hongtung, Babulon tung ngei ah pang ni, a mi hatte mat in a om ua, a thalpeute uh a kitan gawpta, Toupa bel thukna Pathian ahi a, a thuk ngeingei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Huan, a heutute leh a mipilte, a ukpipate leh upate leh mi hatte ka khamsak dia; a lumden ding ua, a khanglou kei ding uh, chih, kumpipa, Sepaihte Toupa thupawt ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Babulon kumpipa kulh bang sahtakte a chimvek ding a, a kongpi sangte a kang vek ding; a mite’n a thawn in a sem ua, namte’n meihal ading lel in a kihihgim uh a na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Zedekiah vaihawm kum lina a Babulon a hohlai a a kiang a hohsam, Seraiah Neriah tapa, Maaseiah tapa kiang a zawlnei Jeremiah thupiak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Seraiah bel kumpipa inn sung heutupen ahia. Jeremiah in Babulon tung a siatna hongtung ding tengteng, Babulon tungtang a hiai thu gelh tengteng laibu ah a gelh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Huan Jeremiah in Seraiah kiang ah, Babulon na tun hun chiang in hiai thu tengteng sim ngeingei inla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Aw Toupa hiai nam tungtang ah kuamah, mi leh sa leh, ten louhna ding suksiata om in, tangtawn a kisegawp zaw ding in thu na genta a, na chi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Huan, hichi a honghi ding a, hiai laibu na sim khit chiang in suang toh gakkhawm in Euphrates lui ah pailut inla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Babulon hichibangmai in a tum ding a, a tung a siatna ka hontut ding ziak in a thou nawn kei ding; a bah mahmah ding uh, chi in na gen ding ahi, a chi a. Hichiteng Jeremiah thu ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zedekiah a vaihawm pattung lai in kum sawmnih leh kum khat a upa ahi a; Jerusalem ah kum sawmlehkhat vai a hawm a; a nu min Hamutal ahi a, Libnah khua a Jeremiah tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jehoiakim hih bangbang in Toupa mitmuh in thil gilou a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa a heh mahmah ziak in Jerusalem leh Judah gam ah a ma a kipan a paihkhiakna khop in thil a hongtungta a; Huchi in Babulon kumpipa tung ah Zedekiah a helta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan, a vaihawm kum kua na ah hichi a honghi a, kha sawmna, huai kha ni sawm ni’n Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar leh a sepaih honte Jerusalem dou ding in a hong kuan ua, buk a bawl khumta ua; a kim ah kulh a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa Zedekiah kum sawm leh khatna tan in khopi um in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kha lina, huai kha ni kua na ah khopi a kial a hong uang mahmah a, gam mipite ading in nekding a omta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in khopi kulh bang a sun vang ua, kidou mi tengteng a taimang ua, kumpipa huan a bang nih kikal a kongpi a pawtin, zanin khopi a kipan a taikhia ua; Kaldai mite khopi a om ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh Kaldai sepaihte’n kumpipa a delh ua, Jeriko phaizang ah Zedekiah a pha ua, sepaih honte a kiang a kipan a dalhzak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in Zedekiah a man ua, Babulon kumpipa kiang ah Hamath gam a Riblah khua ah a paipihta ua; aman a tung ah vai a hawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Babulon kumpipa’n Zedekiah tapate a mitmuh ngei in a that a; Riblah ah Judah heutu tengteng leng a that lai hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zedekiah mit a khelkhia a, Babulon ah a paipih hi; a sih ni tanpha in suangkul ah a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan, Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar kum sawm leh kua na, kha ngana, huai kha ni sawmna ah kumpipa vengpa pawl heutu, Babulon kumpipa ma ading sek, Nebuzaradan Jerusalem ah a honglut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa inn leh kumpipa inn a hal a, Jerusalem inn tengteng toh, inn thupi chitengte mei in a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan, Kaldai sepaih hon tengteng, kumpipa vengpa pawl heutu kiang a omte’n Jerusalem kulhte a kim in a hihchim vek uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in vengpa pawl heutu Nebuzaradan in mipi lak a genthei pawl pente khopi a nutsiatte, Babulon kumpipa kiang a kipesate leh mi khutsiam omsun tengtengte toh sal in a pivekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh vengpa pawl heutu Nebuzaradan in gam a mi genthei pen khenkhatte grephuan kemmi leh vengmi ding in a nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa inn a dalkhuamte leh a kingaknate, dal maiphiatkuang lian Toupa inn a te Kaldai mite’n a hihtam gawp ua, dal tengteng Babulon ah a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Belte leng, vutluahte, khawnvak mihsaknate, maiphiatkuangte, sikkeute, dal tuium-belsuan tengteng a zat sekte uh a la vek uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Noute leng, meivu koihnate, maiphiatkuangte, belte, khawnvak koihnate, sikkeute leh belhbute; dangkaeng a bawl huai dangkasik in vengmi pawl heutu in a la vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khuam nih, dal a bawl bawngtal sawmlehnih, maiphiatna kuang kingakna, kumpipa Solomon in Toupa inn adia a bawl, hiai tuium-belsuan tengteng dal bel kikim a teh ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan, khuamte khuam khat san dan, tong sawmlehgiat ahi a, tong sawmlehnih in a kimvel zou phet ahi; a sahdan zung za delh ahi a, asung a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A tung ah dal lubawk a om a, a lubawk san dan tong nga ahi a, a lubawk kimvel in dalngen a zep leh theibuhfai ahi a; khuam nih in leng hichimah bang in theibuhfai a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A sik ah theibuhfai sawmkua leh guk a om a, a kim a a zepna theibuhfai tengteng za khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huan, vengpa pawl heutu in siampu lian Seraiah leh siampu nihna, Zephaniah leh kongkhak ngakmi thumte a man hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kidou mite tung a heutu dia seh michilgeh leh mi sagih, kumpipa melmu sek mi, khopi a omte leh sepaihheutu gelhmi, gam mite min kempa leh gam mipi lak a mi sawmguk, khopi a na omte khopi a kipan in a pikhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nebuzaradan, vengpa pawl heutu in amau a pia, Babulon kumpipa kiang ah Riblah ah a hontun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Babulon kumpipa’n Hamath gam a Riblah ah amau a bawl ek a, a that vek hi. Huchi in Judah nam a gam ua kipan in sal a pimang in a omta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hiaite Nebukadnezzar in mipi sal a a pite ahi uh: kum sagihna ah Judah sang thum leh sawmnih leh thum;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nebukadnezzar kum sawmlehgiatna ah Jerusalem a kipan in mi za giat leh sawmthum leh nih sal in a pi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nebukadnezzar kum sawmnih leh kum thumna ah Nebuzaradan vengtu pawl heutu in mi za sagih leh sawmli leh za guk a pi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kumpipa saltan kum sawmthum leh sagihna, a kha sawmlehnihna, huai kha ni sawmnih leh nga geih in hichi a honghi a, Babulon kumpipa Evil merodakin a vaihawm kum khatna ah, Judah kumpipa Jehoiakin lutang a dopkang sak a, suangkulh a kipan a pikhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A kiang ah hoihtak in a pau a, Babulon a a kiang a om Kumpipate tutphah sang a sang in mangtutphah a tunsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A suangkulh puansilhte a kikhengsak a, a damsung teng a ma ah a an a ne den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huan amah vakna ding a damsung ni tengteng, a sih ni tan in a ni teng tantuan Babulon kumpipa’n a pe gige hi.
  </para>
</usx>
